&lt;p&gt;As Staff Engineer / Tech Lead Azure/.NET, you&#39;ll own the technical direction of our .NET and Azure platforms - leading the design of scalable, cloud-native solutions across a landscape that spans .NET and PHP-based e-commerce systems. You&#39;ll split your time between hands-on architecture work and technical leadership: driving key engineering decisions, mentoring engineers, and pushing the modernization of our platforms forward. You&#39;ll work closely with Software Engineers, DevOps, QA, and Product, and your decisions will directly shape engineering excellence, reliability, and developer productivity at Klarstein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will do:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture and technical direction of critical services, leading the design and implementation of complex backend and cloud-native solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical investigations, proof of concepts, and modernization/refactoring strategies — identifying technical debt and driving pragmatic long-term platform improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across .NET, PHP, DevOps, QA, Product, and external teams, translating business requirements into scalable technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through design discussions, code reviews, pair programming, and technical coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive engineering excellence — best practices in testing, security, observability, and operational reliability, including incident/root-cause support and contributing to engineering standards and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote AI-assisted engineering practices to improve developer productivity and software quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What we are looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional backend development experience with C# and the .NET ecosystem (ASP.NET Core, .NET 8/10, Entity Framework Core, REST APIs, OpenAPI/Swagger), combined with a strong architectural mindset for designing scalable, resilient distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing cloud-native systems on Microsoft Azure — including microservices, event-driven architecture, asynchronous messaging, and API-first design — with hands-on use of core Azure services (e.g. Service Bus, Event Grid, Azure Functions, App Services, Key Vault, Application Insights)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing secure, cost-optimized cloud architectures (networking, identity/access management, application security), and building production systems with CI/CD, Infrastructure as Code (Terraform preferred), and observability practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with relational and NoSQL databases (SQL Server, Cosmos DB, MongoDB) and working across heterogeneous systems — integrating .NET services, PHP applications, and third-party/enterprise platforms (e.g. SAP, REST/SOAP APIs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record mentoring engineers, leading technical reviews, and driving engineering standards across teams, ideally within Agile, cross-functional environments (Product, DevOps, QA, architects)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nice to have:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-assisted development tools (GitHub Copilot, Claude, Cursor, Windsurf) and using them to improve development, testing, and documentation workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep grounding in clean architecture / domain-driven design principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience integrating with SAP or comparable large-scale enterprise platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40% employer contribution to the company pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 28 days per year working from abroad (EU)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public transport ticket grant &amp;amp; 30% discount on our products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bright, modern, dog-friendly office right on the Spree in Friedrichshain - rooftop views included, four-legged colleagues welcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team breakfast every two weeks - where we actually talk, not just stand-up updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support by a team of highly skilled and dedicated colleagues who celebrate successes together at our company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2005, Klarstein has been developing stylish, functional, and affordable home appliances designed for everyday use, and is now one of Europe’s leading digital brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a consistent end-to-end approach - from product concept and design through quality assurance and marketing to logistics and customer service - Klarstein stands for high quality, reliability, and an excellent price-performance ratio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With approximately 400 employees worldwide, international locations in Europe and Asia, and its own logistics centers, the company serves over 25 million customers in 21 European countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;JOIN THE TEAM!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Become part of our Engineering team and help us build the e-commerce experience our customers rely on. Apply easily through our online application form - our People Team is looking forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;KLARSTEIN (Berlin Brands Group)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Mühlenstraße 25&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;10243 Berlin&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klarstein.com/&quot;&gt;Klarstein – The Story of Innovative Designer Home Appliances&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Team &amp;amp; About Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik’s German Enterprise team protects the data of the country’s leading companies against ransomware, insider threats and operational disruption, and there’s never been a better time to be part of it. Cyber resilience has moved to the top of every CISO and board agenda, and Rubrik is leading that conversation. As a Major Account Executive, you’ll own a small portfolio of Rubrik Germany’s most strategic accounts: DAX-listed groups and global industry leaders. Some are already customers, many are not yet. This is a hunting role at the very top of the market, with the deal sizes, visibility and earning potential that come with it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business across your accounts, from net-new logos to new divisions, subsidiaries and use cases within existing customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through executive outreach, account mapping and multi-threading across buying committees of 20+ stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, long-cycle deals from first conversation to signature, using MEDDPICC to qualify rigorously and forecast accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make cyber resilience a C-suite priority by connecting Rubrik’s platform to NIS2, DORA and the real cost of downtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-sell with leading partners, global system integrators and hyperscalers to open doors and speed up decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand in hand with your dedicated Solutions Engineer, and help shape the Majors playbook as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience You’ll Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive enterprise technology sales experience, ideally in IT infrastructure, cybersecurity, data protection or enterprise SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of winning new business in DAX-listed or comparable multinational enterprises. This role is about creating new business, not just managing or renewing existing relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence that you source your own pipeline: you can show what share of your closed business you generated yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating complex, multi-stakeholder deals at C-level (CISO, CIO, CFO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent or native German and professional English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEDDPICC or a similar structured sales methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships in the German partner ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated industries such as financial services, automotive, manufacturing or critical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with backup, data security or cyber resilience solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CH2 #LI-remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Team &amp;amp; About Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik&#39;s sales organisation is a unified group of elite cross-functional professionals helping companies across every major industry achieve true resilience against cyberattacks, malicious insiders, and operational disruptions. As Named Account Executive in Germany, you&#39;ll own a portfolio of large enterprise accounts, driving Rubrik&#39;s continued expansion in one of Europe&#39;s most dynamic enterprise markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of enterprise accounts across Germany, combining existing customer relationships with new business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run full, multistakeholder sales cycles end to end — from discovery and qualification through solution design, negotiation, and close — across both net-new logo and existing-account expansion deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a high-quality pipeline across your territory, balancing larger strategic opportunities with faster-moving transactional deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive relationships within your accounts, translating Rubrik&#39;s technical capabilities into the board-level priorities that make data security a strategic imperative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Solutions Engineers, Channel Development, and Rubrik&#39;s partner ecosystem to extend reach across your territory and position Rubrik against the full scope of customer risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with and learn from your regional peers — the German team works closely together on deal strategy and account coverage, so you&#39;ll grow fastest by leaning on each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed market intelligence back to Rubrik&#39;s leadership, including competitive signals and account trends that shape our go-to-market approach across Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience You&#39;ll Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing complex enterprise deals, with the appetite to grow into larger, multi-product opportunities — we&#39;ll help you build the rest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record that shows both new-logo acquisition and growing existing customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and professional in English; you engage confidently with both technical buyers and executive stakeholders in either language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of enterprise buying cycles, procurement processes, and multistakeholder decision-making within large or complex organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with channel partners and distributors as part of a broader go-to-market motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly across your territory to build in-person relationships with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in cybersecurity, data protection, backup/recovery, or adjacent infrastructure/cloud categories — candidates who understand the difference between data centre and cloud environments tend to ramp fastest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MEDDPICC as a sales qualification and execution framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships within large German enterprise or Mittelstand organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce for pipeline management and forecast accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CH2 #LI-remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
