&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Key Account Manager (KAM) is a field-based expert, that strategically drives the commercial objectives of selected genetic programs for Germany in the assigned territory. The KAM will be accountable for developing and implementing key account plans in their designated territory to optimize care for patients. The Key Account Manager, reporting to the Area Sales Lead, is expected to develop territory specific strategic account plans in the context of the overall product strategy and in close alignment with functions of Medical Affairs, Patient Advocacy, Market Access and Commercial, while ensuring full compliance with the relevant company, industry, legal, regulatory and ethical standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present a positive image of the company and develop awareness of Alnylam’s RNAi platform with relevant groups of healthcare professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, own, and drive territory and account plans, including customer targeting and cycle plan, in line with Marketing strategy and Business Operations guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve pre-launch and post-launch KPIs, including sales and volume targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use advanced sales skills to ensure consistent and continuous messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform detailed analysis of the assigned territory to identify, assess, and develop relevant centers for diagnosis and treatment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive patient group identification, diagnosis and referral rates by strategic intersectoral referral network management in close cooperation with other field based functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted relationships with a portfolio of customers to ensure market penetration, after developing a thorough understanding of key customer needs and requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the correct products and services are delivered to customers in a timely manner by collaborating with internal stakeholders (commercial, supply chain, and compliance) and external centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain contact with key customers and provide commercial and scientific services to ensure access at site of care, and that logistics are in place to administer product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and execute local meetings to drive diagnosis and treatment rates, in collaboration with the Medical Affairs Team for physicians and other healthcare professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Alnylam at local and national events and congresses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the link of communication between key customers and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise and collaborate with relevant internal staff (Medical Affairs, Sales Director, Marketing, Market Access and Business Operations), as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steer regular local alignment meetings with other field based functions to ensure proper implementation and outcomes against the committed territory and account plans.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timely and accurate reporting and continuous diligent maintenance of the CRM database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct all activities to highest ethical standards in accordance with country code of practice and local Laws and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant domestic travel and occasional international travel as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;University degree in a business-related field such as health or business management or comparable educational background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified to promote medicinal products to national code of practice standard in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of Sales and Key Account Management experience in bio/pharmaceutical sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to gain consistent access and develop strong &amp;amp; professional relationships for product promotion with healthcare providers in reference centers and the community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and influencing skills to engage with professionals at all organizational levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen to add value to the existing health care structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to draw on previous experiences and insights to generate and maintain appropriate awareness and timely access to treatment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel within a territory on a regular basis (80% of the time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Alnylam: &lt;/strong&gt;Alnylam Pharmaceuticals (Nasdaq: ALNY) has led the translation of RNA interference (RNAi) into a whole new class of innovative medicines with the potential to transform the lives of people afflicted with rare and more prevalent diseases. Based on Nobel Prize-winning science, RNAi therapeutics represent a powerful, clinically validated approach to treating diseases at their genetic source by “interfering” with mRNA that cause or contribute to disease. Since our founding in 2002, Alnylam has led the RNAi Revolution and continues to turn scientific possibility into reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our people-first culture is guided by our core values: fiercely innovative, open culture, purposeful urgency, passion for excellence, and commitment to people, and these values influence how we work and the business decisions we make. Thanks to feedback from our employees over the years, we’ve been fortunate to be named a top employer around the world. Alnylam is extremely proud to have been recognized as one of Science Magazine’s Top Biopharma Employers, one of America&#39;s Most Responsible Companies for 2024 by Newsweek, a Fast Company Best Workplace for Innovators, and a Great Place to Work in Canada, France, Italy, Spain, Switzerland, and UK – among others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alnylam, we commit to an inclusive recruitment process and equal employment opportunity. We are dedicated to building an environment where employees can feel that they belong, can bring their authentic selves to work, and achieve to their full potential. By empowering employees to embrace their unique differences at work, our business grows stronger with advanced and original thinking, allowing us to bring groundbreaking medicines to patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before applying, please review Alnylam&#39;s ⁠Candidate&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://alnylampolicies.com/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;regarding how Alnylam handles Personal Data you provide with your application for employment.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At AutoProff, we&#39;re looking for a new colleague&amp;nbsp;to help manage and develop our supplier and transport network across Europe. This is a hands-on role with a mix of operational and commercial responsibilities, where you&#39;ll work closely with suppliers and colleagues across the business to ensure our operations run smoothly and efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our new Senior Transport Manager, you will be responsible for managing supplier relationships, monitoring operational performance, and ensuring our supplier and transport network supports our business across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with internal teams and external suppliers to ensure reliable supplier performance, support day-to-day operations, and identify opportunities to improve the way we work. While you&#39;ll be involved in supplier and transport contracts, you&#39;ll collaborate closely with &lt;strong&gt;AutoScout24&#39;s Procurement team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt; who lead the commercial negotiations and sourcing activities, ensuring a consistent procurement approach across the group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position can be based at our headquarters in &lt;strong&gt;Vejle, Denmark&lt;/strong&gt;, or at our office in &lt;strong&gt;Düsseldorf, Germany&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let&#39;s dive into your key responsibilities, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the daily collaboration with suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor supplier performance and service level agreements (SLAs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up on delayed orders and resolve operational issues together with suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate transport vendors to ensure efficient logistics operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain supplier rebate and kickback agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approve supplier invoices in Coupa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support claims and handle supplier escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure suppliers comply with contractual agreements and internal processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve processes and reduce costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain supplier data, dashboards, KPIs, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Procurement, Operations, Finance, Customer Support, and other internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The need-to-have skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of experience in Supplier Management, Procurement, Logistics, Transport Management, or a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with transport providers and logistics operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing supplier performance and service level agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the ability to use data to support decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with ERP or procurement systems (experience with Coupa is an advantage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage several tasks and priorities at the same time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in English and German or Danish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The nice-to-have skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience from an international technology, marketplace, automotive, or e-commerce company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with transport sourcing and freight procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling supplier claims and disputes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with dashboards and KPI reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy working with both operational tasks and commercial discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build good working relationships with suppliers and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Like solving problems and finding practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a structured way and follow tasks through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable taking responsibility and making decisions within your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you think we could be a match, we&#39;d love to hear from you. Apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AutoProff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AutoProff was founded in 2013 by the experienced car dealer Jesper Ratza in Denmark. The aim was to digitalise B2B used car trading, helping car dealers increase sales and improve profits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;in August 2022, AutoScout24, the leading specialised pan-European online car marketplace, acquired a majority stake in AutoProff. The partnership has supported the rapid expansion of AutoProff&#39;s solutions across Europe and enables the creation of Europe&#39;s first fully integrated C2B-B2B-B2C dealing solution for used cars.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AutoProff, we specialise in providing online B2B used-car dealing solutions designed to improve the buying and selling experience for professional car dealers and their customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With a focus on effective solutions, digitisation and customer service, we are committed to being the home of B2B car dealing for European dealers, including trade-ins cars, retail-ready cars, newer used fleet vehicles and insurance write-offs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the emerging European leader with more than 150,000 B2B used cars on our online trading platforms annually. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Development Director, DACH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Berlin, Düsseldorf or Munich&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company and a proud Great Place to Work® Certified employer in Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Agency Development Director, DACH&lt;/strong&gt; on the DACH Enterprise Advertiser team in our DACH Offices, you’ll play a vital role in supporting and elevating our agency business development in the DACH region, strengthening Taboola&#39;s sales and partnership efforts with new and existing agencies in the market. We need a person who knows how to drive and develop trading partnerships with major global companies and large local agencies in conjunction with the Managing Director and Sales Director. You will be heavily supported by all teams at Taboola (Management, Sales, AM, Product, Finance, Legal, etc.) and you will navigate an internal matrix organization where communication, experience, ability to work with multiple stakeholders and grit are key.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience and extensive knowledge in the digital marketing and ad tech industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep rolodex of senior contacts and decision makers in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, drive and passion to boost an already successful market step onto the next level, collaborating with internal and external stakeholders for a bigger purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding persuasive communication and presentation skills communicating complex solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive and develop trading partnerships with major global companies and large local agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to navigate in an internal matrix organization and collaborate with cross-functional teams (Management, Sales, AM, Product, Finance, Legal, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborating with the Managing Director, Sales Director, Group Account Director and their teams, as well as other stakeholders of the business to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the existing network and expand it to introduce and evangelize Taboola as a must buy partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the service management for all agency trading partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the local teams with the fulfilling of existing partnerships, working with sales, marketing and product to develop existing relationships into longer lasting ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and lead initiatives and influence the teams on the ground to successfully achieve partnerships and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlock new revenue streams to support the market to achieve the quarterly quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify revenue and partnerships opportunities in the market, define and execute plans with the local team to successfully onboard those.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support discussions with media agency decision makers on the tactics of using Taboola for their clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Taboola?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you ask Taboolars what they love about working here, they’ll tell you that they’ve been empowered to realize their full potential while growing and learning from and with smart and talented people. They’ll also share more about:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adam Singolda, Taboola Founder and CEO says;&lt;/strong&gt; “You can copy anything from another business but you can’t copy a company’s culture.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive wellness initiatives, medical support, and local health programs designed to keep you thriving both personally and professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer a hybrid work schedule with 3 days in-office with an option to come in more often if desired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with some of the biggest names:&lt;/strong&gt; Our publisher partners include Yahoo, Conde Nast, Fox Sports, NBCU, ESPN, CBS, and E! Online. Our advertiser clients include Wells Fargo, Honda, Pinterest, and Expedia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to realize your potential?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola is an equal opportunity employer and we value diversity in all forms. We are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and believe such an environment is critical for success. Employment is decided on the basis of qualifications, merit, and business need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about #TaboolaLife on LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, X, YouTube, &amp;amp; the Taboola Life Blog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Taboola&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola empowers businesses to grow through performance advertising technology that goes beyond search and social and delivers measurable outcomes at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola works with thousands of businesses who advertise directly on Realize, Taboola’s powerful ad platform, reaching approximately 600M daily active users across some of the best publishers in the world. Publishers like NBC News, Yahoo, and OEMs such as Samsung, Xiaomi and others use Taboola’s technology to grow audience and revenue, enabling Realize to offer unique data, specialized algorithms, and unmatched scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-KW1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Mid-Market Account Executive DACH, your role is to identify and qualify sales leads, pitch our award-winning software solutions to medium-sized enterprises (4k-10k users), and manage the full sales cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities include, but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing new prospects and expanding existing accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing complex sales cycles with a consultative sales approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning and delivering presentations that give prospective and existing customers insights into how our solutions solve their challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with dedicated pre-sales engineers and other cross-functional team members to help close business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicating new product developments to prospective and existing clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending remote and on-site meetings with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with teams in different territories and offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling opportunities prospected by our Account Specialist team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing and executing effective sales campaigns to ensure maximum penetration of key accounts within your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining an accurate and current pipeline of opportunities within the CRM system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you ready to progress your sales career in the fast-growing tech industry? This position is your opportunity to becoming a high-earning sales executive in a rapid-growing industry. You provide the consultative sales mentality, and we’ll provide you with all the resources that you need to be successful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring to our team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look for people who value agility, passion and teamwork; those who can bring fresh ideas to the table and want the opportunity to learn, grow, and expand their careers. Bring your aptitude and build upon what you do best for our customers, partners, team, and you. You are tasked with bringing in new business. This means you are a creative thinker who is confident and self-motivated with an entrepreneurial mindset. You take pride in seeing your hard work pay off when you see the final results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of previous sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the software/technology industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with executive selling, both business and technical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and listening skills - must be fluent in German &amp;amp; English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determination to surpass performance goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work individually and within a highly collaborative team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plenty of initiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A persuasive manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think on your feet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AvePoint is proud to employ talent from many different backgrounds, experiences, and identities. We believe that diversity and inclusion drives our success and is at the core of how we hire, communicate, and collaborate to deliver value and excellence. We are committed to fostering an environment where people can bring their whole selves to work and feel a sense of belonging, and we continue to work toward creating a workforce that represents the diversity of our customers and communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-SW1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE, ON DEMAND&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal blend of stability and flexibility. A genuinely human employer that cares for people and the planet. True autonomy to shape what comes next, for us and you. This is the perfect platform to take your career where you want.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Back in 2005, we pioneered Europe’s first TV streaming service. Today, we&#39;re a leading TV streaming provider with millions of monthly users, and since 2021 we&#39;ve been ClimatePartner-certified. Over 200 colleagues of 47 nationalities. We’re the grown-up start-up, helping to shape a better future since day one.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;That hasn’t changed, even if the world has. We’re friendly, international, inclusive – and our people say we’re reliable and transparent, too. It’s why they trust us and believe in what we do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Programmatic Sales GSA, you will be responsible for the automated and data-driven sale of our digital advertising inventory (primarily video and CTV) and report directly to the Director Sales All Markets. You will manage programmatic bookings, oversee the planning, implementation and optimisation of our initiatives to boost revenue in programmatic sales, and will therefore also be directly responsible for the optimisation and smooth, technical implementation of campaigns. This makes you the primary point of contact for agency trading desks in the GSA region regarding preferred deals and PMP strategies. You’ll also help with SSP and header bidding integrations and act as the link between Sales, Tech and AdOps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ADS TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ads Team is a small but highly efficient team that combines technology and marketing to win customers over in the long term. With a presence in two countries (based in Berlin, Hamburg and Zurich) and operations in six countries, the Ads Team is a key driver of growth within Zattoo and has established itself as the market leader in CTV in Switzerland within a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquisition of new customers, advice, support and guide media agencies, trading desks and direct clients through our programmatic possibilities in a way they can understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drawing up and negotiating bespoke programme packages, private deals or preferred deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximise inventory revenue, skilfully manage floor prices (minimum prices) and analyse delivery rates and CPMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional sales teams in GSA to consult clients and pitch programmatic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-lead the technical and commercial setup of Header Bidding and additional SSP integrations for CTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-line technical ownership of programmatic delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical errors during delivery, analyse tracking issues and check campaign set-ups: troubleshoot deal delivery, floor pricing, and DSP configuration issues (e.g., SSAI, VAST responses, pod management, DSP/SSP bid stream mismatches).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain complex technical matters in simple terms to non-technical customers or internal departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in Programmatic Advertising, SSP Management, or Programmatic Account Management (strong experience in CTV/Video)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record in the sales of digital advertising products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Google Ad Manager, DSP/SSP workflows, OpenRTB specs, and deal types (Preferred Deals, PMP, PG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or strong technical familiarity with Header Bidding frameworks (e.g., Prebid) and SSP integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network or understanding of the DACH Agency Trading Desk landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent, strong communicator, able to work under pressure, with strong negotiation skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamplayer and creative thinker with a questioning mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHY JOIN US?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Zattoo, you’re always on firm ground with real freedom to explore. You’ll have the support and opportunity you need to go far, while you’re helping us create a sustainable and entertainment-filled future for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward&lt;/strong&gt;: strong market competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recharge&lt;/strong&gt;: 30 days vacation plus public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulate&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;trust based flexible working hours and the option for remote work worldwide for up to 8 weeks per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;sharing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Free access to the best streaming experience on the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re developing: &lt;/strong&gt;Your own development budget, German classes and Zattoo all-company&amp;nbsp;hack days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re inclusive: ‘&lt;/strong&gt;Zattooies’ are a fun, engaged, and diverse team made up of 47 nationalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re healthy:&lt;/strong&gt; Health checks, mental wellbeing support, team sports and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re responsible:&lt;/strong&gt; We are carbon neutral, an active employee Green team, discounted BVG tickets and free bike rentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re sociable: &lt;/strong&gt;A&amp;nbsp;calendar of events with fireside chats, lunches, in-house bar, BBQ’s, monthly socials, summer party and an annual off-site event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zattoo enables our users to view indiscriminately and we reflect that in our team too. Regardless of race, gender, sexual orientation, religion, national origin, age, disability or any other characteristic protected by law we encourage everyone to apply and will give everyone equal consideration. We are an equal opportunities employer — join us and help build a diverse team dedicated to revolutionising the way you watch TV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to ensuring fair, open, and equitable hiring practices and are happy to answer any questions you may have about us or the role throughout the whole process. In line with the EU Pay Transparency Directive, we share the applicable compensation range with you before your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-justify&quot;&gt;You can learn more about us at: &lt;a href=&quot;https://zattoo.com/company/jobs/&quot;&gt;https://zattoo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Your Mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;369&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Model Trains Expert&lt;/strong&gt;, your mission is to bring your specialist model trains expertise to the curation of high-quality, compelling auctions that attract engaged collectors and trusted sellers. Your knowledge of brands, rarity, condition, valuation, and collector expectations is central to ensuring each lot is relevant, accurately assessed, and commercially strong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;580&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;By combining deep category expertise with sound commercial judgement, you play a key role in growing the Model Trains category, maintaining transparency, and strengthening trust within the collector community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;457&quot; data-end=&quot;471&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;475&quot; data-end=&quot;598&quot;&gt;Evaluate and arrange model train lots submitted by users, ensuring each auction features attractive and relevant listings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;601&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;Create compelling weekly lot selections using your expertise and professional network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;691&quot; data-end=&quot;788&quot;&gt;Review titles, descriptions, and images to assess quality and provide accurate estimated values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;791&quot; data-end=&quot;873&quot;&gt;Safeguard transparent and fair transactions through consistent expert evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;876&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot;&gt;Communicate rejections professionally and diplomatically, maintaining strong seller relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;978&quot; data-end=&quot;1069&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales to attract new sellers and diversify the range and quality of lots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1072&quot; data-end=&quot;1159&quot;&gt;Partner with Marketing to increase bidder engagement and visibility for your auctions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;Expert knowledge in Model Trains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1282&quot;&gt;Strong commercial acumen and documented commercial experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1285&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;An eye for trade and value within the collectibles market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1347&quot; data-end=&quot;1436&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to act diplomatically in user disputes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1439&quot; data-end=&quot;1501&quot;&gt;A network of potential sellers and experts within your field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1504&quot; data-end=&quot;1568&quot;&gt;Good computer skills and confidence working with digital tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1616&quot;&gt;Good command of English, written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Where You’ll Be&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1635&quot; data-end=&quot;1772&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;This is a 100% remote role that can be based in the Netherlands, Belgium, France, Germany, Italy, Portugal, Spain, or the United Kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Senior Product Integrity Engineer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SharkNinja&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja is a global product design and technology company with a diversified portfolio of lifestyle solutions that positively impact people’s lives in homes around the world. Powered by two trusted global brands, Shark and Ninja, we bring disruptive innovation to market across multiple product categories, creating products that consumers love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a technically strong, proactive and detail-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Integrity Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our UK team, with a focus on design assurance, engineering validation and product quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Embedded within the New Product Development (NPD) process, you will take ownership of product integrity activities from concept through to production launch, ensuring quality, safety, reliability and consumer expectations are built into the design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with Engineering, Industrial Design, Product Development, Manufacturing and Supply Chain to lead risk assessment and validation activities. You will use engineering judgement, test evidence and consumer insights to challenge designs, resolve risks and influence decisions at critical development milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers broad cross-functional exposure and the opportunity to directly influence whether our products deliver SharkNinja’s 5-star quality standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design assurance and engineering validation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead product integrity input into design reviews, Design Failure Mode and Effects Analysis (DFMEA), design verification and validation planning (DVP&amp;amp;R), and safety reviews throughout the NPD lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the development and delivery of risk-based verification and validation plans, establishing clear test methods, acceptance criteria and evidence requirements aligned with product specifications and applicable UK, European and other target-market requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenge design assumptions and assess product performance, reliability, robustness and foreseeable use conditions, ensuring risks are understood and addressed before tooling and production release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evaluate engineering changes for their impact on quality, safety and performance, defining appropriate revalidation requirements to prevent regression.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review and approve quality-related manufacturing and test documentation within your remit, ensuring requirements are clearly translated into production controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to Design for Manufacture (DFM) reviews, assessing tolerances, process capability and potential sources of manufacturing variation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide evidence-based recommendations on product readiness, escalating unresolved risks and driving corrective action ahead of development milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership and quality governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent product integrity within cross-functional NPD teams, translating consumer expectations and quality requirements into practical engineering decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead quality risk and action reviews, establishing clear ownership, priorities and closure criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Manufacturing, Supply Chain and suppliers to define process controls, quality gates and production acceptance criteria ahead of mass production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead technical investigation of issues identified during prototype, pilot and pre-production builds, coordinating root-cause analysis and verifying corrective action effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenge supplier 8D investigations and corrective action proposals, ensuring conclusions are supported by robust evidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive corrective and preventive action (CAPA) activities addressing design and process gaps, tracking actions through to verified closure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide technical guidance to colleagues and support the development of consistent product integrity practices across programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data analysis and continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyse validation results, build data, test failures and relevant field performance insights to identify emerging risks and prioritise improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define and monitor quality metrics, validation coverage and acceptance criteria throughout the development cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply lessons from existing products to new designs, strengthening test coverage and preventing repeat failures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve validation methods and pre-production quality processes, addressing systemic gaps with sustainable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate validation status, residual risks and corrective action progress clearly to senior management and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A degree in Mechanical Engineering, Product Design Engineering, Quality Engineering or a related discipline, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Substantial relevant engineering experience, typically gained over five or more years, with demonstrated ownership of design verification, validation or product integrity activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Practical experience leading DFMEA, DVP&amp;amp;R, technical design reviews and engineering change assessments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong understanding of product development lifecycles, design and document control, and verification and validation methodologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience translating product requirements and engineering risks into measurable test plans and acceptance criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong technical problem-solving and root-cause analysis skills, with the ability to interpret test data and assess corrective action effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence cross-functional teams, challenge technical decisions constructively and drive issues through to resolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear communication skills, including the ability to explain technical risks and recommendations to engineering teams and senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence managing multiple programmes and competing priorities in a fast-paced development environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Excel, Word and PowerPoint, with experience using data to support engineering decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work independently while collaborating effectively across teams, regions and supplier partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience developing consumer appliances, electromechanical products or other high-volume consumer goods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working within rapid NPD cycles and supporting products through tooling, pilot builds and production launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of reliability engineering, accelerated life testing, statistical analysis or Design of Experiments (DOE).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with supplier quality processes, Production Part Approval Process (PPAP), process capability assessment and incoming quality controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of applicable product safety standards and UK and European product compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience incorporating human factors, usability and foreseeable misuse into product validation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with international manufacturing partners and suppliers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role may require travel within the UK and internationally to support development builds, manufacturing sites and supplier activities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, we don’t just raise the bar—we push past it every single day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Outrageously Extraordinary mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; drives us to tackle the impossible, push boundaries, and deliver results that others only dream of. If you thrive on breaking out of your swim lane, you’ll be right at home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer competitive health insurance, retirement plans, paid time off, employee stock purchase options, wellness programs, SharkNinja product discounts, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower your personal and professional growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with high impact Learning Programs featuring bold voices redefining what’s possible. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join, you’re not just part of a company—you’re part of an outrageously extraordinary community. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;gether, we won’t just launch products—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;we’ll disrupt entire markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion are vital to our global success. Valuing each unique voice and blending all of our diverse skills strengthens SharkNinja’s innovation every day. We support ALL associates in bringing their authentic selves to work, making an impact, and having the opportunity for career acceleration. With help from our leadership, associates, and our community, we aim to have equity be a key component of the SharkNinja DNA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Learn more about us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sharkninja.com/dei&quot;&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/sharkninja/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Life At SharkNinja&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLmRfBxyGu_mKl9SF12lM1NAIx-z07uLNQ&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Outrageously Extraordinary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:336}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
