&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Freenow is an equal opportunity employer and we consider qualified applicants regardless of race, religion, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability or age. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We want you to grow and evolve, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;bring your true self to work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FREENOW:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Freenow by Lyft empowers smarter mobility decisions, helping people to move freely and cities to thrive. Through our multi-mobility app, we feature broad options for everyone across 9 European markets and over 180 cities. Millions of passengers can access services including taxis, private hire vehicles, carsharing, car rental, e-scooters, e-bikes, e-mopeds, and public transport within a single app.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In July 2025 Freenow was acquired by Lyft, a global mobility platform, which connects riders and drivers for billions of rides across North America and Europe. Together, Freenow and Lyft are creating a more caring and connected world, with transportation for everyone. We are a global, diverse, highly motivated, and collaborative team that strives for excellence and likes to have fun. Ready for your next ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.de/%C3%9Cberblick/Arbeit-bei-FREE-NOW-EI_IE954578.11,19.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/bltadef6ed7354e9cc4/65a10957984e23040a418da6/glassdoor-logotype-rgb_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kununu.com/de/mytaxi-intelligent-apps&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/blte53af231aaa0c840/65a109382311a30407ba07ce/kununu_logo_black_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/free-now/life/2b1603ea-741a-49f8-9847-f1214f483a1a/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://brand.linkedin.com/content/dam/me/business/en-us/amp/brand-site/v2/bg/LI-Logo.svg.original.svg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;143&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI coding is the largest use case of enterprise AI adoption today, as is evident from the success of Anthropic on Claude Code, Cursor’s $60B exit to SpaceX, and Cognition’s $48B valuation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The bottleneck now has moved from code generation to security and safety - AI agents write code faster than any team can review it, and over 65% of the lines of code produced by them are insecure. Vulnerabilities are piling up 16x faster than companies can fix them, and adversaries are able to exploit these new vulnerabilities within hours.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;AURI by Endor Labs closes that gap. It runs inside the harness where coding agents work, through hooks, skills and MCP, so the controls sit outside the model and every agent action is visible. Underneath is our patented code context graph, which maps code, open source, containers and infrastructure. It shows which vulnerabilities can actually be reached and exploited, then delivers fixes that won’t break the application. Security teams get evidence instead of noise, and developers get fixes instead of tickets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The companies building AI trust us to secure it - our customers include OpenAI, SpaceX, DoorDash, Dropbox, Atlassian, MongoDB, Snowflake, Robinhood and Peloton to name a few.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Endor Labs is the third company from Founder &amp;amp; CEO Varun Badhwar, who built Prisma Cloud, the platform that helped define cloud security, from $0 to $300M ARR at Palo Alto Networks. We’ve raised $163M from Lightspeed, Coatue, DFJ Growth, Salesforce Ventures and Dell Technologies Capital.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Software runs everything around our lives today - banking, hospitals, airports and power grids. AI now writes more of it every day, and our mission is to make sure the world can trust that software. Come build that future with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;How-You’ll-Make-an-Impact&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;876&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Architect at Endor Labs, you&#39;re at the heart of connecting our innovative team with our diverse and dynamic customers. Every day presents a new set of exciting challenges and opportunities to make a significant impact:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educate with Enthusiasm:&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate awareness about Application Security and Software Supply Chain Security. It&#39;s about making security engaging and accessible to developers everywhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Our Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep dive into our supply chain security product suite and emerge as the go-to expert and evangelist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Tailored Demos:&lt;/strong&gt; Showcase our solutions in a way that speaks directly to the needs and challenges of our customers. Be the architect of captivating, solution-oriented presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Customer Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with our engineering and product teams to design solutions that genuinely address customer challenges. Your insights from the field will directly influence our product development, ensuring we always meet our customers&#39; evolving needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate Customer Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide customers through onboarding, ensuring a smooth transition and adoption of the Endor Labs solution. Your goal is to empower customers to leverage our technology fully and ensure they achieve their security and development objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on the hunt for someone who is not just looking for a job but likes a bit of adventure, too! You&#39;ll fit right in if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;poqw43&quot; data-start=&quot;297&quot; data-end=&quot;491&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Rich Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience in pre-sales or a similar customer-facing, technical role. You&#39;re no stranger to technical deep dives, product demonstrations, and leading evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hrgdhb&quot; data-start=&quot;493&quot; data-end=&quot;841&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;495&quot; data-end=&quot;527&quot;&gt;Strong Technical Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; A solid understanding of modern software development practices, including backend or full-stack development experience, CI/CD pipelines, Git-based development workflows, and DevOps tooling. You’re comfortable engaging deeply with engineering teams and understanding how modern applications are built and deployed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;44alsd&quot; data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;1108&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot;&gt;Application Security Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with application security concepts, software supply chain security, and/or identity &amp;amp; access management principles. You understand the importance of securing developer workflows and modern cloud-native environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xiq5d5&quot; data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;Tech Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; A robust understanding of the Developer, DevOps, Application Security, and open-source ecosystems. Hopefully, you can meet developers where they are and flex some programming skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;otuo74&quot; data-start=&quot;1312&quot; data-end=&quot;1493&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1314&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Sales Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve successfully engaged with technical customers at an Enterprise level and know how to articulate complex solutions and operate in a sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;roopa0&quot; data-start=&quot;1495&quot; data-end=&quot;1625&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1497&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;Curious and Eager to Learn:&lt;/strong&gt; Always on the lookout for new technologies and understanding the intricacies of how things work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12ecp9k&quot; data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1629&quot; data-end=&quot;1654&quot;&gt;Collaborative Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in a team setting and value diversity and inclusion in every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;25v10y&quot; data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1743&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Action-oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; You prefer actively solving customer problems and asking for help as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us... Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go to extraordinary lengths to distinguish ourselves through world-class work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize quality over speed, and speed over scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to work with deeply kind, mission-driven people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strive to make the complex simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use first principles to debate ideas, test assumptions, and make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek the truth by putting data above opinions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assume good intent and give tactical feedback to help each other get better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold no ego—when our customers win, we all win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and comprehensive benefits package including Health, Dental, Vision and Mental Health plans.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan to support your longterm financial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO to maintain a healthy work-life balance (we want you here for the long-haul!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for co-working and team meetups to foster collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office environment for those who love to bring their fur babies along.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endor Labs is an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. Even if you don&#39;t fit every requirement above, we believe in the power of diverse perspectives and experiences, so we encourage all talented individuals to apply—there&#39;s no one-size-fits-all here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4857&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Compensation: &lt;/strong&gt;For candidates who receive an offer for this position, the compensation range is expected to be between $190,000 - $250,000. This may include additional incentives such as commission targets, restricted stock units, and/or bonuses, depending on the role.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are a diverse team of 40+ healthcare communications specialists who thrive on curiosity, the thrill of a challenge, good old-fashioned fun and working in partnership with clients to improve the health of the world, one brilliant idea at a time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We deliver global, EMEA and UK integrated marketing communications solutions for many of the world’s leading healthcare companies. Our breadth of work is limitless, as we challenge ourselves to innovate in all that we do and really make a difference. If it’s led by solid-insight or data, nothing is out of reach; from traditional media campaigns, data communications and brand launches, to multi-channel digital and social media programmes, to influencer campaigns and disease awareness initiatives, to patient apps or patient advocacy partnerships, to multi-award-winning corporate re-positioning videos and crisis management, the list is endless.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are very proud to have been awarded the EMEA Healthcare Consultancy of the Year for a few years running, as well as having received awards across the board in Social Media, PR, Marketing, Innovation, Digital and Influencer categories – an accolade to be proud of when pitted against some of the best consumer campaigns from less-regulated industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that working here is a chance to change lives, including your own. We’re a super supportive team with a warm, friendly and social culture. Through our solid PDP process and ongoing training and support, we pride ourselves on nurturing our people to be their very best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our London Office&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Burson employs over 450 people in the UK, and our stunning Southwark offices run over two floors as part of the larger WPP Campus, Rose Court. We have access to a beautiful roof terrace with panoramic views across London and a bar/restaurant area, which is a great spot for client meetings and socialising with the wider agency and other WPP OpCo’s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;62&quot; data-end=&quot;137&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;137&quot;&gt;Bring enthusiasm for the intersection of communications and healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;138&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;Join a dynamic, fast-paced team environment at Burson.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;197&quot; data-end=&quot;274&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;274&quot;&gt;Start your career strong as an Account Executive with structured support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;353&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;277&quot; data-end=&quot;353&quot;&gt;Assist with essential account administration for client and team projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;354&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;Learn on the job under the guidance of experienced managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;419&quot; data-end=&quot;486&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;486&quot;&gt;Stay updated on industry news and understand its client impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;489&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Show a strong interest in healthcare and media trends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;51&quot; data-end=&quot;143&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;53&quot; data-end=&quot;143&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;53&quot; data-end=&quot;74&quot;&gt;Team Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;: Show a can-do attitude, flexibility, and eagerness to contribute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;144&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;146&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;146&quot; data-end=&quot;172&quot;&gt;Account Administration&lt;/strong&gt;: Deliver high-quality, proactive support to improve account efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;247&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;249&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;249&quot; data-end=&quot;270&quot;&gt;Programme Support&lt;/strong&gt;: Take ownership of specific tasks to aid campaign execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;414&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;336&quot; data-end=&quot;414&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;336&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;Skills Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Build core PR and integrated marketing competencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;415&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;417&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;417&quot; data-end=&quot;437&quot;&gt;Media Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Support media outreach and response activities effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;501&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;520&quot;&gt;Digital Media&lt;/strong&gt;: Develop knowledge of digital and social media tools to enhance client work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;600&quot; data-end=&quot;698&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;698&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;615&quot;&gt;Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide accurate, timely reporting to document and communicate client activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;699&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;701&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;701&quot; data-end=&quot;734&quot;&gt;Research &amp;amp; Content Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Manage client materials efficiently and conduct strong desk research to support proposals and media opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-NE1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;À propos du poste&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) Head of Integrated Marketing France pour rejoindre notre équipe Marketing France, basée à Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché(e) à la Head of Marketing France, vous piloterez l&#39;une des trois équipes Marketing du marché français et managerez une équipe de 3 personnes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre mission : être le point de connexion entre la stratégie Global et son exécution sur le marché France, en fédérant l&#39;ensemble des parties prenantes autour d&#39;une vision marketing claire, cadrée et exécutée dans les temps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À la croisée de la stratégie, de l&#39;orchestration et de l&#39;exécution, vous porterez la vision marketing France auprès du Global et des instances exécutives locales, tout en veillant à ce que chaque campagne — globale ou locale — soit livrée avec excellence et dans les délais. Vous piloterez également le programme de fidélité en France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Vos missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et porter la vision stratégique marketing France, en s&#39;appuyant sur une compréhension fine de la stratégie Global et en assurant sa traduction pertinente sur le marché français (spécificités locales : créa, moments de consommation, culture...).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être l&#39;interlocuteur constructif du Global : savoir s&#39;intégrer dans une stratégie globale tout en la challengeant de façon argumentée lorsque les spécificités françaises le nécessitent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fédérer l&#39;ensemble des pôles (Sales, Brand &amp;amp; Media, Creative, CRM, Analytics, Global...) pour s&#39;assurer que chacun travaille vers les mêmes objectifs et dans le même calendrier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter et sécuriser le calendrier de livraison des campagnes (globales et locales) : brief à temps, validation des plans média, validation brand, etc., pour garantir une exécution sans accroc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplifier et cadrer des sujets complexes impliquant de multiples parties prenantes, en faisant émerger les décisions à prendre et en portant les recommandations qui en découlent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formaliser et présenter la vision et la performance marketing France à un niveau exécutif, avec clarté et impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter le programme de fidélité en France, en garantissant sa cohérence avec la stratégie marketing globale et les priorités business locales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégrer l&#39;IA dans les méthodes de travail de l&#39;équipe, pour gagner en efficacité et en qualité d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager et développer une équipe de 3 personnes, en apportant vision, coaching, structure et exigence d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Le profil recherché&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes un(e) leader marketing structuré(e), reconnu(e) pour votre capacité à simplifier des sujets complexes multi-stakeholders et à faire en sorte que les choses avancent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous apportez notamment :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 ans et plus d&#39;expérience en marketing, avec une expérience significative dans des environnements matriciels et multi-marchés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une capacité avérée à travailler à l&#39;interface du Global et du Local, en sachant à la fois s&#39;aligner sur une stratégie globale et la challenger de façon constructive quand nécessaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un leadership naturel pour fédérer, cadrer et orchestrer des sujets impliquant de nombreuses parties prenantes, sans lien hiérarchique direct sur la plupart d&#39;entre elles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une forte capacité de formalisation et de communication, notamment pour porter une vision ou une recommandation devant un public exécutif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une orientation PMO marquée : rigueur, sens du détail, capacité à garder le contrôle sur des plannings complexes et à faire respecter les délais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une appétence pour l&#39;IA et son intégration dans les méthodes de travail marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience réussie en management et dans le développement de talents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une maîtrise courante du français et de l&#39;anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Les compétences qui feront votre réussite&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership et fédération d&#39;équipes transverses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplification et cadrage de sujets complexes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sens de l&#39;organisation et rigueur (PMO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à challenger de façon constructive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication et formalisation à niveau exécutif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestion de projet et respect des délais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appétence pour l&#39;IA et les nouveaux outils&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management et développement de talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance du média (brand et performance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orientation business, à l&#39;aise avec la data et le reporting chiffré&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Airship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship is trusted by world’s leading brands such as Alaska Airlines, BBC and The Home Depot to drive revenue growth and customer loyalty with exceptional cross-channel customer experiences. Today, brands are challenged to deliver seamless, unified customer experiences across a fragmented array of channels and devices— apps, websites, email, SMS, wallets and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship’s no-code, AI-powered platform was designed with non-technical, growth-focused teams in mind, making it easy to create, test and orchestrate hyper-personalized experiences across all channels. With the ability to easily enrich customer data and rapidly launch growth experiments, Airship enables brands to deliver consistent, meaningful interactions that accelerate conversion and foster deeper customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invite you to be part of our journey in building products and delivering services that touch millions of customers around the world every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about us, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.airship.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3xEidfNT5kaSMR1LbqH2tz&quot;&gt;www.airship.com&lt;/a&gt;, read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/blog/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.airship.com/blog/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2S7rp6uesS3WbpmG9CFOaR&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt; or follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/airship-social&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/airship-social&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2T3DnwhcK_pt63jzkrYdK6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Backend Java Engineer, you will design, develop, and support distributed systems that&amp;nbsp;combine scale with high reliability. You will work on low-latency services that process&amp;nbsp;continuous event streams and support analytical workloads across terabytes of data.&amp;nbsp;Our backend infrastructure runs on Google Cloud Platform. It uses Java-based microservices&amp;nbsp;and SQL and NoSQL databases. You will join a core engineering team that shapes Airship’s&amp;nbsp;technical foundations and engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data schemas and take ownership of data semantics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, improve, and scale Java APIs and distributed services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate performance issues using server metrics, application data, and system&amp;nbsp;behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, testability, and maintainability of our backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and engineering teams on technical design and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define technical standards across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and own large-scale releases and technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI as a technical assistant to draft development plans and investigate problems or&amp;nbsp;bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critically assess AI-generated suggestions for accuracy, security, and suitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duties and responsibilities described are not comprehensive. Additional tasks may be&amp;nbsp;assigned, or the role’s scope may change based on business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least three years of experience designing, operating, and maintaining distributed&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in spoken and written French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Java development skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with unit testing, code reviews, documentation, and Git-based version&amp;nbsp;control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading significant releases or technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with continuous integration and continuous delivery practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and pragmatic approach to software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to building reliable, maintainable, and testable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d Be Delighted If You Also Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting and improving JVM performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Cloud Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of distributed NoSQL databases or key-value stores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux administration fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Work Location &amp;amp; Travel Requirements&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship’s ‘Digital First’ approach to work means that for the majority of our roles, work can be performed remotely, either some or most of the time. Airship believes that flexible work contributes to a more productive and more equitable work environment, and that Airshippers are able to collaborate, innovate, and support one another across different locations and timezones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some roles may require that employees perform their work from a specific location to support business activities, and/or be within proximity to an Airship office location or customer or partner locations, while other roles can be performed 100% remotely.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is &lt;strong&gt;fully remote&lt;/strong&gt; and may require &lt;strong&gt;up to 10%&lt;/strong&gt; travel based on business needs or as requested by your manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Compensation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting pay may vary based on factors such as relevant skills, work experience, market demands, and location. All offers include stock options so employees have the opportunity to benefit from Airship’s success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance options for you and your dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off, paid holidays, paid parental leave, and paid volunteer time off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for your overall wellbeing with employer-subsidized mental health and employee wellness programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A digital-first work environment and a monthly stipend to support remote work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship and growth opportunities to build skills and accelerate professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;AI in Recruiting&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use artificial intelligence tools in our recruitment process as decision-support tools only. Airship&#39;s People Operations team reviews all AI-generated scores and recommendations before making any hiring determination. No applicant is rejected solely on the basis of an AI-generated output.&amp;nbsp;Depending on your location, you may have the right to request human review of any AI-assisted employment decision or to opt out of AI evaluation. To make a request or learn more about how we use AI in hiring, contact &lt;a ----- ----- or visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://airship.com/legal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;airship.com/legal&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;View our EU and UK Candidate Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/legal/eu-and-uk-candidate-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**&lt;strong&gt;Please Note:&lt;/strong&gt; To ensure the security of your personal information, Airship will only contact candidates through email addresses ending with ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Hiring Commitment&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship is committed to fostering a diverse work environment and providing equal employment opportunities to all applicants and employees. We welcome your application and our hiring and employment decisions are made irrespective of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status or any other characteristic protected by law. In alignment with our commitment to equal opportunity, Airship will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with criminal histories, in a way that adheres to the principles of fairness and the requirements of local Fair Chance laws, where applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;By submitting this application, I affirm that the facts set forth in it are true and complete to the best of my knowledge. I understand that if I am employed, false statements, omissions, or misleading information given in my application, interview(s), or in a background check may result in dismissal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Indépendant | Rémunération à la commission uniquement | Territoire de vente local | Commissions déplafonnées&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;À propos de l’opportunité&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons des commerciaux terrain expérimentés, à l’aise pour se rendre dans une entreprise, engager la conversation avec le propriétaire et convaincre de nouveaux commerçants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que conseiller commercial itinérant indépendant, vous vendrez les solutions de paiement, de point de vente et logicielles de SumUp aux petites et moyennes entreprises de votre région. Vous identifierez vous-même vos prospects, gérerez votre portefeuille d’opportunités et accompagnerez les clients lors de leur mise en route.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous devrez justifier d’une expérience en prospection à froid et apprécier la vente en face à face sur le terrain. Vous gérerez votre propre activité et organiserez vos démarches commerciales de manière autonome, tout en bénéficiant de la formation et du soutien de SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Vos missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trouver de nouveaux clients grâce à des visites en face à face, de la prospection en porte-à-porte et des démarches directes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cibler les entreprises locales générant d’importants volumes de paiement et susceptibles de tirer parti des produits SumUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Poser des questions sur le fonctionnement de chaque entreprise et recommander des solutions adaptées en matière de paiement, de matériel, de caisse et de logiciels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer le processus de vente depuis le premier échange, en passant par les démonstrations de produits, la gestion des objections et la conclusion, dans le cadre du partenariat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider les clients à mettre en place et à commencer à utiliser leurs produits SumUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Établir des relations avec les chefs d’entreprise et demander des recommandations aux clients satisfaits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planifier vos visites et vos suivis afin d’optimiser votre temps sur le terrain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre votre activité, vos opportunités et vos résultats de vente, et transmettre les informations nécessaires au traitement des ventes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Échanger avec votre interlocuteur SumUp pour bénéficier de son expertise produit et de conseils commerciaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ce que nous recherchons&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Indispensable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Au moins un an d’expérience dans la vente sur le terrain dans des secteurs tels que les télécommunications, l’énergie, les technologies d’entreprise, la gestion des déchets, les systèmes de sécurité ou l’approvisionnement en produits alimentaires et boissons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience de la prospection à froid, notamment en démarchant des entreprises en face à face et en trouvant vos propres prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience de la vente auprès de petites et moyennes entreprises et des relations directes avec les propriétaires ou les décideurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des résultats démontrables en matière d’acquisition de nouveaux clients et d’atteinte d’objectifs commerciaux. Nous vous demanderons des exemples de vos réalisations et de la manière dont vous y êtes parvenu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La capacité à gérer un processus de vente de la première prise de contact à la conclusion, y compris la gestion des questions et des objections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un bon sens de l’organisation et un suivi rigoureux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La capacité à gérer les refus, à tirer les leçons des retours d’expérience et à persévérer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une bonne compréhension du statut d’indépendant et la volonté de développer votre portefeuille de clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La capacité à vous déplacer sur votre territoire de vente afin de rencontrer régulièrement vos prospects et clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Atouts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un réseau existant de chefs d’entreprise locaux susceptibles de bénéficier des produits SumUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience dans le domaine des paiements, des services aux commerçants ou des systèmes de point de vente.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience de la vente par téléphone est un atout, mais vous devez également avoir vendu en face à face sur le terrain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Rémunération&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il s’agit d’une activité indépendante, rémunérée exclusivement à la commission, sans salaire de base ni revenu minimum garanti. Les commissions sont déplafonnées et dépendent de vos résultats commerciaux et de l’activité des commerçants apportés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le système de commissions comprend, dans le cadre des conditions Partner :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paiements : 50 % du revenu net annualisé lié aux transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel : 50 % du prix de vente retenu dans le barème.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logiciels et abonnements : 50 % du montant annuel retenu dans le barème.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenu résiduel : 20 % du revenu net mensuel généré par les commerçants apportés, pendant une durée maximale de trois ans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avantage de bienvenue : trois fois le montant habituel des commissions résiduelles pendant les trois premiers mois.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primes supplémentaires liées à certains produits ou opérations commerciales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les nouveaux partenaires bénéficient des conditions Partner pendant la période de lancement. Leur maintien est ensuite soumis aux critères d’activité du programme ; un barème Agent de 40 %, sans commissions résiduelles, peut s’appliquer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les conditions d’éligibilité, les bases de calcul et les modalités de versement sont précisées dans le contrat et présentées avant tout engagement. Les commissions s’entendent avant déduction de vos frais professionnels, cotisations sociales et impôts applicables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Formation et accompagnement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous vous aiderons à vous familiariser avec les produits et leur commercialisation grâce à un parcours initial et à un accompagnement continu couvrant la prospection, les entretiens de vente, les démonstrations, la gestion des objections et l’accompagnement des clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les modalités du parcours initial et les prérequis à la commercialisation vous seront communiqués avant le démarrage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre interlocuteur SumUp vous apportera également son soutien en matière de développement territorial, d’analyse de vos opportunités et de conseils commerciaux, dans le respect de votre autonomie d’organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Commercial terrain, Commercial itinérant, Sales, Freelance, Vente, Commercial B2B, Commercial indépendant, Développement commercial.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

Before jumping into all the information about the role and what you can bring to the table, let us introduce ourselves real quick.About usInsider One is the #1 platform that brings everything marketing and customer engagement teams need in one place so they can reach their peak potential and become unstoppable.&nbsp;Our story began with six desks and a vision to create a single platform to make industry-first technologies and emerging channels accessible to marketers worldwide. Today, Insider One is powered by 1,500+ team members representing 50+ nationalities across 30+ offices.&nbsp; With AI at its core and an integrated Customer Data Platform (CDP), Insider One unites data, personalization, and journey orchestration across the most extensive set of natively supported channels, including WhatsApp, SMS, Email, Web, App, and Site Search.&nbsp;We recently raised one of the largest funding rounds in the industry, a $500M Series E led by General Atlantic. We are backed by top-notch investors, including Sequoia Capital, QIA, Riverwood, and Endeavor Catalyst, and trusted by 2000+ customers from high-growth startups to the most prestigious Fortune 500 companies such as Samsung, Nike, L’Oreal, Singapore Airlines, Nestlé, Nissan, Lenovo, Puma, IKEA, Allianz, Domino's, and the list goes on.Insider One was congratulated for becoming one of the only woman-founded, women-led B2B SaaS unicorns in the world. Loved by customers, recognized by analysts, we are the only vendor recognized as the #1 leader in all the capabilities marketing and customer engagement teams need. Don’t just take our word for it — see for yourself. We consistently outperform and continue our leadership, and&nbsp;the results speak for themselves.From day one, Insider One’s mission has not only been to build a world-class product company, but also to create one of the most socially progressive technology communities in the world. Through our social responsibility initiatives like 100 Social Responsibility Projects, AI Training for Teachers, Code Academy, SheCodes, SheLeads, and SheMarkables, our community has committed to scaling its impact on our communities across 30+ countries, driving initiatives in health, education, farming, animal rights, and increasing women’s representation in STEM.Behind all these achievements is an exceptionally talented, visionary team of overachievers that moves fast and agile, creating cutting-edge products, and focuses on making an impact. If you want to be a part of this journey, just keep reading.What You Will Do:

You’ll be the face of Insider One to our clients! You’ll be the bridge between their needs and our technology.&nbsp;
Help our clients understand their needs and which of our features and products best match their goals and expectations.&nbsp;
Make sure our clients are utilizing our technology at its best so that we can fully provide them our world-class service.&nbsp;
You’ll monitor and facilitate the customer's adoption of our technology.&nbsp;
Work with our data-geeks (a.k.a. engineers and developers) and product specialists whenever it’s required to make sure the client has full tech support, if necessary.&nbsp;
Develop and maintain key account plans that identify opportunities to boost the value we’re looking to add to our clients’ organization.&nbsp;
Proactively provide constant feedback to your team on market trends, unmet needs, and opportunities to create a bigger impact on our partnership with our client.&nbsp;
Establish a trusted advisor relationship that ensures our customer's overall satisfaction with our services and technology.
Plan strategies to help the customers meet their objectives, prioritizing and driving resolution on escalated customer issues. Bring new product ideas to the table!&nbsp;

What You Will Need:

Previous work experience in customer-facing roles, such as customer success, account management, or strategic consulting. Show us that you’ve got what it takes to collaborate and build strong relationships with customers, especially at the executive level.&nbsp;
Solid oral and written communication abilities, with positive and energetic phone skills and excellent listening skills.&nbsp;
We’ve got clients all over the world! Be a self-motivated and savvy tech bug, always in search of savvy solutions and ideas to improve our relationship with our clients.&nbsp;
Cherish one of our core ethos: care. You’ll need to care for our clients and make sure they feel at home with our products and our assistance. Superior project and time management skills. A keen eye for detail is a plus!&nbsp;
Passion for testing, measuring, and improving outreach and follow-up effectiveness.&nbsp;
The ability and flexibility to work in a fast-paced startup environment.&nbsp;
Strong communication skills in English and Italian.

What We Offer:

Be part of a diverse team that’s as global as it gets — where every voice is heard and 50+ nationalities build together.
Level up with internal trainings covering AI fundamentals, coding, foreign languages, and a wide range of personal development skills.
Feed your curiosity with access to Spotify, LinkedIn Learning, Blinkist, MasterClass, and CloudGuru.
Become a Shareowner through our eligibility-based “ESOP” and own a piece of what you build.
Help build the team you want to work with and enjoy rewarding referral bonuses.
Opportunities to give back to your community through volunteering and purpose-driven social impact projects.
From global retreats to team-building activities, expect year-round events that turn into lifelong memories.


We aren't just hiring for a position; we are hiring for a mission — a mission to build a lasting legacy that will set the benchmark for the most progressive tech companies out there.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
To do this, we are looking for the exceptional talent to join a community of good-hearted individuals who take high ownership and are relentlessly driven to go the extra mile.
&nbsp;
If this sounds like who you are and where you aspire to be, we are excited to meet you.
We provide equal opportunity in a zero-discrimination workplace and not just welcome but also embrace everyone without regard to sex, race, color, nationality, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability status, citizenship, or marital status.Please follow Insider One on LinkedIn, Instagram, X, Facebook and Medium!Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Manager – E-Commerce Web Upper Funnel [Permanent - CDI] (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris or Lille, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Decathlon E-Commerce Web – Scope Upper Funnel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of Decathlon’s global digital ecosystem, our &lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web&lt;/strong&gt; team builds the online destination for millions of sports lovers worldwide. The &lt;strong&gt;Upper Funnel&lt;/strong&gt; scope is the front door of our digital experience: from landing on the homepage and navigating categories, to discovering products via search, AI-driven recommendations, conversational shopping, retail media placements, and inspiring content. Our mission is to seamlessly guide users from inspiration to intent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining this high-traffic Web Product organization means operating at massive scale where speed, discovery excellence, SEO, targeted monetization, and next-gen personalized user journeys drive our everyday business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Manager – Upper Funnel&lt;/strong&gt;, you will provide the strategic direction, functional architecture, and product leadership needed to scale and modernize the discovery and exploration experience across Decathlon&#39;s web platform. Operating with high autonomy, you will address complex challenges across search performance, catalog structuring, retail media integration, and emerging AI paradigm shifts like conversational interface models and agentic workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission centers on 4 strategic pillars:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Strategic Alignment, Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Upper Funnel Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Holistic Discovery &amp;amp; Engagement Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Define and drive the strategic vision for upper funnel web touchpoints (Homepage, Category/Listing Pages, Search Engine, Navigation Taxonomy, Retail Media Ad Placements, Conversational Assistants, and Inspiration Hubs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with global business directors, commercial/merchandising leads, SEO specialists, retail media monetization teams, and AI platform engineering leads to align executive leadership around major web platform shifts and discovery roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Macro Metrics &amp;amp; Funnel Performance&lt;/strong&gt;: Track, measure, and optimize key upper funnel metrics across the customer journey: Organic/Direct Traffic, Search CTR, Category Depth, Conversational Engagement &amp;amp; Intent Resolution Rate, Ad Yield/eCPM, Bounce Rate, Product Detail Page (PDP) Click-through Rate, and Top-of-Funnel Conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Web Ecosystem Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Functional Architect&lt;/strong&gt;: Define boundary maps and functional scope across web squads (Search &amp;amp; Conversational Discovery, Taxonomy &amp;amp; Merchandising, Personalization/Recommendations, Retail Media &amp;amp; Sponsored Listings) to eliminate overlap and friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tight Triad Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Work in close sync with Staff/Principal Web Engineers and Staff UX/UI Designers to align frontend performance (Core Web Vitals), modular web design systems, micro-frontend architecture, conversational UI patterns, and backend search/ad-serving APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seamless Omnichannel &amp;amp; Funnel Handoff&lt;/strong&gt;: Ensure fluid transitions from external acquisition channels into the web upper funnel, balancing organic product discovery and agentic assistance with sponsored/retail media inventory while designing seamless handoffs toward the lower funnel (PDP, Cart &amp;amp; Checkout).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Strategic Sparring &amp;amp; Product De-Risking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trusted Strategic Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as a sparring partner for Group Product Managers (GPMs) and Product Managers (PMs) within the Web &amp;amp; E-Commerce domain, helping them navigate complex search algorithms, LLM agent architectures, ad server integrations, taxonomy dependencies, and high-volume web constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De-Risking High-Stakes Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;: Formulate and execute validation strategies for high-risk discovery and monetization concepts (e.g., visual/voice search, conversational product advisors, agentic auto-replenishment/bundles, sponsored product placements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Experimentation at Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: Design and lead high-volume A/B and multivariate testing strategies, balancing conversational interaction models and ad impression density against organic conversion performance using CRO frameworks and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Elevating Product Craft &amp;amp; Modern Web Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-First, Agentic &amp;amp; Monetization Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Champion the organizational adoption of cloud-native AI platforms (e.g., Google Vertex AI), conversational frameworks, agentic e-commerce patterns, and modern retail media capabilities to amplify both user experience and platform revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web Craft &amp;amp; Best Practices&lt;/strong&gt;: Upskill the PM community in modern web product practices, continuous discovery frameworks, technical web performance optimization, and data-informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Multiplier&lt;/strong&gt;: Elevate the overall bar of the Product Management organization as a thought leader without acting as a direct line manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE TABLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web Scale (7+ years)&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven track record in Product Management with hands-on experience scaling high-traffic e-commerce web platforms (Upper Funnel, Search, Merchandising, or Navigation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upper Funnel &amp;amp; SEO Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep understanding of top-of-funnel mechanics, technical SEO, site search algorithms, taxonomy design, and conversion rate optimization (CRO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Discovery Mastery&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong expertise in web analytics (GA4/Amplitude/Contentsquare), high-traffic A/B testing frameworks, quantitative/qualitative user research, and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Scoping&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to decompose complex e-commerce catalog, ad-tech, and AI/search problems into modular MVP/V0/V1 execution strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Storytelling &amp;amp; Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Exceptional ability to translate complex search/agentic architectures, retail media revenue drivers, UX metrics, and conversion data into compelling narratives for executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Pluses &amp;amp; Emerging Tech Strengths&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Google Vertex AI&lt;/strong&gt;: Practical experience using Google Vertex AI (for Search, Recommendations, or custom ML/LLM model deployment) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversational &amp;amp; Agentic E-Commerce&lt;/strong&gt;: Solid understanding or experience with conversational AI interfaces (chat/voice product advisors) and agentic commerce concepts (autonomous intent-matching, task-oriented AI agents) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail Media &amp;amp; Monetization&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience with Retail Media concepts and ad management (sponsored products, ad-server integrations, balancing yield vs. UX) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong strategic influence, ability to thrive in ambiguity, passion for cross-functional collaboration in Triad, and an empathetic approach to mentoring junior PMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work Model&lt;/strong&gt; (Paris or Lille base) 2 days of remote work per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Equipment&lt;/strong&gt; (Mac or Windows, according to mission and sustainability commitments);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Exposure&lt;/strong&gt;: Local project team within a global retail and digital network with international career opportunities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Internal/external trainings, skill development programs, and conference attendance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Competitive salary package including employee stock ownership, profit-sharing, and monthly/quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CSQ128R8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) you will work with customers to build and productionize solutions to their data &amp;amp; AI challenges using the Databricks platform. You will own the architecture, lead design decisions, and implement end-to-end systems spanning data engineering, AI, and application development. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations. FDEs deliver with customer empathy, integrating with client systems, training, and other technical needs to help customers get most value out of their data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, customer-facing role for builders who thrive at the intersection of technology and business impact. The ideal candidate combines engineering expertise with adaptability, curiosity, and a passion for working with customers and teammates to solve complex problems that drive measurable outcomes. FDEs are billable and know how to complete projects according to specification with exceptional customer empathy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Solution Delivery: Lead impactful customer technical projects by delivering production-grade systems, designing and building reference architectures, custom applications and data ingestion and ML/AI model integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformational Impact: Guide strategic customers as they implement transformational big data projects including end-to-end design, build and deployment of industry-leading big data and AI applications. Work with engagement managers to scope technical delivery work with input from the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Customers: Guide customers on architecture and design; bootstrap or implement customer projects which leads to a customers&#39; successful understanding, evaluation and adoption of Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Architecture: Lead architecture and design decisions, ensuring solutions are secure, scalable, and aligned with both customer needs and Databricks best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Databricks technical team, Project Manager, Architect and Customer team to ensure the technical components of the engagement are delivered to meet customer&#39;s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Engineering and Databricks Customer Support to provide product and implementation feedback and to guide rapid resolution for engagement specific product and support issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Immersion: Embed with customer teams, engaging with stakeholders from technical ICs to executives to deeply understand challenges and deliver impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reusable Assets &amp;amp; Scale: Contribute accelerators, frameworks, and best practices that scale impact across accounts and influence the Databricks product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience in data engineering, data platforms &amp;amp; analytics, or software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing code in either Python, Scala, JavaScript/TypeScript, and modern frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of two or more common Cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP) with expertise in at least one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with distributed computing with Apache Spark™ and knowledge of Spark runtime internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD for production deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MLOps, ML/AI models and AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deployment of performant production end-to-end data architectures and applications that combine data pipelines, ML/AI models, and user-facing interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical project delivery - managing scope, timelines and measurable outcomes, translating complex concepts into actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and white-boarding skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise clients and managing conflicts across a broad stakeholder range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build skills in technical areas, and demonstrate curiosity, adaptability, and eagerness to explore new technologies which support the deployment and integration of Databricks-based solutions to complete customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customers 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Unframe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unframe is an AI-first startup helping the world’s largest enterprises bring LLM-powered applications to life in days - not months. We combine the speed of a product company with the flexibility of a consultancy, helping customers move from idea to deployed AI systems faster than anyone else in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Bessemer, Craft, and TLV Partners with $100M in Series B funding, we’re building a fast-growing, revenue-generating company working with Fortune 500 customers globally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits on the front line: you engage directly with enterprise clients, lead discovery to uncover core business challenges, and design and ship tailored AI solutions built on Unframe&#39;s platform. You own the work end-to-end, serving as the strategic and technical bridge from initial conversation through to final deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true builder role. You write the precise specifications and prompt architectures that bring solutions to life, making the critical design decisions that determine whether an enterprise AI deployment actually succeeds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a project-led role with unmediated access to clients at every stage. You will typically manage several engagements simultaneously, with short planning horizons and evolving requirements. Roughly 30 to 40 percent of the role is active client management, ensuring senior stakeholders remain aligned through delivery, progress reviews, and post-deployment rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Enterprise Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct discovery sessions directly with enterprise clients to map workflows, uncover business challenges, and distinguish surface-level requests from fundamental operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Spec AI Solutions: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate customer problems into structured solution plans on Unframe&#39;s platform. Write detailed specs and define prompt and context structures, owning the complete solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive End-to-End Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with engineers and AI specialists to deliver solutions on target. Prioritize requirements and manage tradeoffs across speed, stability, and scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent the User &amp;amp; Platform: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the voice of enterprise operators and domain experts while collaborating with the Platform team to identify reusable product patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in product management or technical delivery roles, with a proven track record working alongside engineering teams on complex, fast-paced technical products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bilingual Fluency (English &amp;amp; French):&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in French to connect with users and stakeholders in France, and fluent in English for daily collaboration across our international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Led Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience personally leading consultative conversations with enterprise buyers and operators - not supporting a sales call, not interviewing platform users, but owning the conversation to surface unstated needs and translate them into clear solution scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Stakeholder Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to manage senior client relationships through a complex delivery; keeping stakeholders aligned, navigating competing priorities, and being the primary point of contact when requirements shift or timelines compress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-to-Solution Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to start from a raw business problem without existing features for reference, defining exactly how an AI solution should function and writing precise specs for build teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Delivery Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience shipping AI-powered features under tight timelines, managing evolving requirements, and documenting strategic tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Solutions Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct exposure to building with LLMs - writing prompt structures, defining context and output constraints, working with agentic systems, or managing model uncertainty in a shipped product or working prototype. This is the dimension most learnable on the job; concrete work product carries more weight than certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Orientation: &lt;/strong&gt;Driven by creating customer-facing solutions rather than simply managing traditional roadmaps or processing requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong written communication, systems thinking, high attention to detail, fluent English (written and verbal), and the ability to navigate multi-faceted projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Remote (France):&lt;/strong&gt; This position is 100% remote within France.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Unframe, you’ll help build AI systems that are already delivering real value to global enterprises - not prototypes, demos, or side projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You’ll work with exceptional teammates, collaborate directly with top-tier customers, and have real influence over both the solutions we ship and the evolution of our platform. This is a hands-on, high-impact role where product thinking, technical depth, and creativity come together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;If you enjoy solving hard problems, moving fast, and building practical AI products that actually make it to production - we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern - Fullstack (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to build innovative products and features that improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. You will work in a feature team developing solutions that directly impact healthcare professionals and patients across Europe, contributing to our Operating System powered by AI to manage all clinical and administrative activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own features alongside experienced engineers — from design and development to testing and shipping — with a direct impact on real users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers, product managers, and designers to solve complex technical challenges and build scalable, secure, and user-friendly healthcare tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, efficient code following industry best practices in design, testing, and peer review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve real-world problems that directly enhance patient care and improve doctor-patient relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new tools and technologies, including AI and distributed systems, as part of your continuous growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of learning and collaboration by sharing knowledge and engaging actively with your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love problem-solving and are driven by curiosity — you&#39;re not afraid to dive into complex issues and find creative solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a collaborative environment and enjoy working with cross-functional teams, sharing knowledge, and learning from your peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for technology and product development, and always keep the user experience in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable coding, with the help of AI agents like Claude Code, in multiple languages and eager to learn our tech stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are in your final year of a degree in Software Engineering, Computer Science, or a related field and looking for a 6-month full-time internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to learn and work in a team of builders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with web development or building products in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on side projects or contributed to open-source communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with AI-assisted coding tools and eager to integrate them into your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech masterclasses throughout the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding and development, along with dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted membership to Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers worth €8.50 per day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% reimbursement of public transportation subscriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health insurance, fully covered by Doctolib for employees and their children under the basic plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and personalised coaching programme with our partner, &lt;a href=&quot;http://moka.care/&quot;&gt;Moka.care&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
