&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Icon 1, WA15 0AF&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Central Functions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Central Functions is formed of the teams and people that serve the entire business. These people are integral to the smooth running of the business; ensuring everyone is paid on time, that materials are sourced and arrive promptly, that we meet our legal obligations and that our health, safety, and security is safeguarded.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why be a Data Engineer (Customer) at THG?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data Engineer in the Customer domain, you will support the build and maintenance of the pipelines and data assets that power customer analytics at THG. This is one of two Data Engineer roles in the Customer domain — working closely with the Senior Data Engineer and your fellow Data Engineer to deliver a reliable, well-structured customer data layer that enables analytics across our Beauty and Nutrition businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain data pipelines in the Customer domain under the direction of the Senior Data Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, well-documented SQL and Python code that meets the team’s standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the monitoring and resolution of pipeline issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to data quality checks and validation in the Customer domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop your understanding of the Customer data domain — CRM, acquisition, identity and marketing data flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and apply engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on increasing responsibility over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with both Data Engineers and the Senior Data Engineer in the Customer team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support analytics teams with data requests and pipeline queries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What skills and experience do I need for this role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience or strong foundational knowledge in data engineering — Python and SQL are essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of data pipeline concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and drive to develop as a data engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and commitment to accurate, reliable work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively within a small team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GCP, BigQuery or equivalent cloud data platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to customer or marketing data environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with version control (Git) and orchestration tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What’s in it for me?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access bespoke development programmes that have been designed and developed by our in-house L&amp;amp;D team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continued development through our upskilling programme that is delivered in partnership with an industry-leading training provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhanced Leave&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave plus bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don’t want to work on your birthday? We don’t either! Enjoy your day off on us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity pay, depending on length of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 10 days compassionate leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buy back up to 3 days each year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlock 2 days volunteer leave after 12-months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access face-to-face and virtual appointments with our in-house GP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our subsidised on-site dentist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access our 247 Employee Assistance Programme (EAP) which is provided by Bupa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;State-of-the-art on-site gym.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our on-site physio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Save up to 12% on the cost of personal tech through our salary sacrifice scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised bus pass from Manchester City Centre to our ICON office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 50% staff discount on THG brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site staff shop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know someone who would be perfect for THG? Refer them and get up to £1000 when they pass their probation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anniversary gifts when you hit 5 and 10 years of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

Group Clinical Trials Manager
Home-based with regular travel to veterinary clinics and meetings across the UK and Europe
Full-time | Permanent
&nbsp;
About Us

At inspiring vet care, our people are at the heart of everything we do. As the UK’s number one vet care provider, we're trusted with the care of over 2 million animals, delivering our purpose of healthier animals and happier owners.
&nbsp;
As part of Central Functions, you will be part of the teams that support and enable our network of over 2,500 practices across 20 countries, driving operational excellence, innovation and strategic impact across the business.
&nbsp;
Whether your expertise is in Finance, HR, Technology, Marketing, Data, Legal, Operations or another specialist area, your work will help support colleagues and practices to deliver outstanding care to animals and their owners.

&nbsp;
&nbsp;
About the role
Lead the Future of Veterinary Clinical Research
At inspiring vet care, we're committed to advancing veterinary medicine through innovation, collaboration and evidence-based care. We're looking for an experienced Group Clinical Trials Manager to play a pivotal role in developing and delivering sponsored clinical trials across our international network of veterinary practices.
This is a unique opportunity to help shape and grow a clinical trials function within one of the world's leading veterinary groups. Working with sponsors, contract research organisations (CROs) and clinical teams across Europe and North America, you'll drive the successful delivery of pivotal clinical trials while helping to build enthusiasm and capability for clinical research throughout our network.
&nbsp;
What You'll Be Doing
As Group Clinical Trials Manager, you'll take ownership of the operational delivery of multiple clinical trials, ensuring they are delivered efficiently, compliantly and to the highest standards.
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Key responsibilities include:
*Managing the day-to-day operation of clinical trials across veterinary clinics*Acting as the primary point of contact for sponsors throughout the trial lifecycle*Building and maintaining strong relationships with sponsors and CRO partners*Developing project plans, timelines and risk management strategies*Recruiting and onboarding veterinary clinics into clinical studies*Supporting and delivering GCP and protocol-specific training*Driving study enrolment and engagement activities to maximise participation*Providing expert guidance on protocol implementation and study delivery*Monitoring study progress and troubleshooting operational challenges*Managing and supporting a team of regional Clinical Trial Coordinators*Ensuring trial activities comply with GCP and all relevant regulations
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
About You
We're looking for a highly organised and collaborative clinical trials professional who thrives in a fast-paced, stakeholder-focused environment.
Essential Requirements*Bachelor's degree in Health, Veterinary, Life Sciences or a related discipline*Minimum 3 years' clinical trials experience*Proven project management and delivery experience*Excellent written and verbal communication skills*Strong digital literacy*Full driving licence and willingness to travel regularly*Desirable Experience*Experience within the veterinary or animal health sector*5+ years' experience in pivotal Phase III clinical trials*Experience working within a sponsor organisation or CRO*Clinical qualification*Postgraduate qualification (MSc, PhD or Project Management certification)*Previous line management experience
&nbsp;
Why Join Us?
This is an exciting opportunity to influence the future of veterinary clinical research on an international scale. You'll work alongside industry-leading sponsors, veterinary professionals and research partners while helping bring innovative treatments and therapies to animals and their owners.
&nbsp;
In return, you'll benefit from:
*The opportunity to shape and grow a developing clinical trials function*Exposure to international clinical research projects*A collaborative and supportive environment*Career development opportunities within a global veterinary organisation*Flexible home-based working with meaningful travel and stakeholder engagement
&nbsp;
Apply Today
If you're passionate about clinical research, project delivery and advancing animal healthcare, we'd love to hear from you.
Join inspiring vet care and help drive the next generation of veterinary clinical trials
