&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-block&quot; data-name=&quot;earth_africa&quot; data-type=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Wollerau or Zurich, Switzerland&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Part-time (40-60%), Fixed-term until May 2027&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Our Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a proactive and detail-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Customer Service Specialist Coffee&lt;/strong&gt; to support our coffee logistic activities. This is an excellent opportunity for a professional with experience in contract administration, logistics coordination, and supplier management to play a key role in ensuring smooth operations and exceptional service for our customers and logistic service providers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage coffee logistic shipments and sales invoices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate shipment schedules and delivery plans with logistics service providers, customers and coffee suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the resolution of logistics-related issues and delays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key point of contact for customers’ inquiries and operational topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in resolving customer related issues and discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Finance regarding payment processing and invoice approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve invoice discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor contract processing timelines and maintain high accuracy standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
