&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with the Flight control team and program engineering teams to support simulation-related needs across projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
