&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Aerospace Engineering or similar relevant areas of expertise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
