&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-markdown-start-index=&quot;375&quot;&gt;You share responsibility for ongoing general ledger accounting, including account reconciliations and the preparation of advance VAT returns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
