&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1014&quot;&gt;You have completed vocational training as a Financial Accountant (m/f/d) or hold an equivalent qualification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1125&quot;&gt;You possess sound knowledge of German Commercial Code (HGB) accounting standards and have experience preparing annual financial statements and tax returns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1282&quot;&gt;You bring hands-on experience in financial accounting and are proficient in using NetSuite and MS Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1389&quot;&gt;Precision, personal initiative, and a structured approach to work are among your key strengths.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
