&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About SITS | Traxion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Benelux leader in Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM), we deliver top-tier consulting services since 2000. With over 100 specialists with 16+ nationalities we are passionate about enhancing cyber resilience through excellence, continuous growth, and a collaborative culture. As part of the SITS Group—a Swiss based leader in IT security—we are part of a network of top-class IT security providers that combine expertise, experience, and resources into a unified force for holistic security strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our projects serve both local and international clients and span various sectors industries, including healthcare, pharma, energy, education, finance, retail, and government.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us to work on high-impact projects whilst shaping cybersecurity. With opportunities for continuous learning, flexible working, and involvement in both local and international initiatives, you will be part of a dynamic team where your expertise truly makes a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ready to make an impact and secure Europe’s digital identities? Apply today!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For any questions about this position or about us, contact&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt; &lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot; ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At SITS | Traxion, we believe diversity strengthens our teams and fosters innovation. We are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone, regardless of gender, background, or experience, can thrive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord has a highly engaged community of millions of daily active users who use the platform for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does: &lt;strong&gt;play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming, and we are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is on a mission to create space for everyone to find belonging. Trusted by millions of people to keep their communications private and out of the hands of evildoers, Security and Privacy are necessary to Discord&#39;s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Staff Privacy Engineer to join us in Amsterdam and shape how we build privacy into our products and operations. If you pair deep privacy technology and compliance fluency with a builder&#39;s instinct for automation and system design, read on!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and deliver the roadmap for the Privacy Engineering Amsterdam team: define priorities, scope multi-quarter initiatives, and drive them to completion across engineering, product, and legal stakeholders.Drive collaboration and advisement with engineering teams across Lisbon and Amsterdam, acting as the senior privacy voice in architecture reviews, product design, and incident response for our European engineering hubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams, including Engineering, Product, Data, and Legal to conduct privacy impact assessments, code and architecture reviews, and ensure compliance with Discord&#39;s Privacy Principles and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop actionable data privacy policies and drive the creation and monitoring of controls that ensure adherence, grounding Discord&#39;s privacy posture in industry frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design privacy-preserving product solutions, act as the privacy subject matter expert for the region, and identify new opportunities to advance our privacy posture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead privacy impact analysis on production incidents, direct technical validation of remediations and external responses, and raise the bar for how the team operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and scale our central privacy systems: from evidencing automation to data subject rights fulfillment, you will use your technical skills, privacy expertise, and AI tooling chops to multiply the team&#39;s impact — and mentor other engineers to do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for user privacy and data protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in technical privacy, data protection, or adjacent engineering roles, including experience leading significant privacy initiatives end-to-end. Example projects could include implementing Privacy Enhancing Technologies (PETs), data classification and discovery, and developing data subject rights systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning and delivering a technical roadmap: translating regulatory and business requirements into a prioritized plan, and landing it across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep operational and technical fluency with GDPR, and strong command of the broader privacy compliance landscape (CPRA/CPPA, EU AI Act, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating privacy compliance at scale, such as the development of DPIAs, maintaining data maps and records of processing (RoPA), and assessing vendor/processor risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to automate evidence collection and program workflows (e.g. Python and AI tooling), and the architecture fluency to evaluate privacy risks and design mitigations in complex distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written communication and demonstrated ability to influence senior stakeholders across Engineering, Product, and Legal — including driving alignment across offices and time zones. Occasional virtual meetings with employees in US timezones may be necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading privacy incident response and regulator engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring or leading privacy or security engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with privacy tooling (e.g. OneTrust, BigID, TrustArc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI governance and the EU AI Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across EU and US time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and monitoring a privacy or security control framework (e.g. ISO 27701, ISO 27001, or NIST Privacy Framework).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this full-time position is €128,000&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; to €160,000&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in NL role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Candidates must reside in or be willing to relocate to the Amsterdam, NL Area and attend the office 1-2 days a week.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests, and helps developers build and grow their businesses. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord is committed to inclusion and providing reasonable accommodations during the interview process. &lt;/strong&gt;We want you to feel set up for success, so if you are in need of reasonable accommodations, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please see our Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy for details regarding Discord’s collection and usage of personal information relating to the application and recruitment process by clicking&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/terms/applicant-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;HERE.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord has a highly engaged community of millions of daily active users who use the platform for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does: &lt;strong&gt;play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming, and we are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is on a mission to create space for everyone to find belonging. Trusted by millions of people to keep their communications private and out of the hands of evildoers, Security and Privacy are necessary to Discord&#39;s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Privacy Engineer to join us in Amsterdam and shape how we build privacy into our products and operations. If you pair deep privacy technology and compliance fluency with a builder&#39;s instinct for automation and system design, read on!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams, including Engineering, Product, Data, and Legal to conduct privacy impact assessments, code and architecture reviews, and ensure compliance with Discord’s Privacy Principles and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop actionable data privacy policies in order to drive the creation and monitoring of controls that ensure adherence, grounding Discord&#39;s privacy posture in industry frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design privacy-preserving product solutions, act as a privacy subject matter expert across teams, and identify new opportunities to promote our privacy posture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead privacy impact analysis on production incidents and conduct technical validation on remediations and external responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and contribute to our central privacy systems: From evidencing automation to data subject rights fulfillment, you will use your technical skills, privacy expertise, and AI tooling chops to scale the team’s work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for user privacy and data protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a technical privacy or data protection role. Example projects could include implementing Privacy Enhancing Technologies (PETs), data classification and discovery, and developing data subject rights systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fluency of GDPR as an operational and technical standard, and awareness of the broader privacy compliance landscape (CPRA/CPPA, EU AI Act, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating privacy compliance, such as the development of DPIAs, maintaining data maps and records of processing (RoPA), and assessing vendor/processor risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to automate evidence collection and program workflows (e.g. Python and AI tooling), and comfort reading system and data architecture well enough to evaluate privacy risks and design mitigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication and the ability to influence across Engineering, Product, and Legal. Occasional virtual meetings with employees in US timezones may be necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading privacy incident response and regulator engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with privacy tooling (e.g. OneTrust, BigID, TrustArc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI governance and the EU AI Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across EU and US time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and monitoring a privacy or security control framework (e.g. ISO 27701, ISO 27001, or NIST Privacy Framework).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this full-time position is €94,000&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; to €117,000&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in NL role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Candidates must reside in or be willing to relocate to the Amsterdam, NL Area and attend the office 1-2 days a week.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;notion-selectable notion-bulleted_list-block&quot; data-block-id=&quot;3ecf46fd-48aa-803b-80e9-e0bdeb7d8c71&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests, and helps developers build and grow their businesses. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord is committed to inclusion and providing reasonable accommodations during the interview process. &lt;/strong&gt;We want you to feel set up for success, so if you are in need of reasonable accommodations, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please see our Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy for details regarding Discord’s collection and usage of personal information relating to the application and recruitment process by clicking&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/terms/applicant-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;HERE.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Creative Fabrica&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creative Fabrica is a fast-growing AI platform that makes it easy for everyday consumers to create whatever they imagine, from images and videos to audio and 3D creations, using the latest generative AI models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We want to make it even easier for users to bring their ideas to life by providing tutorials, instructions and engaging educational episodes on our YouTube channel. That’s where you come in!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a full-time, in-office role at our Amsterdam HQ, with 30 work-from-anywhere days per year.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who loves long-form video editing and lives and breathes YouTube. You obsess over video structure, hooks and pacing, and understand what makes a title or thumbnail worth clicking. You follow editors like Hayden Hillier-Smith, Finzar and Jordan Orme, and can explain the creative decisions that make a video work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work alongside our YouTube Creator &amp;amp; Host and a dedicated motion designer to turn creative AI workflows into videos people love watching. You’ll generate AI footage and supporting visuals, own the edit, and shape each video’s structure, storytelling and pacing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond the edit, you’ll lead titles, thumbnail briefs, publishing and performance analysis. Together with the host, you’ll decide what to make next, learn from what resonates with viewers and take responsibility for growing the channel and our community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Edit videos people love watching:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the long-form edit, shaping hooks, structure, storytelling and pacing to make creative AI tutorials engaging and easy to follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Generate AI footage, examples and supporting visuals that bring creative workflows to life and make each episode more compelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead production:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with the host, brief your dedicated motion designer and coordinate recording needs, deadlines and revisions to take videos from concept to publication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own titles and thumbnails:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop titles and thumbnail concepts with the host, brief the graphic designer and ensure the final result gives viewers a compelling reason to click.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own publishing:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage uploads, descriptions, scheduling and final quality checks to maintain a consistent publishing cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow the channel:&lt;/strong&gt; Share responsibility for channel growth with the host. Use click-through rates, retention, watch time and viewer feedback to improve videos and decide what to make next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong long-form editing skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a portfolio of YouTube videos that demonstrates strong storytelling, hooks, pacing, sound and visual judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep YouTube understanding:&lt;/strong&gt; You naturally study videos, titles and thumbnails to understand why they work. You’re comfortable using YouTube Studio analytics to make creative decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on generative AI skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You already create images and videos with AI, have work to show and know how to turn generated assets into polished video content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You contribute ideas, suggest improvements and take responsibility for finished videos, rather than waiting for detailed editing instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production and collaboration skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You manage deadlines, keep production organized and communicate clearly with the host and designers, with excellent English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience producing tutorials or creator-led content about generative AI and creative tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We would also like to offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; On days you work in the office a warm fresh lunch will be provided for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days &lt;strong&gt;Work From Anywhere Benefit&lt;/strong&gt; per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;24&lt;/strong&gt; days of paid vacation per year + public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Allowance&lt;/strong&gt;, if you live more than 10 KM from the office (in the form of an NS card).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company &lt;strong&gt;pension plan&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company &lt;strong&gt;events&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;overseas trips&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-blocks&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;block-13&quot; class=&quot;text block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;body&quot; data-columns=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
