&lt;div class=&quot;w-full&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-2xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Solution Consultant Intern — Mirakl Connect&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;📍 Paris | 🗓 January – June 2027 (6 months)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;my-4 border-b border-primary-150&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our EMEA Solution Consulting team led by &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Jonathan D&#39;Elissagaray, Director of Solution Consulting&lt;/strong&gt;. The team consists of two Solution Consultants focused on Mirakl Connect, working alongside four Platform Consultants covering B2B customers across Southern Europe and the Middle East. Together, you&#39;ll be helping sellers successfully onboard and grow through the Mirakl Connect ecosystem.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-0 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About Mirakl Connect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-0 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Mirakl Connect is Mirakl’s ecosystem platform, connecting marketplace operators and sellers to simplify partnerships, onboarding, and growth. Trusted by leading brands such as &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Macy’s and Lacoste&lt;/strong&gt;, Mirakl Connect helps sellers discover new marketplace opportunities while enabling marketplace teams to efficiently onboard and manage their seller ecosystem at scale.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;my-4 border-b border-primary-150&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Support and progressively take ownership of end-to-end seller onboarding on Mirakl Connect, starting with simpler cases and building towards greater autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Guide sellers through key onboarding steps and deliver clear enablement sessions tailored to audiences with varying levels of technical knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Develop expertise in &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Catalog Transformer&lt;/strong&gt; — Mirakl&#39;s AI-based catalogue management product — and support sellers in troubleshooting and optimising their catalogues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Contribute to scaling onboarding by creating and improving documentation, guides, and internal content, and by identifying opportunities for process and reporting automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Sales, Product, Support, and Data Science/AI teams, capturing feedback from onboarding activities to continuously improve the seller experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;my-4 border-b border-primary-150&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
