&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;At least one previous internship or corporate experience, ideally in an enterprise environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Demonstrated interest in technology, SaaS platforms, or digital products&lt;/li&gt;
