&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Autonomous and solution-oriented, with solid project management skills and the ability to see tasks through from start to finish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Strong communication and teaching skills, able to explain technical concepts clearly to non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Curious and proactive, with a genuine interest in AI and a willingness to use it practically, including for troubleshooting AI-based products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Organised and able to manage multiple priorities effectively in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
