&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;More information?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;Do not hesitate to call Maggie: 06 23 75 70 86.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;blockquote&gt;Work on mission-critical network solutions.&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we design, build, and maintain environments for our customers’ mission-critical applications, leveraging a blend of public cloud and on-premises infrastructures. Our dedicated customer teams are driven by ownership and have the ambition to always deliver the best results, regardless of complexity or constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you as passionate about networking and automation as we are? We are looking for a Network Automation Engineer who thrives on designing, implementing and running advanced network solutions. Take ownership of critical network layers, integrate physical and virtual components and ensure seamless operation for our customers’ environment, both on-premises and in the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automation is your default mindset. You will be focusing on designing and building a mission critical environment for our customers, engineered for high availability and stability. You and your team get to take full ownership of building as well as running and improving customer environments. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Network Automation Engineer, these activities will be part of your responsibility:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, design, build and maintain highly available, secure, and scalable networks across on-premises and public cloud environments (e.g. Azure);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate and template network configurations (Infrastructure as Code) using tools such as Terraform, Chef, and Ansible;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and remediate performance or security challenges across multifaceted network landscapes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimize logical and virtual networking solutions, including SDN and VMware NSX;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate and manage IPAM (preferably Nautobot or Netbox) and IAM solutions, supporting an efficient and secure network environment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in Kubernetes networking, CI/CD automation, GitLab/GitOps workflows;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and support change planning, security incidents, audits and continuous network improvement;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on greenfield projects, with responsibility ranging from architecture to hands-on building and continuous development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do you need to be successful?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record as a Network Engineer in high-availability environments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills and the ability to remediate complex network and security issues;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Cisco, Arista, and/or Extreme Networks;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with F5, Cisco ASA and Palo Alto;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automation and Infra as Code, like Terraform, Ansible, Chef;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with public cloud networking (Azure) and integrating with on-premises environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to work on large, complex projects designing and developing mission-critical infrastructures whilst also working on focus on existing network environments, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build Mission-Critical GenAI &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we go beyond delivering IT solutions. We design, build, and operate mission-critical systems that our customers depend on every day. From infrastructure to cloud-native platforms, every layer is engineered for maximum reliability and quality. We work closely with our customers to ensure their most vital operations run seamlessly, regardless of complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;GenAI Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join a small, close-knit, self-managing team. Our mission is to develop advanced AI platforms, AI-driven solutions, and applications that transform how our customers operate across a wide range of industries. These platforms serve as the backbone for innovation, reliability, and scalability, supporting critical operations in high-security environments. The solutions built on top of them redefine the way our customers run their business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our ideal colleague has&amp;nbsp;experience with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing,&amp;nbsp;building,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;GenAI&amp;nbsp;applications&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;bringing&amp;nbsp;them&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;GenAI&amp;nbsp;frameworks,&amp;nbsp;libraries,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;(e.g.,&amp;nbsp;LangChain,&amp;nbsp;TensorFlow,&amp;nbsp;PyTorch,&amp;nbsp;FastAPI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;using&amp;nbsp;GenAI&amp;nbsp;models&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;applications,&amp;nbsp;both&amp;nbsp;open&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;closed&amp;nbsp;source&amp;nbsp;(e.g.,&amp;nbsp;GPT,&amp;nbsp;Llama,&amp;nbsp;Claude).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;GenAI&amp;nbsp;application&amp;nbsp;components&amp;nbsp;like&amp;nbsp;models,&amp;nbsp;vector&amp;nbsp;databases,&amp;nbsp;embeddings,&amp;nbsp;chunking&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving&amp;nbsp;architectural&amp;nbsp;decisions&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;contributing&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;long-term&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;applying&amp;nbsp;change&amp;nbsp;management&amp;nbsp;practices&amp;nbsp;when&amp;nbsp;delivering&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;technology&amp;nbsp;solutions&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;ensure&amp;nbsp;value&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in Dutch&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;blockquote&gt;Design, deliver and operate the AI platforms that power our customers&#39; most critical systems&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we do more than deliver IT solutions. We design, build and operate business-critical systems that our customers rely on every day. From infrastructure to cloud-native platforms, every layer is engineered for maximum reliability and quality. Working closely with our customers, we ensure their most important processes continue to run smoothly, no matter how complex the environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced GenAI Python Engineer to join a small, close-knit and self-managing team. Our mission is to design and develop advanced AI platforms, AI-powered solutions and applications that transform the way our customers operate across a variety of industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These platforms provide the foundation for innovation, reliability and scalability, supporting critical business processes in high-security environments. The solutions built on top of these platforms fundamentally change how our customers run their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Ideal Colleague Has Experience With oR Knowledge Of:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4-6 years of proven commercial experience in a professional software engineering environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A good command of the Dutch language.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing, building and maintaining Generative AI applications, including deploying and operating them in production using Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with GenAI frameworks, libraries or platforms such as LangChain, TensorFlow, PyTorch or FastAPI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Generative AI models in production environments, both open-source and proprietary, including models such as GPT, Llama and Claude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing and optimizing core GenAI components, including vector databases, embeddings, chunking strategies and evaluation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving architectural decisions and contributing to the long-term technical vision of a platform or product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading technology adoption and change management initiatives to ensure cutting-edge solutions deliver measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

