&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Python Senior Software Engineer to join the ATP team in Application Platform Domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, your mission will be to work on designing and delivering essential components that empower Doctolib teams to build robust and scalable services. You will be working in a feature team developing the chassis, archetypes, business-agnostic services, cross-cutting concerns and Claude Plugins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working in a platform feature team developing the Python and Java/Kotlin chassis, project archetypes, business-agnostic services, cross-cutting concerns (resilience, security, observability…) and Claude Plugins, used by more than 60 services across Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib involves building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. We work in feature teams in an agile environment, while collaborating with product, design, and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers, designers, and other engineers to define and implement features to improve the Doctolib platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a leading role within the team and contribute to establishing a technical vision that ensures the performance, security, and usability of the platform, taking into account the future needs and the high scalability needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring your expertise and experiences to help us continuously improve the way we implement, test, and monitor high-quality features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving the performance of key features implemented in Python, sometimes completely challenging the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking leadership on delivering roadmap items (together with the team)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to establishing a technical vision and co-drive the creation of the roadmap for next quarters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our tech environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to the country and healthcare specialty requirements. To address these challenges, we are modularizing our platform run in a distributed architecture through reusable components.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on, if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;proactive, curious, collaborative&lt;/strong&gt; and eager to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;primarily a backend engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with expert knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a solid understanding of web technologies and software development life cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;“user first” mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and want to build a product focused on bringing value to its users, through &lt;strong&gt;secure, well-tested and pragmatic code&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;fluent in English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now it would be fantastic if you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;have experience with Kafka and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;have experience with ADK and ML libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;have experience with Java or Kotlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free comprehensive health insurance for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parent Care Program: additional leave on top of the legal parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidy from the work council to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch voucher with Swile card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feature Building Interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Design Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full Time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Levallois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you would like to find out more about tech life at Doctolib, feel free to read our latest&lt;a href=&quot;https://medium.com/doctolib&quot;&gt; Medium blog articles&lt;/a&gt;!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g. pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Germany&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; l &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; l &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Italy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; l &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Netherlands&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Design Director - Patient (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib is a mission-driven healthcare technology company, founded in Paris in 2013. Today, nearly &lt;strong&gt;3,000 people&lt;/strong&gt; work across Europe to transform the way healthcare is delivered and experienced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than &lt;strong&gt;500,000 healthcare professionals&lt;/strong&gt; use Doctolib’s solutions, and the patient app is used by approximately &lt;strong&gt;90 million people&lt;/strong&gt; across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For patients, Doctolib began as a simple way to find a healthcare professional and book an appointment. We are now building something much more ambitious: an &lt;strong&gt;AI-powered Health Companion&lt;/strong&gt; that helps people navigate care, understand their health and take the right next step throughout their health journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This means moving beyond a primarily transactional product towards an experience that supports patients before, during and after care, through access to care, health information, patient data, messaging, recommendations, care plans and AI-powered assistance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Product Design Director to help define what this next generation of patient experience should look and feel like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will build and lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Product Design Director, Patient&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the design vision and quality bar for Doctolib’s patient experience. You will report to our VP Design and work closely with the Product, Engineering, Medical, Data and Business leadership teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your scope will cover the full patient journey, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;access to care, search and booking;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;patient messaging and teleconsultation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;the Patient Health Record and patient context;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;the app homepage and daily health experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;health content and prevention;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;recommendations, reminders and care plans;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;new patient services and subscription experiences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;conversational and AI-powered experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The current team includes &lt;strong&gt;six Senior Product Designers and one Senior Content Designer&lt;/strong&gt;. You will lead, coach and develop this team while shaping the organisation and operating model needed to support the next phase of the Patient product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mandate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the design vision for the Patient stream, from a high-traffic booking experience to a trusted Health Companion used throughout the health journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge two equally important challenges: continuing to improve the core access-to-care experience while creating new reasons for patients to return beyond booking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar for product design, interaction design and content across the patient experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close enough to the product and the craft to make high-quality design decisions, not only set direction from a distance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape AI-native experiences that are clear, useful and trustworthy, including recommendations, conversational interfaces and next-best actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong design principles for transparency, explainability, uncertainty, user control and safe escalation in a healthcare context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-performing design organisation, including hiring, coaching, talent development and second-line leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create effective ways of working across Design, Product, Engineering, Medical, Data and Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help scale a coherent experience across countries, languages and different healthcare contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect design decisions to user behaviour, product outcomes and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;established a clear and compelling design vision for the Patient stream;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;raised the quality bar across both core access-to-care journeys and newer Health Companion experiences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;helped define a coherent interaction model for AI-powered patient experiences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;strengthened collaboration between Design, Product, Engineering and Medical;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;developed a clear operating model and growth plan for the Patient Design organisation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;helped Doctolib increase the value and relevance of the patient experience beyond appointment booking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are likely to bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading Product Design, 10+ years in product design including 3+ years in people leadership..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a consumer product organisation, ideally one used by millions of people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing and scaling products across multiple markets, with an understanding of localisation, cultural differences and the balance between global consistency and local relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing at least five Product Designers, ideally a larger organisation including senior individual contributors and managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product design craft and creative judgement. You can recognise excellent work, make difficult quality trade-offs and stay close enough to the details to raise the standard of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience connecting design choices to measurable outcomes such as adoption, conversion, engagement, retention, satisfaction or user behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong and practical understanding of AI-native product experiences. You have thought deeply about how AI changes interaction design, user expectations, trust, transparency and control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing with uncertainty, recommendations, personalisation or conversational interfaces is highly relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to operate across complex products and stakeholders, while maintaining clarity and momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A concise and compelling communication style. You can articulate a clear point of view, align senior stakeholders and inspire teams to move in a new direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in healthcare or another regulated, trust-sensitive environment is valuable, but healthcare experience is not required. What matters is your respect for domain expertise and your ability to design responsibly in high-stakes contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English. French or German would be a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A working style aligned with the Doctolib Playbook: User First, Medical Expertise, Forefront of Innovation, Bold, Drive, Passion, Humility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Doctolib, why now?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib gives you the opportunity to work on a consumer product with significant reach, strong European scale and a mission that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The patient product already has a large and engaged audience. The next challenge is to make the experience more useful, more contextual and more present in people’s everyday health journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join at a defining moment:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Doctolib is moving from appointment booking towards continuous health support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is becoming a core part of the product experience, not an isolated feature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Patient Design organisation is being strengthened and reshaped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The product must work across multiple European countries, languages and healthcare systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The design foundations for the next chapter are still being built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to shape a new category at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;consumer product design, healthcare and AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and to define how people will discover, understand and manage their health in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib is an equal opportunity employer. We believe diverse teams build better products and improve healthcare for more people. We welcome applications regardless of gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability or place of origin. If you have a disability, please let us know how we can make the recruitment process more accessible.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Information submitted through this application is processed by Doctolib for recruitment purposes. For more information about data processing and your rights, please refer to our privacy policies:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Germany&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Italy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Netherlands&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For questions about data privacy, please contact -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2013, Doctolib is Europe&#39;s leading AI and digital health company, serving 520,000 health professionals and 90 million people. We are building a new way to build software: agents doing the grunt work of writing, testing, reviewing and merging code, with engineers moving into a control-tower role to monitor and intervene.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission: build the tooling and workflows that let AI agents and the engineers who work alongside them&amp;nbsp; test, review, ship and monitor code reliably, so Doctolib can multiply its engineering output while keeping quality and control.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director of Developer Experience&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our new &lt;strong&gt;AI Developer Experience&lt;/strong&gt; team, reporting to the VP Platform Engineering. You will also own the existing CI and Developer Experience scope.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib is moving AI adoption from a temporary SWAT team to a permanent capability. The current team includes two Product Managers and two engineers, with more people joining through internal transfers and hiring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your team will own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The agent-native testing and feedback infrastructure that lets agents know, within their own workflow, whether what they built is correct.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD and build systems for the monolith and satellite services, elevated from a CI-run team into an efficient agent-testing capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developer productivity measurement in the AI era DORA, autonomous change rate and complementary indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The inner-loop experience: local and remote environments, onboarding, editor integration and sandboxing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the tools and workflows that allow agents to write, test, review and merge code, including evaluation, security checks and controls — giving agents a fast, reliable feedback loop on whether what they build is correct.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own testing and feedback for the monolith and satellite services, elevating the current CI setup from a CI-run team into an efficient agent-testing capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own developer productivity measurement in the context of AI — DORA, autonomous change rate and complementary indicators — and make it visible and actionable to feature teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the inner-loop experience: local and remote environments, onboarding, editor integration and sandboxing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and organise the team, developing agentic skills internally where needed, as AI adoption shifts from a temporary SWAT team to a permanent one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Engineering and Product Management to understand internal users and drive adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP Platform Engineering, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/maidane/&quot;&gt;Mike Aidane&lt;/a&gt;, you&#39;ll join the Platform Engineering leadership team alongside directors and senior EMs for Application Platform, Data Services and Platform Services.&lt;strong&gt; You will lead the new AI Developer Experience team&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll partner closely with Product Engineering, Product Management, Release Engineering, Quality Engineering, Automation Platform, Infrastructure Platform, SRE, FinOps, Security, Privacy and Compliance, and engineering teams across France and Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have&lt;strong&gt; led engineering organisations through large-scale Developer Experience transformations&lt;/strong&gt; and know what it takes to ship great tooling fast, durably, and without sacrificing quality. You think in systems&amp;nbsp;technical and organisational and are as comfortable setting architecture direction as you are making a hard technical call.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have&lt;strong&gt; led Developer Experience, Developer Productivity, Developer Infrastructure or Build/CI organisations serving 300+ engineers. &lt;/strong&gt;You have demonstrated measurable change in how engineers work, with evidence of adoption, productivity outcomes and organisational or operating-model change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep technical credibility across CI/CD, build and test infrastructure, monorepo build graphs, test selection, caching, merge queues and flake management. You can guide architecture and trade-offs while remaining credible with Staff Engineers and strong EMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience as a manager of managers:&lt;/strong&gt; hiring, growing and levelling engineering managers and staff-plus ICs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable setting your own success metrics and being held to them, with strong written communication and structured thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recent exposure to AI-assisted or agentic engineering transformation, including evaluation, security, guardrails, adoption and productivity measurement. Several years of AI Developer Experience leadership are not expected — the relevant signal is strong large-scale DevEx experience combined with recent AI transformation exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large legacy codebases or monoliths, or in a regulated or high-trust environment such as healthcare. You treat constraints as design inputs, not blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having led multi-country, distributed engineering organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free comprehensive health insurance (basic package) for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid vacation per year, plus up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch vouchers (Swile card) worth €8.50 per working day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidy from the work council to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% reimbursement of your public transport subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ParentCare Program: Enjoy full salary coverage (100%) during your first month of birth leave and 75% during the second, covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intro with the VP Platform Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep dive on your large-scale Developer Experience transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business case presentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional panel with Product Engineering and Product Management leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive conversation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot;&gt; candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paris&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Head of Design Systems&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Brand and Design&lt;/strong&gt; team at Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to ensure every Doctolib product surface is built on a consistent, high-quality design foundation. You will own &lt;strong&gt;Oxygen&lt;/strong&gt;, Doctolib&#39;s design system - much more than a component library. Oxygen is how we deliver our brand identity consistently throughout the product and the critical infrastructure that ensures design quality at scale across an AI-first development environment. With over 50 designers and engineers building across multiple markets and product surfaces, your work will directly shape the experience of more than 90 million patients and 400,000 healthcare professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the multi-year vision and roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; for Oxygen, connecting the dots across engineering, design, and brand teams. Translate system health into business impact and own the investment strategy for the teams, tools, and governance that support it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish cross-functional governance&lt;/strong&gt; across Design, Product, Engineering, and Brand teams, defining contribution models, change management processes, and the standards other teams are expected to follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own design output quality across the product,&lt;/strong&gt; ensuring that AI-generated interfaces are coherent, consistent, and on-brand at every touchpoint across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and drive cross-organizational adoption,&lt;/strong&gt; measuring adoption rate, component coverage, and contribution velocity, and connecting those metrics to product team speed and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and grow a team of designers, product people and engineers,&lt;/strong&gt; setting career paths, a high bar for craft, and hiring for the roles the system needs next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;10+ years of experience in product design or design systems,&lt;/strong&gt; with a proven track record of scaling a mature, complex system across multiple product teams or lines of business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring &lt;strong&gt;engineering fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; you understand the technical architecture of a design system, how platform teams operate, and the latest best practices in AI-first software engineering as it relates to design systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have demonstrated &lt;strong&gt;senior stakeholder management skills,&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to negotiate priorities with leadership at Director level and above across large, distributed organizations, and drive change management at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a &lt;strong&gt;data-informed and outcome-oriented approach:&lt;/strong&gt; you measure system health in real metrics (adoption rate, handoff defect rate, contribution velocity) and connect those numbers to product quality and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in a &lt;strong&gt;regulated, enterprise, or healthcare-adjacent context&lt;/strong&gt; where accessibility (WCAG), localization (i18n, RTL), and multi-market constraints are critical to design systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;fluent in English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience owning large-scale change management programs across cross-functional organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak additional European languages, such as French, German, or Italian&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A Deutschlandticket (Germany-wide public transport pass) fully paid for by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;28 vacation days + 1 additional day for each full calendar year of employment (up to a maximum of 30 days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Company health insurance with great supplementary benefits through our partner Allianz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Company pension scheme (bAV) through Allianz with an employer subsidy of 40% (15% within the probationary period)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;The Doctolib Parent Care program, which includes one month additional parental leave and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Subsidized sports membership through our partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A flexible workplace policy offering both hybrid and office-based mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Alongside healthy snacks and our regular breakfast buffet, we provide a subsidized meal benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio Review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design System Live Case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot;&gt; candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paris or Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

Pioneer of online flash sales since 2001 and key player in European e-commerce, Veepee collaborates with over 7,000 brands to offer highly discounted products available for a limited time. Operating across various sectors, including fashion, home, wine, travel or beauty... Veepee achieved a turnover of 3.3 billion euros incl. VAT in 2024 and employs 5,000 staff members across 10 countries.📄 JOB DESCRIPTION&nbsp;

Within the Marketing Operations team, reporting to the Head of B2C Strategy &amp; Projects, your main missions will be to develop impactful B2B2C campaigns and lead transversal projects delivering value across our B2C platforms
You will be responsible for multiple projects or business scopes across all countries of the Group
🎯 TASKS
B2C strategy:&nbsp;You own (analyze, develop the strategy &amp; follow-up) key offer mix &amp; daily attractivity topics across B2Cs&nbsp;



Offer mix topics &amp; Daily attractivity topics :


Ensure we have the right offer mix on our homepages (pre-openings, 7pm vs 7AM openings, Brandsplace/The Place mgmt, Clearance mgmt, how to highlight new brands on Veepee)&nbsp;


Ensure visitors see &amp; find most relevant banners for them (personalization, HP merchandising strategy, tab merchandising strategy)&nbsp;


Ensure visibility &amp; traffic allocation of Veepee products&nbsp;


Ensure creative and performing marketing support&nbsp;






&nbsp;


&nbsp;B2C Activation &amp; Animation&nbsp; Plan


Define and implement a B2C project activation plan to meet group marketing objectives, enhance Veepee’s brand positioning, and engage the member base


Collaborate with the team to deploy member engagement initiatives via internal and external communication tools, while analyzing and leveraging past performance


Conduct competitive market watch and benchmarking


Work closely with the agency on copywriting for email campaigns and configure activations using internal and external communication tools


Have both a Group and local mindset in order to propose a consistent experience on all platforms whilst also taking into account local specificities or requirements (e.g. could be developing local only campaigns where required)&nbsp;


Analysis and reporting of project's performance to measure their effectiveness


Record budgetary expenses related to events while ensuring their ROI







Veepee Products &amp; Business


Analyze the performance of Veepee products/business across European platforms and propose strategic and operational action plans to boost performance and identify growth levers (visibility, communication, etc.)


Launch and support new and existing Veepee businesses and products across our European platforms


Coordinate the preparation and launch of Veepee business events and products using a B2B2C approach, adapting them by platform as needed


Provide operational support for these events and products with a concrete action plan and timeline


Track all relevant KPIs per project to optimize campaign and activity performance


Work closely with the B2C Marketing Analysts to define strategies for Veepee events/products based on performance analysis




&nbsp;


Digital Member Experience


You collaborate with multiple teams (Growth, Data science, UX, the Agency, CRM, etc) to improve homepage &amp; tab performances and enhance member experience


Express improvement needs for tools, processes, and features on the homepage/tabs (A/B testing, benchmarking, new modules)


Work on the member journey : what are objectives &amp; strategies per entry point, how to navigate on veepee, how to improve member experience on Veepee, B2B2C inputs on the Welcome process


Share business objectives and inputs with UX and data teams to improve algorithm personalization and member experience


Help guarantee operational excellence in the member experience and contribute to developing corrective actions or new ideas to improve related performance


Analyze project performance and propose action plans to optimize KPIs




&nbsp;


Data expertise: You use data to develop and improve our B2C strategy&nbsp;


Collaborate with B2C marketing analysts, marketing data &amp; insights, marketing excellence, Data teams to improve relevant marketing reports and dashboards &amp; improve our processes ?


Be data-driven on all our strategies (scoring matrix, ROIst strategy, etc)







Collaboration with other teams:&nbsp; You collaborate and communicate with key stakeholders on your topics across teams &amp; B2C countries


Collaborate closely with the CRM team to align CRM and B2C objectives and execution in the “B2C campaigns”


Collaborate closely with the agency to develop out of the box concept &amp; events


Collaborate with other teams to execute, communicate (internally &amp; externally) and analyze your campaigns &amp; projects (Design, Social Media, PR, Data &amp; Insights, etc.)&nbsp;


Act as a spokesperson for the Marketing Projects scope to internal &amp; external stakeholders



👉 MUST HAVE skills
Technical skills


Data-driven &amp; strong analytical skills (perform analysis, deduct insights, develop strategies)


Project management&nbsp;


Commercial mindset &amp; understanding of brand environments&nbsp;


Marketing knowledge (consumer behavior, digital marketing, copyrighting, etc. )&nbsp;


Consumer mindset &amp; understanding of consumer trends&nbsp;


Proficiency in computer tools, mainly Microsoft Office Suite &amp; G Suite


Master in Veepee tools (Boom, Mixpanel, Microstrategy, Neolane, etc.)


Professional fluency in English (spoken &amp; written)



Behavioral skills


Data-driven


Creative and innovative thinking


Business and result oriented with an analytical mindset


Proactivity and agility, ability to find solutions&nbsp;


Attention to detail, organizational and prioritization skills


Strong oral and written communication skills&nbsp;


Strong interpersonal skills


Persuasive abilities and capabilities to unite and motivate


All our positions are open to people with health conditions or impairments.
&nbsp;
We are convinced that it is up to you to define the way you work, to develop yourself and to progress. At Veepee we guarantee that you can just be yourself! For the service of diversity and inclusion, Veepee is committed to reviewing all applications received on an equal basis.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
🔗COMPANY
