&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;Solution design &amp;amp; proposal development; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;Co-create solution designs with team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;techleads&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;that maximize standardization and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;leverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;our reusable propositions across Software, Cloud, Data &amp;amp; AI, and Security. Support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;RfP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;responses, deliver demos, reference architectures, and technical deep-dives that&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;showcase&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;our software engineering capabilities and AI-enabled solutions. Provide trusted advisory on deal structure, scoping, and pricing aligned with our strategic focus on standardized services adoption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
