&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to&amp;nbsp;new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;optimistic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe in the power of creativity,&amp;nbsp;technology&amp;nbsp;and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our&amp;nbsp;clients&amp;nbsp;and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to&amp;nbsp;seek&amp;nbsp;the unexpected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;extraordinary:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;give you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior Payroll Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Global Payroll team and play a key role in the delivery and continuous improvement of payroll across our international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior operational role with responsibility for overseeing payroll activity across multiple countries. You will bring strong payroll expertise, sound judgement and a proactive approach to ensure employees are paid accurately, on time and in compliance with local legislation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Payroll Team, internal HR and People teams, Finance, Tax and external payroll providers, you will take ownership of complex payroll activities, provide subject-matter expertise and act as a key escalation point for payroll issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will also provide opportunities to support &lt;strong&gt;international payroll projects, process improvements, system implementations and automation&lt;/strong&gt;, helping Deliveroo build a scalable and efficient global payroll operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of the &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end payroll delivery&lt;/strong&gt; for assigned international entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with local HR, People Operations, Finance and Tax teams to ensure payroll inputs are complete, accurate and delivered within agreed timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, validate and approve payroll inputs and outputs, identifying discrepancies, trends and potential risks before payroll is finalised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;legislation across multiple jurisdictions, statutory requirements and payroll practices&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring processes remain compliant and appropriately controlled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with external payroll providers, holding them accountable for &lt;strong&gt;accuracy, timeliness, compliance and service delivery&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex employee and stakeholder payroll queries, providing clear guidance and appropriate resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform and oversee payroll reconciliations, payment validation and statutory submissions, ensuring appropriate controls are completed and documented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse payroll data and reporting to identify anomalies, control weaknesses, recurring issues and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong payroll governance and documentation, ensuring processes, controls and procedures are consistently followed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify opportunities to &lt;strong&gt;simplify, standardise and automate payroll processes&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing manual intervention and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and lead payroll-related projects, including &lt;strong&gt;system implementations, payroll migrations, integrations, process changes and new entity onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology and payroll vendors to troubleshoot system and integration issues and support effective resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of payroll policies, procedures, controls and best practices across international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and provide guidance to Payroll Analysts and other team members, helping to build capability and consistency across the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with changes to payroll legislation and communicate relevant impacts to internal stakeholders and payroll providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Payroll Lead with wider global payroll initiatives and deputise where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience working in a &lt;strong&gt;payroll analyst or senior payroll position&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally within a complex, international organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience of &lt;strong&gt;international payroll&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience of &lt;strong&gt;Italy and/or France payroll highly desirable&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of Italian and/or French payroll legislation, statutory requirements and payroll processes is preferable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing payroll across multiple countries and working with &lt;strong&gt;third-party payroll providers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of payroll controls, reconciliations, payments, statutory reporting and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to interrogate payroll data, identify discrepancies and understand the root cause of issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail and a strong focus on payroll accuracy and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of identifying and implementing &lt;strong&gt;process improvements, automation and operational efficiencies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or leading payroll projects, system implementations or payroll migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills and confidence working with payroll data and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Workday/Cloudpay&lt;/strong&gt; or other HR/payroll technology is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, with the confidence to challenge, influence and provide a clear point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain complex payroll matters clearly to both payroll and non-payroll stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, solutions-focused approach and the confidence to question &lt;strong&gt;the why and the how&lt;/strong&gt; behind existing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo’s mission is to build the definitive food company by making food more convenient and accessible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a technology-driven business in one of the world’s fastest-growing industries, Deliveroo offers the opportunity to make a real impact while working in a fast-paced and innovative environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo also offers a wide range of competitive benefits across health, family, finance, community, convenience, growth, time away and relocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace and diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is committed to building a workplace that reflects the diversity of the world around us and where everyone can belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no judgement when it comes to the things that make people who they are — whether that is gender, race, sexuality, religion or even a secret aversion to coriander.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about food and excited to help shape one of the fastest-growing companies in an exciting space, Deliveroo would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo connects millions of consumers with the restaurants and brands they love. Our Integrated Marketing team sits at the heart of how we bring those relationships to life — combining customer insight, commercial opportunity and creativity to drive growth for Deliveroo and our partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within Central Integrated Marketing, the Merchant &amp;amp; Ads team sets the global strategy for how we partner with merchants to help them grow on our marketplace and create compelling reasons for consumers to choose Deliveroo. This is an opportunity to shape Deliveroo’s global approach to merchant partnerships, building high-impact collaborations with some of the world’s most recognised and loved brands. This will be a hybrid role - working 3 days a week from our London HQ.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Owns the New Verticals merchant and ads marketing strategy end to end, reporting into the Merchant &amp;amp; Ads Integrated Marketing Director.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsible for the creation and deployment of New Verticals merchant marketing playbooks across co marketing, promotions, and ads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsible for the creation and deployment of the New Verticals sell in strategy and associated sell in materials for adoption by local teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supports local marketing teams with key enterprise merchant relationships at the global level, and supports local New Verticals marketing initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ads &amp;amp; Monetization Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the New Verticals specific ads and monetization strategy across owned and external surfaces, feeding into the global monetization strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead pricing, packaging, and investment decisions for merchant advertising in your category, in partnership with Commercial and Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Category Playbook: New Verticals&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and evolve the New Verticals merchant marketing playbook, setting how co marketing, promotions, and advertising work for grocery and retail merchants globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead change initiatives that improve how New Verticals merchant marketing works, bringing Local Integrated Marketing and Functional Marketing along with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Merchant Relationship Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support local marketing teams with key enterprise merchant relationships at the global level, and support delivery of priority New Verticals marketing initiatives with those merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the senior escalation point for merchant issues that cross multiple markets or functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross Functional Stakeholder Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the primary marketing partner to Merchant S&amp;amp;O and Commercial for New Verticals, translating category priorities into marketing and ads strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent New Verticals in cross functional forums, shaping the roadmap for merchant facing and ads facing surfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Sell In Strategy &amp;amp; Sales Enablement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the sell-in strategy for New Verticals merchant and ads programmes, defining how Commercial and Local teams pitch these programmes to merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee the sell in materials, case studies, and proof points for New Verticals, using performance data to continuously refine them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Central Strategy &amp;amp; Market Coordination&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own delivery of the New Verticals merchant marketing goals, coordinating a consistent strategy across all Deliveroo markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Report on New Verticals merchant and ads marketing performance to senior stakeholders, own specific business metrics, and lead course correction when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of marketing experience, ideally including merchant marketing, retail media, ads, or category marketing in a consumer or marketplace business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track record of owning the marketing strategy for an entire team or category, and resolving complex delivery challenges that span multiple teams or functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing people, and comfortable managing other people managers as your team grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong commercial acumen, seen as a go to expert for merchant or ads marketing, using business and financial data to make sound decisions in ambiguous situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confident communicator, able to present complex ideas to large groups and flex your style for directors and department leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skilled at establishing and owning cross functional partnerships, using relationships and creative thinking to work through conflict.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to lead change initiatives that improve how a team or category works, bringing others along with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to synthesise complex, cross functional inputs into a clear plan and narrative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
