&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Campaigns &amp;amp; Activations Specialist, you will own development and delivery of campaigns that engage our buyers and sellers, create demand and support Catawiki’s wider marketing and business priorities. You will take campaigns from idea to evaluation, working closely with the Campaign &amp;amp; Activations Manager and cross-functional teams to turn opportunities into high-impact customer moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own end-to-end campaigns:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop, plan, launch and evaluate campaigns and activations across the Catawiki marketplace, from recurring moments such as No Reserve Days to new initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring fresh ideas to the table:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor market trends, cultural moments, category developments and competitor activity to identify new formats, themes and opportunities worth testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure, optimise and scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Define success metrics, monitor performance and turn results into clear learnings and recommendations. Use these insights to improve future activations and scale the formats that deliver the strongest business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape integrated campaign plans: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with CRM, Creative, Merchandising, PR, Paid Media and other channel teams to build cohesive customer journeys and ensure the right message reaches the right audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Bring stakeholders together around clear objectives, timelines and responsibilities. Keep campaigns moving, resolve day-to-day blockers and ensure teams are aligned throughout delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how we work:&lt;/strong&gt; Help strengthen campaign planning, briefing, reporting and retrospective processes, making each campaign more effective than the last.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A campaign owner and strong executor:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy taking an opportunity or a rough idea and turning it into a well-structured campaign from concept to launch that delivers results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially minded and customer-focused:&lt;/strong&gt; You can identify opportunities that create value for both the business and our buyers and sellers, and translate them into strong activation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight-led and data driven: &lt;/strong&gt;You are comfortable using data and customer insights to inform decisions, assess performance and make a clear recommendation on what to do next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel-savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand how different marketing channels work together, from CRM and onsite to social, paid media and PR, and can shape an integrated campaign plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative and proactive:&lt;/strong&gt; You work effectively across teams, communicate clearly and enjoy working in close partnership with others to move work forward in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced in marketing: &lt;/strong&gt;You have 3–5 years’ experience in campaign, growth, brand or (digital) marketing, ideally in a fast-paced and cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An early AI adopter:&lt;/strong&gt; You already use AI tools in your daily work to move faster, think broader and improve the quality of your output. You are eager to learn, automate and develop new ways of working through AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you’ll be and what we offer &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Amsterdam, the Netherlands, with a fixed 2 days per week in office under our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On our path to becoming the most visited online curated marketplace for special objects, our Engineering team is on a mission to deliver the best experience across our platforms by building best-in-class products for search and discovery, bidding, curation, logistics, payments, and support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a scale-up tackling customer-facing challenges at high scale, with 75,000 auctions per week and more than 10 million visitors per month. As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/em&gt;, you’ll support one of our three verticals - &lt;strong&gt;Demand&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Supply&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;Fulfilment&lt;/strong&gt; - improving and delivering product innovations for our platform.&lt;br&gt;Working in a small, fully autonomous, and highly collaborative Agile team, you will build scalable, maintainable, and resilient microservices and features. That’s why we’re looking for developers who share ideas, explore options, and communicate openly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of a team with end-to-end responsibility for its own microservices, collaborating across disciplines to build, operate, and continuously improve our products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt; by designing, developing, testing, deploying, maintaining, and improving scalable microservices and features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own what you deliver&lt;/strong&gt;, taking responsibility for the quality, resilience, and maintainability of your team’s services throughout their lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across disciplines&lt;/strong&gt; while closely working with product designers, product owners, and frontend, backend, and mobile engineers to share ideas and deliver product innovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how we work&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying opportunities to make our engineering processes more effective and efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen our engineering culture&lt;/strong&gt; by documenting and advocating for development best practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise product quality&lt;/strong&gt; by fixing bugs and refactoring the codebase where necessary to keep our products reliable and maintainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and experiment&lt;/strong&gt; by testing new technologies and participating in Technical Week - a week dedicated to creativity, innovation, and knowledge sharing across domains after every two product sprints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand the full lifecycle of web development, identify opportunities, explore solutions, and keep customer needs at the center of your work. Our stack is mainly focused on Ruby; however, prior Ruby experience is not essential if you’re passionate about learning new things.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Strong software engineering foundations&lt;/span&gt;: 7+ years of software development experience, specifically with object-oriented programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Relevant product experience&lt;/span&gt;: 3+ years of experience working with customer-facing products in industries such as e-commerce, fintech, or SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Backend service expertise&lt;/span&gt;: Experience designing, implementing, and deploying backend services with a focus on high availability, low latency, and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;API and data knowledge&lt;/span&gt;: A good understanding of API design, SQL, and relational databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Clear communication&lt;/span&gt;: Excellent English communication skills and comfort raising concerns, sharing ideas, and documenting your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Collaborative mindset&lt;/span&gt;: You contribute to the team, take initiative, and step in to help when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Solution-oriented thinking&lt;/span&gt;: You actively identify opportunities and explore alternative approaches to solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commitment to growth&lt;/span&gt;: You take ownership of developing your skills by learning new technologies and seeking new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our engineers work in small, fully autonomous, and highly collaborative Agile teams aligned with one of three verticals: Demand, Supply, or Fulfilment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teams are responsible for their own microservices from design and development through deployment, maintenance, and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineers collaborate closely with product designers, product owners, and frontend, backend, and mobile colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value bold thinking, curiosity, openness, initiative, and a strong customer focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Week creates dedicated space for experimentation, creativity, innovation, and knowledge sharing across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Where You&#39;ll Be&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role based in Amsterdam. &lt;strong&gt;You will work from our &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Amsterdam HQ&lt;/span&gt; a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are only considering candidates who are already based in&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;the &lt;strong&gt;Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result, &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;visa sponsorship and relocation support are not available for this position&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In Return&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;strong&gt;800+ Catawikians.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A competitive &lt;u&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/u&gt; depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;A &lt;u&gt;Work From Home Allowance&lt;/u&gt; to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Commuting&lt;/u&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Amazing &lt;u&gt;Office&lt;/u&gt; right in the centre of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, we’re looking for a Software Engineer to join our Global Talent Assessment Tooling Team (GTAT), the cornerstone of our global recruitment, engaging 100,000+ users annually. You&#39;ll be instrumental in ensuring scalability and reliability of our in house built platforms. With expertise in server-side platforms and a genuine interest in UI/UX, you&#39;ll contribute to the full software development lifecycle of our global platforms, serving as the central hub for all talent assessments, training and education activities, and test authorization. Join us in shaping the future of global talent acquisition at Optiver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver’s story began over 30 years ago, when we started business as a single trader on the floor of Amsterdam’s options exchange. Today, we are at the forefront of trading and technology as a leading global electronic market maker, focused on pricing, execution and risk management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer, you’ll be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining our talent assessment tooling platform and our assessments. This critical infrastructure is key to our ability to hire at scale and speed, representing one of the first interactions individuals have with Optiver during their recruitment journey. You’ll work within a dynamic team to ensure the platform&#39;s scalability and reliability, contributing to the success of our global talent assessment initiatives. You’ll work closely with our recruitment teams globally on a day to day basis to ensure that the platform is scalable, reliable, and user-friendly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some of what you’ll do day to day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop and maintain our assessment tooling platform and features supporting recruitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with recruitment teams on a global scale to ensure that the platform is scalable, reliable, and user-friendly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable code that is easy to understand and modify and participate in code reviews to ensure that code meets quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize frontend technologies (React/Angular) to enhance user interfaces and experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background consisting of 3+ years of experience in full stack development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in server-side development utilizing C# .NET or Python&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with relational databases (e.g. PostgreSQL or SQL Server)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with frontend technologies including HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and modern frontend frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to problem solving and an entrepreneurial attitude&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to clearly explain your thoughts through written and verbal communication, ask the right questions, and work collaboratively with a range of technical and non technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in UI/UX design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with server hosting on cloud providers (e.g. AWS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Who-we-are&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3acdce942c6b&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2863&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;197&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;550&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure unmatched anywhere in the industry. We combine our profits across desks, teams and offices into a global profit pool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 different countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health insurance, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, in-house physio and chair massages, organised sports and leisure activities, and Friday afternoon drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, our mission is to constantly improve the market by injecting liquidity, providing accurate pricing, increasing transparency and acting as a stabilizing force no matter the market conditions. With a focus on continuous improvement, we participate in the safeguarding of healthy and efficient markets for everyone who participates. As one of the largest market making institutions, we are a trusted partner of 70+ exchanges across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW TO APPLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Software Engineer - Talent Tooling. If you are selected from your application to proceed to the next round, you will be required to take an online assessment. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY STATEMENT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/?_gl=1*bh82o8*_up*MQ..&amp;amp;gclid=EAIaIQobChMItNH9v-THiQMVyJZQBh1Kbw3YEAAYASABEgI0z_D_BwE&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Diversity-statement&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a7875001389c&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3834&quot;&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3855&quot; data-local-id=&quot;70d0564c666f&quot;&gt;Optiver is committed to building a diverse and inclusive workplace where everyone can do their best work. We welcome applications from candidates of all backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;46&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa3a188234fb&quot;&gt;Our cash equities engineering team is building out systems that must ingest and react to market data feeds from major US exchanges in microseconds or less, efficiently price and hedge positions of single stocks and ETFs and execute orders with extremely low error tolerance. We continually refine, store, and analyze terabytes of data produced by market activity and our trading systems. Our user interfaces must present coherent, responsive real-time visualizations of market activity and system performance while providing intuitive control of a highly complex system. Our core systems must provide a stable, performant, and trusted foundation on which our systems are built&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;84&quot; data-local-id=&quot;71dfef2802f3&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll build the Quantitative Research framework at the core of our systematic equities business. The framework models how trading strategies would behave against historical market data, allowing researchers to test ideas before they ever reach production. The same framework researchers use to develop and test new trading ideas is the one that powers production, meaning the systems you build have a direct impact on what the desk can research, deploy and trade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;550&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7357161255c9&quot;&gt;Working alongside quant researchers and traders, you&#39;ll develop the tools, datasets and distributed systems that enable large-scale research across the cash equities markets in US, Europe and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;APAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Every improvement you make helps the team evaluate new ideas and deploy them into production faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-you&#39;ll-do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a18e1bfc56b5&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;850&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;866&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4aa94f0bc986&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with researchers and traders to build the software that underpins our systematic trading platform, from research through to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dadf2d95c583&quot;&gt;Your work will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e470951f-4820-482d-aff1-0141a0495d81&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1050&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5f731a4365ae&quot;&gt;Developing and extending the simulation framework used to research and run systematic cash equities strategies across ETFs and stocks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1188&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e4d864e70050&quot;&gt;Building distributed systems that scale backtesting and model training across cloud and on-premise compute environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1312&quot; data-local-id=&quot;934cf8181561&quot;&gt;Curating high-quality research datasets by combining live and historical market data into accurate, reproducible and scalable inputs for large-scale experimentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1481&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c93bb3c2917f&quot;&gt;Working directly with researchers to understand new requirements and translate them into robust, production-ready software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1608&quot; data-local-id=&quot;62837fd793d7&quot;&gt;Improving the tools and workflows that allow researchers to experiment, validate ideas and deploy strategies efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1733&quot; data-local-id=&quot;86ac21c290cc&quot;&gt;Applying modern AI tools where they add value across the research and software development lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Who-you-are&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dec0043f8ab2&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1838&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1851&quot; data-local-id=&quot;92e88b73d275&quot;&gt;You are a software engineer who enjoys solving complex technical problems and building systems that other engineers and researchers rely on every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2003&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ad90331d99de&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll likely have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;788db5b8-0daf-4c1f-abd5-3e034a8b831a&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;521b7c8c6851&quot;&gt;Strong Python development skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2063&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a8cd73c6122&quot;&gt;Experience building simulation, backtesting or other large-scale computational frameworks. Experience in systematic trading, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;HFT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; or quantitative finance is a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2242&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3622d5d7e6cb&quot;&gt;Experience designing and building large-scale, distributed or real-time systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2326&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31c974402b86&quot;&gt;Experience using Python in research, data-intensive or analytical environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2409&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bee9e85401b2&quot;&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals and an interest in writing reliable, maintainable production code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2520&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ac8d5b29727&quot;&gt;The following would also be beneficial:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3ea64094-ddd4-4302-bfab-e488febe010d&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2563&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d9f98a41ba90&quot;&gt;Experience with C++, particularly for performance-critical systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2634&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8b35dce16f74&quot;&gt;Experience building data pipelines using technologies such as Spark, Polars, or Airflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2726&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9f89af9d715f&quot;&gt;Familiarity with cloud infrastructure or distributed compute platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2801&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98d0180c44ba&quot;&gt;An interest in quantitative finance or systematic trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Who-we-are&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3acdce942c6b&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2863&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;197&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;550&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure unmatched anywhere in the industry. We combine our profits across desks, teams and offices into a global profit pool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 different countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health insurance, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, in-house physio and chair massages, organised sports and leisure activities, and Friday afternoon drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3790&quot; data-local-id=&quot;abc507d50a22&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, our mission is to constantly improve the market by injecting liquidity, providing accurate pricing, increasing transparency and acting as a stabilizing force no matter the market conditions. With a focus on continuous improvement, we participate in the safeguarding of healthy and efficient markets for everyone who participates. As one of the largest market making institutions, we are a trusted partner of 70+ exchanges across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW TO APPLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you interested in furthering your career on one of the most dynamic and exciting trading floors in Europe?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Core Software Engineer. If you are selected from your application to proceed to the next round for the position of Core Software Engineer, you will be required to take an online assessment. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY STATEMENT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/?_gl=1*bh82o8*_up*MQ..&amp;amp;gclid=EAIaIQobChMItNH9v-THiQMVyJZQBh1Kbw3YEAAYASABEgI0z_D_BwE&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3790&quot; data-local-id=&quot;abc507d50a22&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Diversity-statement&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a7875001389c&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3834&quot;&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3855&quot; data-local-id=&quot;70d0564c666f&quot;&gt;Optiver is committed to building a diverse and inclusive workplace where everyone can do their best work. We welcome applications from candidates of all backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ce38bbffd38a&quot;&gt;Optiver is looking for a software engineer to join our real-time pricing systems team. Team builds and runs the highly reliable, traceable and scalable pricing platform responsible for automated real-time pricing of millions of derivative contracts listed on 70+ exchanges. We continuously need to react to the new low latency pricing signals and instruct our execution to update our prices in all affected instruments. At the same time we need to continuously produce large volumes of various pricing datasets allowing us to trade, analyze and breakdown our trade quality, visualize and understand our positions, run automation, systematic analysis and trading strategies. All of this while allowing for a rapid development and pricing model research cycle with multiple releases per day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ce38bbffd38a&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;794&quot; data-local-id=&quot;73489e9dc294&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;62d86d9e7a32&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;813&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2b04f1f9696a&quot;&gt;Work directly with trading, researchers and other development teams in tightly knit working groups being responsible for overall success of the projects. We are not afraid of crossing team boundaries, learn about each other’s domain and apply this expertise in practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;813&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2b04f1f9696a&quot;&gt;Apply your engineering background to translate business problems into robust, production grade software&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on our pricing platform - already a key competitive advantage - while helping push it even further by:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;62d86d9e7a32&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;optimizing our low-latency data processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;optimizing our large scale compute&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;distribution of large volume datasets across multiple physical locations while ensuring consistency and atomicity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;increasing automation to further reduce our time to market&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1562&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7c30a12c9431&quot;&gt;Have a direct impact on business with a tight feedback loop&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1625&quot; data-local-id=&quot;83dd3f1996ef&quot;&gt;Join a strong and dynamic team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1661&quot; data-local-id=&quot;294ee24936ca&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1661&quot; data-local-id=&quot;294ee24936ca&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1677&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dc997733bea7&quot;&gt;A software engineer with an entrepreneurial mindset and the ability to strategically identify the tools which are best placed and where time is best spent, to achieve the results needed for our business to continue performing at the highest possible level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f36214c883fd&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1937&quot; data-local-id=&quot;901b10816aca&quot;&gt;Experience designing and building large-scale, distributed or real-time systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2020&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fe96d64c9f60&quot;&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals and an interest in writing reliable, maintainable production code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2130&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1841fd8d2d41&quot;&gt;Ability to operate autonomously as well as collaborate with Traders, Researchers, other technical teams and business operations counterparts to deliver on complex business initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2317&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5adf1ef4a1a2&quot;&gt;Experience with C++ is a plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2350&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6be38e38b561&quot;&gt;Interest in systematic trading, derivatives pricing, or quantitative finance more broadly is a strong plus - but not a hard requirement; we will teach you what you need to know&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;200&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;553&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;585&quot;&gt;A performance-based bonus structure&amp;nbsp;unmatched&amp;nbsp;anywhere in the industry. We combine our profits across desks, teams and offices into a global profit pool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;742&quot;&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 40 different countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;841&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days and fully paid first-class commuting expenses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;913&quot;&gt;Training opportunities and discounts on health insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;974&quot;&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast and lunch, world-class barista coffee, sports and leisure activities, Friday afternoon drinks, and weekly in-house chair massages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1152&quot;&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, our mission is to constantly improve the market by injecting liquidity, providing accurate pricing, increasing transparency and acting as a stabilizing force no matter the market conditions. With a focus on continuous improvement, we participate in the safeguarding of healthy and efficient markets for everyone who participates. As one of the largest market making institutions, we are a trusted partner of 70+ exchanges across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
