&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9466&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f2884e31ae2d&quot;&gt;Technically credible and comfortable staying close to production systems, architectural decisions and difficult delivery problems.&lt;/p&gt;
