&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10010&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9f9e1f5962bf&quot;&gt;Comfortable building something new, including the ambiguity, the stakeholder management and the patience that a first year of a new team requires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10160&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5b6c658858ed&quot;&gt;You are likely someone who has spent a significant part of your career close to complex systems rather than moving entirely away from technology as your leadership responsibilities grew. At the same time, you recognize that at this level your impact comes from the quality of the team you build, the decisions you enable others to make, and your ability to create alignment across a global organization.&lt;/p&gt;
