&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, world-class trading relies on world-class infrastructure. As the EU &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DCE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Lead, you&#39;ll own the operational and project delivery layer for our European data center engineering team — spanning Amsterdam, Frankfurt, and London. You&#39;ll drive major infrastructure projects end-to-end, build the team&#39;s capability, and ensure we execute consistently to standard. If you&#39;re a proven people leader who thrives on delivery, accountability, and building high-performing teams in fast-paced environments, this role puts you at the centre of our physical infrastructure.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
