&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2156&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6920e8cb884d&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel within Europe to support regional data center operations&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
