&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re not like most. We don’t just overcome obstacles – we don’t see them. Instead, we see the potential in every person,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;and every situation. We don’t wait for opportunity to appear – we create it. Meet ASM. A company that has been&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;searching for people just like you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who is ASM? ASM is a leading, global supplier of semiconductor wafer processing equipment. Our ambitious team is dedicated to delivering innovative technology solutions to the world’s leading semiconductor manufacturers. We have&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;over 2,200 employees based in 16 countries. Our goal is to remain an industry leader by being ahead of what’s next. We&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;accomplish this by focusing on finding collaborative solutions to make integrated circuits, or chips, smaller, faster and&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;even more powerful&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ASM is an inclusive workplace. We at ASM are a truly global organization that works diligently with an open-mind in all&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;areas of our business. We strive for a culture and work style that fosters trust and transparency. We put our people first,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We Care and that is how we will continue to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Position Summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Senior Manager, Spares Account Management is responsible for leading, managing, growing, and strengthening&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;relationships with the organization&#39;s most important customers. This senior-level role serves as a trusted business advisor&lt;br&gt;to key accounts, ensuring customer satisfaction, driving revenue growth, identifying strategic opportunities, and aligning&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;customer objectives with the company&#39;s products, services, operational capabilities, and long-term strategy.&lt;br&gt;The Senior Manager, Spares Account Management works cross-functionally with sales, customer service, operations,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;supply chain, finance, and leadership teams to deliver exceptional customer experiences, maximize account value, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;support customer retention and expansion. This position also provides people leadership by guiding, coaching, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;developing team members, setting clear expectations, building accountability, and fostering a high-performance culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;focused on collaboration, responsiveness, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;1.Customer Relationship Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Serve as the primary contact for assigned key accounts regarding spare parts requirements.&lt;br&gt;• Build and maintain strong customer relationships to enhance satisfaction and long-term partnerships.&lt;br&gt;• Conduct regular business reviews with customers.&lt;br&gt;• Manage customer expectations related to delivery, inventory availability, and service levels.&lt;br&gt;• Proactively identify and resolve customer issues and escalations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;2. Inventory Management (Consignment &amp;amp; Billable Inventory)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Manage customer consignment inventory and billable spare parts inventory.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor inventory levels to ensure optimal stock availability while minimizing excess and obsolete&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;inventory.&lt;br&gt;• Drive inventory replenishment strategies based on consumption trends and customer requirements.&lt;br&gt;• Ensure inventory accuracy through regular reviews and reconciliation processes.&lt;br&gt;• Support inventory optimization initiatives to improve inventory turns and working capital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;3. Demand Planning &amp;amp; Forecasting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Develop and maintain demand forecasts for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Install/Qual (IQ)&lt;br&gt;• Warranty (W)&lt;br&gt;• Recommended Spare Parts List (RSL)&lt;br&gt;• Maintenance Parts&lt;br&gt;• Critical Spare Parts Lists&lt;br&gt;• Analyze historical consumption data, equipment population, and maintenance plans to improve forecast&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;accuracy.&lt;br&gt;• Collaborate with customers and internal stakeholders to identify upcoming demand fluctuations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;4. Stakeholder Coordination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Act as the liaison between customers and internal functions - Buyers / Procurement, Supply&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Chain,Planning, Logistics, Service Operations&lt;br&gt;• Coordinate actions to resolve supply constraints and expedite critical orders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in supply reviews and operational planning meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support continuous communication across stakeholders to ensure on-time delivery and customer&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5. &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Lead, coach, and mentor account management team members to improve performance, customer&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;ownership, and professional development.&lt;br&gt;• Set clear expectations, priorities, and accountability standards for team members supporting strategic&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;accounts.&lt;br&gt;• Provide regular feedback, performance guidance, and support for issue resolution and escalation&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote a culture of collaboration, proactive communication, continuous improvement, and customer first execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;• Partner with leadership to identify capability gaps, resource needs, and development opportunities across&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6.&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt; Reporting &amp;amp; KPI Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Own and report performance metrics for assigned accounts.&lt;br&gt;2. Prepare and present regular operational and business performance reports.&lt;br&gt;3. Track and drive improvements in key KPIs, including: Customer Satisfaction, Forecast Accuracy,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Inventory Availability, Inventory Turns,Service Level / Fill Rate, Consignment Inventory Utilization,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Revenue Growth from Spare Parts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Sales, Marketing, Supply Chain, Operations, or related field.&lt;br&gt;• 10+ years of account management, customer success, sales, operations, or strategic relationship management&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;experience, including experience leading or mentoring teams.&lt;br&gt;• Experience managing large, complex, or enterprise-level customer accounts.&lt;br&gt;• Strong business acumen and commercial management skills.&lt;br&gt;• Excellent communication and presentation skills.&lt;br&gt;• Ability to influence stakeholders at all organizational levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Demonstrated people leadership experience, including coaching, performance management, expectation setting,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;and team development.&lt;br&gt;• Proven ability to lead cross-functional teams, influence senior stakeholders, and drive accountability across&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;complex customer and operational environments.&lt;br&gt;• Proficiency in CRM systems, Power BI, and Microsoft Office Suite.&lt;br&gt;• Travel to customer sites up to 50% of the time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience in manufacturing, supply chain, customer service, technology, or industrial sectors.&lt;br&gt;• Knowledge of customer engagement methodologies and account planning.&lt;br&gt;• Experience managing multi-million-dollar customer portfolios.&lt;br&gt;• MBA or advanced business degree preferred.&lt;br&gt;• Strong analytical and financial management capabilities.&lt;br&gt;• Experience with Lean, Six Sigma, or continuous improvement methodologies.&lt;br&gt;• Project management experience.&lt;br&gt;• Experience leading account management, customer service, supply chain, or operations teams in a matrixed&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;organization.&lt;br&gt;• Professional certification such as Lean Six Sigma Green Belt, PMP, or APICS preferred.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer I, Product Intelligence – developer focus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and parse our product and process data for optimization, control and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement AI/ML methodology to build models allowing process design and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD in data science, data engineering, computer science or another related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alternatively, a master’s degree in the above with 4+ years of relevant work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specific experience in developing custom ML algorithms and models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in small and large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python, C++ considered an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in delivering impact using statistical analysis, predictive modeling, and machine learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data implementation and pulling datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in hardware characterization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in creating virtual metrology models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end experience in building models – including, but not limited to model optimization, A/B testing, and experimental design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication with technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong teamwork skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer Product Intelligence (Software &amp;amp; Systems)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior AI Systems &amp;amp; Applications Engineer to turn advanced AI into reliable, secure and scalable software applications to solve high value problems for engineers working in a highly controlled environment. You will bridge software architecture, applied AI and product delivery to support successful application delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the application layer connecting AI models, internal data, domain tools and expert users, turning AI capabilities into software applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and enhance AI-enabled workflow automation, and decision-support applications for technical users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deploy workflows and secure model orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ground AI systems in data schemas, constraints and feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable backend services, APIs (batched and events processing), data pipelines, and deployment patterns for production AI applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply secure software patterns for IP-sensitive environments, including controlled access, auditability, data minimization and policy-aware retrieval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc or PhD in Computer Science, Software engineering, Data Science, Engineering or a related technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience building and deploying AI/ML software products in R&amp;amp;D &amp;amp; engineering or relevant domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have successfully built adopted applications using SoTA agent orchestration and harness engineering frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Python, JavaScript/TypeScript, Java, C++, and other relevant languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in local AI inference &amp;amp; quantization architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering capability across front end and backend services pipelines for AI agent applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with LLM systems (open and closed models), agentic AI tools and methods – harness engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with production hybrid AI infrastructure, CI/CD, containerization and MLOps ( Mflow, Kubeflow).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AI engineering security frameworks and applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who will thrive in this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will thrive here if you combine software engineering depth, product judgment and curiosity for technical domains. You enjoy learning from experts, translating operational bottlenecks into product opportunities and building AI systems that are grounded, traceable, secure and useful for real engineering work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

