&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will bridge the gap between software development and hardware integration, designing robust test suites that push our firmware to its limits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;You thrive in the lab and enjoy &quot;breaking&quot; things to make them better, and you have a deep understanding of how software interacts with physical circuitry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
