&lt;p class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW155681511 BCX0&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone with strong engineering fundamentals and real-world experience building software for complex, safety-critical or aerospace systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
