&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a 6 month fixed term contract initially, with a strong likelihood of extention.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is part of our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Global Studios&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; team. We create emotive yet conversion-focused ideas, products and campaigns at scale and speed. Our specialty is hyper-personalised, digital communications that change perceptions, shape new behaviours, and shift market share for our clients.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Account Director, you will be responsible for building strong relationships with clients at all levels including strategic input, and overseeing the delivery of a wide variety of substantial integrated campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be required to manage client briefs from start to finish, planning, assigning and reviewing creative and managing the overall agency workload in partnership with the producers and the senior design team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working closely with designers, copywriters, developers and other parts of the agency to ensure successful campaign deliveries which are profitable without compromising creative integrity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage client briefs from start to finish, ensuring successful delivery to client deadlines across multiple campaigns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with clients and manage their expectations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Re-lay client feedback to designers, copywriters and developers &amp;amp; plan and manage workloads of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure client requirements are met whilst protecting DEPT® values/brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the senior team with administrative tasks.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a full understanding of the clients’ business, strategies, objectives, brand, audiences and challenges, advising on the communications solution that best meets their needs, with a view to becoming their trusted adviser.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build excellent working relationships with key clients – regular meetings, planning, briefing, evaluation.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with creative and strategy teams and to have oversight of all statements of work/proposals as well as all content production for clients.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the right DEPT® team is in place to deliver, high standards are maintained and adding value wherever possible. Ensure success criteria are met and projects are delivered to time and to budget.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a good knowledge of all DEPT® products and services and actively promote them to clients.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report to senior management with internal and external issues and events that might impact upon accounts, either positively or negatively.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct account management activity – undertaking pitches and presentations, formulating and implementing account plans, and running the account management process.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold key new business development responsibilities, working with others in the team to proactively seek new opportunities for the business. Writing proposals and creative treatment. Contributing to winning new business.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure processes are followed and that there is consistent professional delivery (to brief). Managing workflows. Lead Account Direction best practice within the Agency.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strategic overview of key accounts and their markets – running regular internal client-facing account reviews. To prove how we are meeting our clients’  objectives through metrics, feedback, research, etc.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the client contract, to proactively manage the account and resources to maximise profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Management and leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delegate and allocate responsibilities efficiently to manage projects end to end.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview candidates and hire resources.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct performance reviews of team members and identify areas of improvement, give feedback and recommend for promotions or salary increments.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively lead teams and inspire others to achieve goals through innovation, quality and excellence.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify strengths and weaknesses of team members and suitably make changes if required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encourage team interaction, boost employee motivation and appreciate team contribution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Match project tasks with opportunities for development so that employee potential is utilised to the maximum.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage change and effectively cascade information to teams to ensure smooth execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering a broad range of multi-channel marketing communications including digital and direct.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely organised, with the ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure and meet and manage deadlines with ease and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great team player and team-building skills. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management/leadership skills. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiator with good networking ability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively with team giving guidance and feedback.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resource management skills and ability to handle complex issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the production &amp;amp; interactive processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent planning and organisation skills. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage and develop client and supplier relationships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to commercially manage budgets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven business development experience and success. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced working knowledge of Microsoft Office Packages. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible hybrid working policy to enjoy the best of both worlds (2 days from the office, depending on location).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Early Finish Fridays, kickstart your weekend early with alternating early-finish Fridays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days paid holiday, plus UK Bank Holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to dedicated mental health resources including enhanced sick pay scheme, employee assistance programme and trained Mental Health First Aiders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Pension Scheme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a Private Medical Insurance or Cash Plan scheme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loan, interest-free Season Ticket Loans to help spread the cost of travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme, save money on a new bike and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EV Car Scheme, access to an electric vehicle via a salary sacrifice arrangement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family-friendly policies to support parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace Nursery Scheme, save on childcare by paying for nursery fees through a tax-efficient salary sacrifice scheme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DEPT® Allowance, a dedicated company contribution to spend on either your professional development or personal wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social and Cultural Events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development, continuous growth opportunities through internal training, and &quot;inspirational talks” guest speakers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy Program, you will be paired with a ‘Buddy’ to help you navigate your first weeks’ at DEPT®.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Certified BCorp Agency and is multi-award winning “Agency of the Year”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global, at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt;, an annual initiative where our teams donate their professional skills and time to support local charities and pr-bono projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our organisation continues to grow, attracting the best talent remains one of our highest priorities. To achieve this, it&#39;s essential to adapt by refining our recruitment strategies, upholding exceptional quality in our efforts, and embracing innovative recruitment methodologies. This is where our Talent Acquisition (TA) team plays a vital role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In the role of Tech Talent Acquisition Specialist, you will play a pivotal part in achieving the team&#39;s primary goal: attracting and hiring the right talent for Vinted while ensuring an outstanding candidate experience. Leveraging your expertise in recruitment, you will implement best hiring practices and collaborate with other team members on various projects. You will focus on supporting our key tech areas, including Engineering, Product Management, Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics, Design, and Research, to ensure we secure the best talent for these functions (note: your specific focus may shift based on business needs).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you&#39;re excited to contribute to our team&#39;s efforts in supporting our organisation&#39;s growth, we would love to meet you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Note. This role is offered as a 12-month fixed-term contract initially. There may be an opportunity for the position to be made permanent in the future, depending on business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with hiring managers to understand hiring needs and ensure a seamless interview process to attract the right talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end recruitment process, including job posting, proactive candidate sourcing, conducting interviews, and extending offers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build effective candidate talent pools through proactive sourcing, job boards, employee referrals, social media &amp;amp; employer branding campaigns etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide hiring managers and interviewers on effective interview techniques and candidate evaluation methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on key hiring metrics to ensure efficient recruitment processes, while providing a positive candidate and hiring manager experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to talent acquisition initiatives by contributing to process improvement projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about recruitment best practices and tools to continually improve the candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience as a Sourcer, Recruiter or Talent Acquisition Specialist specifically focused on hiring for tech roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in sourcing candidates using LinkedIn and other recruitment tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in candidate engagement and relationship building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of assessment tools and interview evaluation techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English, with the ability to collaborate across teams and levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset and eagerness to learn and grow within the talent acquisition field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€47.300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€63.900 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Information about the position&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted&#39;s CRM team under marketing owns the relationship we have with tens of millions of members across our owned channels (email, push, in-app, content cards). Growth doesn&#39;t only come from acquiring new members; it also comes from getting existing members to list, buy or return at the right moment, which is what CRM drives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Team Lead to own CRM&#39;s analytics agenda, not just its delivery. The team has built a strong delivery foundation; the next chapter is ownership - setting the agenda rather than responding to it. We want a lead who brings a strategic point of view, challenges what&#39;s worth doing, and comes to the business with proactive plans rather than just answers to the questions asked. Your work directly shapes how we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report to the Director of Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics, Marketing, with the Director of CRM as your primary stakeholder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you&#39;ll&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own CRM&#39;s analytics agenda:&lt;/strong&gt; set direction and priorities instead of just delivering requests, and challenge the team and stakeholders on what&#39;s worth doing in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set CRM measurement strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; build a clear, credible approach to measuring the incremental impact of marketing CRM activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build targeting capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; guide the development of predictive models and segmentation to grow and refine addressable audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn insights into action:&lt;/strong&gt; bring proactive insights and recommendations that shape experimentation and campaign strategy, not just report on what happened.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay hands-on:&lt;/strong&gt; dedicate around 20-50% of your time to the hardest problems yourself, reviewing analysis quality and unblocking the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work across teams:&lt;/strong&gt; act as the connective link between CRM, Member Lifecycle and the other Marketing and Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics teams. Influence through the evidence you bring, shaping their roadmaps and improving common measurement standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the team:&lt;/strong&gt; manage, mentor and grow a small team of Decision Scientists, covering day-to-day planning, onboarding and career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical and analytical foundations: solid experience in experimentation and causal inference, test design and segmentation. (at least 4-8 years of analytical experience is expected)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough seniority to hold your own with senior marketing stakeholders and act as a credible sparring partner across the domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable moving from a delivery mindset to an ownership mindset: proactively spotting what&#39;s worth doing, not just executing requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;d prefer people leadership (PL) experience, though we&#39;re open to a strong Individual Contributor moving into a lead role if you already take charge of problems and have credible people skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM marketing analytics experience is a strong bonus, not a must. What matters most is being fast and proactive at picking it up if it&#39;s new to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable balancing hands-on analytical work with team leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and pragmatic with AI tooling: you&#39;ve used it to change how analytics work gets done - automating recurring analysis, speeding up exploration, or building agentic workflows that take routine work off the team&#39;s plate - while knowing where it genuinely helps and where it doesn&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative background - Data Science, Statistics, Economics, Maths, Computer Science or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable enough with our tech stack (Python, SQL, GCP/BigQuery, Looker)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
