&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€67.700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Decision Scientist within the Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics (DSA) function, you will join our dedicated Payments Fraud Management team to safeguard Vinted’s financial ecosystem while maintaining a seamless experience for legitimate users. Reporting to the DSA Manager for Marketplace Payments, you will work in a high-stakes, cross-functional environment alongside Product Manager, Engineering Manager, and Engineers. By analyzing massive datasets and leveraging statistical modeling, you will optimize the balance between real-time ML predictors, hand-crafted business rules, and third-party fraud networks. Ultimately, you will play a key role in shaping our payments products and driving critical initiatives - from evaluating next-gen external fraud signals to safeguarding post-pay-in lifecycles - ensuring every transaction remains secure, efficient, and reliable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with your team and stakeholders at Vinted, to identify strategic opportunities and provide data-driven recommendations, as well as answer critical business questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and analyse developed opportunities to validate their value and understand their business impact, using statistical methods and visualisation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select, calculate, and monitor your team&#39;s key performance indicators, proactively flagging issues, running analyses and understanding root causes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable your team and direct stakeholders to independently leverage data for business insights via self-service dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a data-driven culture by promoting best practices in analytics and decision-making to make data count.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-create together with Data Scientists to enhance fraud detection processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a Decision Science or Data Analytics role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Fraud Prevention, Trust &amp;amp; Safety, or a related area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good analytical thinking and problem-solving skills, with the ability to balance depth of analysis with business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL and Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with BI tools (e.g., Looker, Tableau, Power BI)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of statistical methods, such as A/B testing, regression analysis, and other inferential techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly results-oriented and comfortable with iterative processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator who can convincingly present results to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€67.700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted’s &lt;strong&gt;Marketing domain&lt;/strong&gt; is growing - we’re on a mission to make Vinted known and loved as the go-to destination for everything second-hand. Marketing is one of the primary drivers behind our biggest strategic goals, from &lt;strong&gt;winning the USA market&lt;/strong&gt; to expanding beyond fashion into a &lt;strong&gt;multi-vertical platform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Data Science and Analytics&lt;/strong&gt; team to hands-on build, refine, and scale our core predictive and explanatory models. In this role, you will be the technical engine behind our Bayesian Media Mix Models (MMM), user value machine learning models, and advanced statistical frameworks. Your focus will be on engineering robust, high-performing models that transform complex data into the precise insights our domain relies on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolve Our Marketing Measurement:&lt;/strong&gt; Code, calibrate, and scale our Bayesian Media Mix Models (MMM) and ROI frameworks to unlock precise business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Deploy Core Models:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain sophisticated econometric and statistical models (MMM, GMV, engagement) to quantify marketing impact and guide multi-channel growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate Model Validation &amp;amp; Health Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Design automated frameworks and reliability metrics that continuously monitor model health and ensure long-term accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Next-Gen, Automated Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the ambition toward intelligent data products [such as self-healing MMMs] using modern AI and automation to optimize model runtimes and scale our ecosystem as Vinted grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Decision Scientists &amp;amp; Marketing Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the core technical partner, translating complex mechanics into clear concepts and helping the team connect model outputs to robust business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Modelling Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a high bar for code quality, rigorous validation, and reproducibility to ensure our data science practices remain clean and trusted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Data Science Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience focused on advanced statistical, econometric, or time-series modelling (experience in marketing measurement/MMM is an advantage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Theoretical Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundation in advanced statistics, causal inference, and regression. Familiarity with probabilistic programming (e.g., PyMC) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research-to-Application Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to read scientific papers, explore state-of-the-art techniques, and replicate or adapt advanced methodologies to solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production-Grade Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly proficient in Python, with a passion for building models as data products. You design your pipelines and code so they are modular, reproducible, and easily used or extended by other scientists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business-Minded Tech Partner:&lt;/strong&gt; You care deeply about the why behind your code, naturally connecting technical model outputs to commercial metrics and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational Background:&lt;/strong&gt; A Master’s or PhD degree in a highly quantitative discipline (Statistics, Econometrics, Mathematics, Data Science, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impactful storyteller:&lt;/strong&gt; A charismatic and confident presenter who navigates any topic’s technicality, actively driving and facilitating strategic business conversations across both technical and leadership audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€67.700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Buyer Domain at Vinted is dedicated to creating a seamless, delightful, and highly engaging experience for our members as they search, discover, and purchase items. Our challenge is unique: unlike standard e-commerce, our peer-to-peer catalog consists of hundreds of millions of entirely unique, single-inventory listings, with millions of new items uploaded daily. Connecting the right buyer with the perfect item in real-time is at the very core of Vinted&#39;s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To tackle this challenge at scale, we are looking to bring talented Data Scientists into the Buyer Domain&#39;s two highly specialized, ML-focused teams:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Search Relevance:&lt;/strong&gt; This team is responsible for the retrieval and ranking systems that power search queries across all markets. Their mission is to ensure our members can effortlessly find exactly what they are looking for in Vinted&#39;s vast, unique catalog. The team&#39;s ownership and focus areas include multi-stage search ranking pipelines, query intent classification, semantic dense retrieval, and the integration of ML relevance models with content policy controls, all optimized for real-time execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommender Relevance:&lt;/strong&gt; This team owns the Recommender System that powers Vinted’s Homepage Feed and which is responsible for driving a significant portion of all discoveries and purchases across the platform. Their mission is to inspire our members by surfacing highly personalized, engaging, and relevant recommendations. The team&#39;s ownership and focus areas include deep sequence-based user modeling, real-time candidate generation and ranking, and exploration of diverse member interests, built to handle massive scale and high-throughput constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work with you to match your background, technical interests, and experience with the team where you can drive the most impact. Regardless of the team you join, you will be a proactive product partner. We work in a highly collaborative culture to align on technical approaches, and we validate all changes through rigorous offline evaluation and online A/B testing on our custom-built, in-house Experimentation platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize end-to-end machine learning models for retrieval, ranking, and personalization (e.g. gradient boosting, two-tower architectures, sequence models, and neural rerankers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with platform and software engineers to serve models directly in our search and recommendation engines, optimizing for high throughput and millisecond-level latency budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or contribute to collaborative design proposals for new modeling approaches, features, or training pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define tracking requirements, perform offline evaluations, and design and analyze online A/B tests to measure real-world business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Data, Engineering and Product stakeholders to identify product opportunities, translate business problems into ML objectives, and align on technical trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge, participate in peer reviews, and actively contribute to the growth and development of other scientists in the ML Guild and the Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for Data Scientists who strike a balance between deep technical curiosity and practical business impact, engineers who are passionate about making second-hand fashion highly discoverable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong collaborator with hands-on experience designing, training, and deploying machine learning models in a production environment (ideally within search, recommendations, or large-scale personalization).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proficiency in Python and SQL. Experience with deep learning frameworks and gradient boosting libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of modern information retrieval, Learning-to-Rank (LTR), semantic search, or sequence-based user preference modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or strong interest in high-performance model serving. Familiarity with search/vector engines like Vespa or Elasticsearch, and serving frameworks like Triton, is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with massive datasets in modern cloud-based data warehouses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of statistics, offline evaluation metrics, and online A/B testing methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€67.700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Backend Engineer II&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Engineering Experience domain in Vinted&#39;s Platform unit. Our domain builds the tools, platforms and golden paths that the rest of Vinted Engineering relies on every day - from the first line of code an engineer writes to the moment it runs safely in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineering Experience is made up of several teams, each owning a part of the engineering workflow:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &lt;/strong&gt;owns the flow from commit to production: code repository hosting and continuous integration, build artifacts and secrets, and deployment through ArgoCD - built and run in-house as self-service products for every engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development Environments &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for development environments and the engineering AI tooling ecosystem. Its flagship is Spinup, a cloud development environment that lets engineers and coding agents validate changes in remote environments without the complexity of managing local services. The team also leads the adoption of AI-assisted engineering across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevPortal &lt;/strong&gt;builds Vinted&#39;s internal developer portal - the service catalog and self-service workflows that give every team clear ownership and one place to provision and operate their services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; delivers tooling and processes for effective quality assurance across Vinted, from test infrastructure to reporting and quality metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join one of these teams - Development Environments &amp;amp; AI or CI/CD. You&#39;ll report to your team&#39;s Engineering Manager and collaborate closely with the other Engineering Experience teams.&amp;nbsp;As a member of this domain, you will suggest, design and implement solutions for fast and reliable development, integration, delivery and quality, and ensure their successful adoption across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore, adopt and enable AI-assisted approaches for your own delivery and to improve the efficiency and quality of others across Vinted&#39;s software development life cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and own tools, services and frameworks that make development, delivery and quality fast and reliable, using technologies such as Go, Ruby and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See your output used by hundreds of other engineers across Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make Vinted&#39;s codebase work well with coding agents - the context, conventions and scaffolding that raise the quality of AI-generated code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build tooling and introduce processes to handle complex problems, such as growing pull request review load, AI assisted PR-merge pipelines, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve environments and pipelines so agents and engineers can validate changes in seconds instead of managing services on their own machines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your solutions end-to-end, from idea and research to wide adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have substantial experience designing, building, and operating backend systems, platforms, or developer tools used at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You heavily use AI to boost your work, and you&#39;re keen to help other engineers do the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience designing and shipping tools, platforms or services that other engineers depend on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write clean, maintainable and testable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to make a codebase work well with AI - the context, conventions, guardrails and evaluation that raise the quality and safety of AI-generated code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the practical limits and risks of LLM-based tools and design around them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You exhibit strong thought leadership in your area and have opinions about how things should be done, you can influence technical direction, mentor others and drive adoption of best practices across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about engineering experience and developer productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It&#39;s a plus if you have hands-on experience with Go, Kubernetes, or building developer tooling and CI/CD systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It&#39;s a plus if you have experience working in platform-like teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€85.900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€116.200 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Backend Engineer to join the Engineering Experience domain in Vinted&#39;s Platform unit. Our domain builds the tools, platforms and golden paths that the rest of Vinted Engineering relies on every day - from the first line of code an engineer writes to the moment it runs safely in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineering Experience is made up of several teams, each owning a part of the engineering workflow:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &lt;/strong&gt;owns the path from idea to Docker image and on to production: code repository hosting and continuous integration, build artifacts and secrets, and deployment through ArgoCD - all offered as managed, self-serve services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development Environments &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for development environments and the engineering AI tooling ecosystem. Its flagship is Spinup, a cloud development environment that lets engineers and coding agents validate changes in remote environments without the complexity of managing local services. The team also leads the adoption of AI-assisted engineering across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevPortal &lt;/strong&gt;builds Vinted&#39;s internal developer portal - the service catalog and self-service workflows that give every team clear ownership, golden paths and one place to provision and operate their services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; delivers tooling and golden paths for effective quality assurance across Vinted, from test infrastructure to reporting and quality metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your strengths and interests, you’ll join one of these teams, where you’ll help suggest, design, and implement solutions that enable fast and reliable development, integration, delivery, and quality — while ensuring their successful adoption across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Technical Design &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;: Design, build, and own backend services, tooling, and frameworks that make development and delivery fast, safe, and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive AI-Assisted Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;: Explore, adopt, and integrate AI-assisted workflows and coding agents across the software development lifecycle — creating the context, conventions, guardrails, and evaluation frameworks that ensure AI-generated code meets Vinted’s high quality and safety standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate Developer Feedback Loops&lt;/strong&gt;: Improve cloud environments (such as Spinup) and automated CI/CD/PR pipelines so engineers and autonomous agents can validate and merge changes in seconds rather than managing local environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Code Quality &amp;amp; Testing&lt;/strong&gt;: Write clean, modular, and maintainable code with thorough test coverage across all layers (Unit, Integration, E2E), while keeping architectures pragmatic and avoiding over-engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Observability &amp;amp; Reliability&lt;/strong&gt;: Build robust monitoring, logging, and alerting for platform services, proactively identifying performance bottlenecks and leading the resolution of complex issues and incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor &amp;amp; Elevate Peers&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively guide and mentor fellow engineers, conduct insightful code reviews, share best practices, and write clear technical proposals (RFCs / ADRs) to build consensus and drive adoption across the engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid Engineering Foundations&lt;/strong&gt;: You have substantial experience designing, building, and running scalable backend systems and distributed services in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic System Designer: You understand architectural trade-offs, know how to balance quick iteration with long-term system stability, and create clear boundaries and interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Developer Tooling Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You actively use AI tools to accelerate your own engineering workflow, understand the practical limitations and failure modes of LLMs, and know how to design guardrails and scaffolding around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Problem-Solving: &lt;/strong&gt;You are comfortable taking ambiguous engineering problems, breaking them down into structured milestones, and driving them to completion with high autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: You enjoy mentoring less experienced engineers, providing actionable feedback, and collaborating across teams to help colleagues adopt new tools and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Observability Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand how application code interacts with infrastructure and are accustomed to instrumenting your services with metrics, traces, and logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and spoken English, with the ability to articulate technical ideas clearly through documentation, RFCs, and discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It’s a plus if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Go, Kubernetes, Docker, ArgoCD, or cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working in a Platform, Developer Tooling, CI/CD, or DevEx team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating LLM APIs, coding agents, or developer productivity workflows into real-world development pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
