&lt;p&gt;​​We are&amp;nbsp;seeking&amp;nbsp;an entrepreneurial, highly motivated individual to help grow our burgeoning corporate sales channel. The right candidate&amp;nbsp;isn’t&amp;nbsp;afraid of striking up a conversation with someone they just met, and is driven to succeed in a competitive, ever-changing environment. They&amp;nbsp;think outside the box, are comfortable iterating on a pitch deck, can build rapport easily or influence stakeholders to close a deal. This role is ideal for someone with a few years of full-cycle, revenue-based selling experience, and is excited to bring their skills to the&amp;nbsp;ClassPass&amp;nbsp;Corporate team to hit the ground running.​ &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, prospect and vet both inbound and potential&amp;nbsp;medium to&amp;nbsp;large&amp;nbsp;size&amp;nbsp;clients to&amp;nbsp;purchase&amp;nbsp;and successfully implement&amp;nbsp;ClassPass’ corporate wellness&amp;nbsp;program &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage your own pipeline by&amp;nbsp;utilising&amp;nbsp;online and offline resources to cultivate new and existing opportunities, including use of CRM,&amp;nbsp;email&amp;nbsp;and other outreach&amp;nbsp;tools&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive through the full sales cycle by making/sending introductory calls and emails, assessing and building relationships, performing sales&amp;nbsp;presentations&amp;nbsp;and closing the best deal for both&amp;nbsp;ClassPass&amp;nbsp;and the client, all while&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;a strong close&amp;nbsp;rate &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative, fun, and innovative ways in which you connect and build out your relationships with potential partners and share across the&amp;nbsp;team &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
