&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: London, UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office requirement&lt;/strong&gt;: Hybrid, 3 days per week in the office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type&lt;/strong&gt;: Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As our &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Customer Success Executive,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be a part of our dynamic global revenue team reporting to the VP Customer Success - Midmarket. You’ll be responsible for helping to implement and execute an account retention plan focusing on driving high renewal rates and client engagement at scale, in line with GWI’s growth strategy across the Essentials Portfolio&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sounds great, what will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt; 🤔&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;br&gt;Working with our Essentials portfolio, you will be part of a team of 2. You will own and manage strategy for driving engagement and usage at scale across our Essentials portfolio - 250 accounts globally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A few things you&#39;ll be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a team you will own all CS communications to the Essential portfolio to help inspire clients, drive usage and engagement at scale within the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify at risk accounts within the portfolio and devise strategies to mitigate that risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be familiar with the renewal process, and help drive high retention numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on driving high customer satisfaction that leads to customer retention and growth by measuring key performance indicators such as churn, retention rate, and Net Promoter Score (NPS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing best-in-class support and guidance to users via email, live chat, and video calls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate, support, and build cross-departmental relationships with all teams across revenue, product, marketing, and channel customer feedback to relevant departments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure superior usage and client engagement across the Essentials portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and handle user/account administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep Salesforce up-to-date by logging all activity and engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do I need to bring with me? 🧳&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll need to be able to demonstrate the core skills this role requires. Here’s what the team will be looking for in you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing experience in Customer Success or an equivalent client-facing role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and able to juggle multiple tasks at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with close attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to bring data to life with stories and present with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine passion for working with people and helping others&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player, able to build strong relationships with colleagues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work autonomously and look for improvements in ways of working and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural ability to switch between different roles and wear different hats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with market research/audience profiling data at an agency, media publisher, advertiser, or marketing research firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working for a B2B tech platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Salesforce, live chat software, and product analytics tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion 🫶&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity is fundamental to who we are—as a data company and as a workplace. Our data reflects global realities, and so must our teams. We strive to build a workforce as diverse and inclusive as the insights we deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Disability Confident employer, we welcome applications from disabled candidates and are committed to making adjustments throughout the hiring process—whether that&#39;s extra time, materials in advance or a different format, breaks, an adjusted interview format, assistive tools, or flexible scheduling. We&#39;re happy to discuss whatever would work best for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We actively encourage applications from underrepresented and marginalised communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI, you&#39;ll find a place to contribute meaningfully, grow professionally, and belong fully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/2g0akAyAlUU?si=dIgYyrKaAlNZK-NQ&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#li-hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-LV1&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, HR Technology &amp;amp; Solutions Delivery is a senior technology leadership role responsible for the strategy, design, delivery, operation and evolution of Inizio&#39;s global HR technology ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the near term, the role has significant accountability for Workday, leading day-to-day IT operations, functional solution design, enhancements, continuous improvement and strategic HR technology projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over time, the role will evolve HR Technology towards a stronger platform engineering and architecture-led model, establishing the technical strategy, engineering practices, integration architecture, governance, security and operational capabilities required to support Inizio at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This requires a leader who can operate across both the functional and technical dimensions of Workday – translating HR requirements into effective solutions while bringing the technical depth and engineering mindset to shape the future HR technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have end-to-end IT accountability for Workday and the wider HR technology ecosystem. The Workday IT Operations team will report directly to this role, which reports to the Deputy Chief Information Officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workday Platform, Operations &amp;amp; Functional Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide end-to-end IT ownership of Workday, covering functional design, configuration, operations, support, enhancements and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR People Services and Centres of Excellence to translate business requirements into scalable, sustainable Workday solutions aligned with global standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior oversight of Workday business processes, configuration, security, reporting, integrations and adoption of new platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Workday IT Operations team, ensuring effective management of incidents, requests, defects, changes, enhancements and releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective service levels, operational KPIs, demand and backlog management, root-cause analysis, testing, documentation and operational controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement, automation and proactive platform management to improve user experience, reliability and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior escalation and decision point for significant Workday functional, technical and operational matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Technology Project &amp;amp; Solutions Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HR Technology Strategy: Own end-to-end technology delivery of significant Workday and wider HR technology initiatives, from requirements and solution design through build, integration, testing, deployment, stabilisation and BAU transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Workday enhancements, module implementations, optimisation initiatives and HR transformation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions align with business outcomes, architecture principles and the longer-term HR technology roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish delivery governance across scope, plans, dependencies, resources, risks, quality and budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold systems integrators and delivery partners accountable for delivery, solution quality, knowledge transfer and sustainable support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technology strategy, target architecture and multi-year roadmap for Inizio&#39;s global HR technology ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish architecture and engineering principles across platforms, integrations, APIs, data, identity, security, environments, testing, deployment, monitoring and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the progressive evolution of HR Technology towards a stronger platform engineering operating model, increasing automation, standardisation and engineering discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure HR technology is scalable, secure, resilient, maintainable and aligned with Inizio&#39;s wider enterprise technology strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage technical debt and identify opportunities to simplify and modernise the HR technology estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop internal technical capability and reduce unnecessary reliance on external partners for core platform knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrations, Security &amp;amp; Technical Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical governance across HR technology architecture, integrations, security and change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure secure and reliable connectivity between Workday, HR applications, enterprise platforms, identity services, data platforms and external providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish appropriate integration patterns, APIs, middleware and data standards, reducing unnecessary point-to-point connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure appropriate controls across cyber security, data privacy, identity and access management, privileged access, segregation of duties and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security, risk and compliance requirements into solution design and delivery and maintain appropriate controls and audit evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Enterprise Architecture, Cyber Security, Data and Integration teams to ensure HR technology aligns with enterprise standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor, Commercial &amp;amp; HR Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior IT partner to HR leadership, translating HR strategy and operational priorities into an actionable technology roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with HR People Services and Centres of Excellence to shape solutions and prioritise BAU enhancements, projects and strategic investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance on Workday capabilities and wider opportunities including automation, AI and emerging HR technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage strategic relationships with Workday, technology vendors, systems integrators and specialist partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold partners accountable for technical capability, solution quality, service, delivery and commercial outcomes and provide technology leadership for vendor selection and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Capability Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a high-performing HR Technology team with the right balance of Workday functional, technical, integration, engineering and operational capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the technical maturity of the function through coaching, standards and strong engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster collaboration across HR, Enterprise Architecture, Cyber Security, Data, Integration and wider IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a culture of ownership, customer focus, engineering quality, accountability and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a visible and credible senior technology leader across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an experienced HR technology leader who combines strong Workday functional and delivery expertise with technical depth and an engineering mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand how Workday supports end-to-end HR processes and can lead functional solution design and delivery, while being equally comfortable discussing integrations, architecture, security, engineering and enterprise technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading Workday in a complex enterprise environment across functional design, BAU operations, enhancements and project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Workday functional solution-design expertise across multiple areas, with an understanding of HCM processes, configuration, security, reporting, integrations and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering significant Workday implementations, module deployments, transformations or optimisation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise integrations, APIs, middleware, data integration and connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of platform engineering practices including testing, deployment, monitoring, automation and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of application security, identity and access management, technology risk, data privacy and change controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing effective technical and functional governance for enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success managing systems integrators, vendors and strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and leading multidisciplinary technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder-management skills across HR and Technology leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Critically, you will be comfortable operating across the full spectrum from Workday functional design and day-to-day platform decisions through to enterprise architecture and technology strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desirable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Manager, Director or equivalent experience within a global organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience across Workday HCM and multiple Workday modules, supported by Workday certifications and/or demonstrable functional and technical expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading global Workday deployments, optimisation programmes or major HR transformations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within consulting, technology, pharmaceutical, life sciences or another complex multinational environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience introducing platform engineering, DevOps, automation or product-oriented ways of working into enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio, we want you to feel supported both professionally and personally. Our benefits are designed to support your health, wellbeing and financial future, while giving you flexibility in how you work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your location and employing entity, our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Healthcare&lt;/strong&gt; – access to private healthcare or a healthcare allowance, depending on your location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension&lt;/strong&gt; – a company-supported pension scheme with employer contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Leave&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days&#39; annual leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working&lt;/strong&gt; – a flexible working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life Insurance&lt;/strong&gt; – cover of 4x your basic salary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Income Protection&lt;/strong&gt; – up to 75% of your basic salary in the event of eligible long-term sickness or absence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/strong&gt; – confidential support for personal, work and wellbeing concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cycle to Work&lt;/strong&gt; – support towards the cost of a bike and cycling equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Wellbeing &amp;amp; Lifestyle Benefits&lt;/strong&gt; – additional benefits may include eyecare, wellbeing resources and employee discounts, depending on your location and employing entity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits vary by location and employing entity. We will provide full details during the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Inizio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio, we&#39;re a global team motivated by a shared purpose: to reimagine health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Formed in 2022, we unite decades of experience and expertise with data, technology, and AI. We create tailored solutions that drive Intelligent Commercialization™ at every stage of the journey, from discovery to post-launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global network of over 10,000 experts operates across 50 countries, supporting clients with strategic insight, medical excellence, creative engagement, and real-world delivery. We work with the world&#39;s leading health and life sciences businesses to solve complex challenges and accomplish meaningful outcomes for our clients and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What sets Inizio apart is our people - and we believe everyone should excel. Here, you&#39;re encouraged to reimagine your possibilities: to grow, to be curious and to make change happen. We value your individuality, support your development, and celebrate your ambition. If you&#39;re ready to push boundaries and accelerate your career, Inizio is the best place to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Pledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio, we value inclusivity, recognize the power of diversity and inspire the next generation of change-makers. We are an equal opportunities employer. We believe in creating a dynamic work environment that values diversity, equity and inclusion. We aim to recruit from a diverse slate of candidates and foster an environment that provides the right conditions for long-term success. We welcome all applications. We consider them regardless of race, color, religion, or belief. We also consider them regardless of gender, gender identity, age, national origin, marital status, military veteran status, genetic information, sexual orientation, and physical or mental disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inizio may use AI technologies to support certain aspects of our recruitment process, but our human recruiting team makes all hiring decisions. We are committed to fair, inclusive, and human-led hiring practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DT2 #LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every job requirement? That&#39;s okay! Our company is dedicated to building an inclusive and authentic workplace. If you&#39;re excited about this role, but your experience doesn&#39;t perfectly fit every qualification, we encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right person for this role or others.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Hardware Automation team builds the internal platforms and tooling that power how Nebius operates its data center infrastructure at scale. Our mission is to eliminate manual effort, reduce human error, and give every team in the Hardware Infrastructure department real-time visibility and control over the systems they own.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We operate as a product engineering team embedded within hardware infrastructure — meaning we don&#39;t just write requirements and hand them off. We own the full stack: from requirements gathering with data center operations and hardware engineering, through design and build, all the way to rollout and ongoing reliability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will be centered around the d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;esign and development of services that automate work of a large server fleet at scale.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of Python or Golang, or you are ready to quickly switch to these&amp;nbsp;programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to write reliable code and dig into complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in being engaged in DevOps processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We expect Engineers to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage large-scale projects involving multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break down complex tasks and guide both their own work and that of more junior colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be experts in specific technologies and write high-quality code that can serve as a reference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess task priority and focus on high-impact work, avoiding low-value efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong architectural thinking and contribute to system design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be involved in hiring and actively contribute to interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be willing to share knowledge and mentor others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of modern server architecture and its components&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Good knowledge of computer networks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Experience designing, developing and running high-load distributed syste&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Site Selection &amp;amp; Colocation Manager&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for identifying, evaluating, and securing optimal locations for new data center developments and colocation expansions. This role combines real estate strategy, technical due diligence, market analysis, and vendor management to support the company’s global data center growth. The manager will collaborate closely with engineering, construction, finance, legal, and network planning teams to ensure that selected sites meet operational, technical, and business requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;You’re welcome to work in our office in &lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam or Remote in the EU.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Site Selection &amp;amp; Market Analysis&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead the end-to-end site selection process for new data center facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Conduct market assessments, including power availability, fiber connectivity, land suitability, regulatory requirements, and risk factors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Build and maintain market intelligence on emerging data center regions, supply trends, energy markets, and colocation pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Evaluate and shortlist candidate sites through comparative analysis, scoring models, and feasibility studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Environmental Due Diligence&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Coordinate environmental, geotechnical, hydrological, and seismic assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Assess infrastructure availability (power, water, fiber) and future scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Evaluate construction constraints, climate conditions, logistics access, and permitting feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work with engineering teams to ensure sites meet mechanical, electrical, and network resilience requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Colocation Strategy &amp;amp; Vendor Management&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identify colocation providers and evaluate facilities based on technical specifications, SLA requirements, and cost structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead RFPs, negotiations, and contract execution with colocation and connectivity partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Manage colocation lifecycle: renewals, expansions, migrations, and optimization of space/power allocations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Monitor vendor performance against SLA, uptime, compliance, and efficiency metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work with data center design and construction teams to validate site feasibility and development timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner with legal on contract terms, property acquisition, lease terms, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Support finance with CapEx/OpEx modeling, ROI calculations, and business case development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Coordinate with public authorities, utilities, and permitting agencies as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Risk Assessment &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Evaluate risks related to natural hazards, geopolitical risk, security, environmental constraints, and utility reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with local regulations, zoning laws, and corporate standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Maintain documentation for audits, reporting, and internal approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Real Estate, Engineering, Business, Geography, or related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;5–8+ years of experience in site selection, real estate development, colocation management, or data center infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of data center power, cooling, and network requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Experience in evaluating colocation providers and negotiating leases/SLAs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Analytical skills in market research, cost modeling, and risk assessment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Ability to manage multiple simultaneous projects across regions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;an added bonus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience with hyperscale or large-scale data center development.&lt;/li&gt;
