&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;842&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e1aa7ee297ff&quot;&gt;Building and maintaining execution plans, identifying risks early, and ensuring blockers are resolved before they impact delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
