&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;976&quot; data-local-id=&quot;95b94c5bb4af&quot;&gt;Working closely with engineering managers, technical leads, product managers, SRE, infrastructure, networking, security, and other platform teams.&lt;/p&gt;
