&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Team &amp;amp; About Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Rubrik Sales Engineering team helps governments and critical-infrastructure organisations stay operational through cyberattacks, insider threats and disruption. As a Defence Sales Engineer, you&#39;ll be the technical voice in front of UK defence customers, working hand in hand with a dedicated Defence Account Executive to protect some of the most sensitive data in the country. You&#39;ll own the technical story in an emerging, high-visibility segment, with the autonomy to shape how Rubrik goes to market in defence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Defence Account Executive to build and run account plans across the MOD, the armed forces and the wider defence community, so Rubrik is in the room when mission-critical data resilience decisions are made&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery and whiteboarding sessions that uncover customers&#39; real operational and security risks, then translate them into clear business cases for technical teams and senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and demonstrate Rubrik&#39;s Data Resilience, Observability and Remediation solutions, helping defence organisations recover quickly and keep operating when it matters most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run proofs of concept from scoping through to success criteria, giving customers confidence in how Rubrik performs in complex, security-conscious environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate pipeline alongside your AE across new prospects and existing accounts, identifying white space and expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify opportunities on technical requirements, competition, decision-making process and funding, so the team focuses effort where it can win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to customers and partners, and share what you learn from the field with Product and Sales Enablement to shape how we serve the public sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with the team: learn from experienced SEs, contribute to the SE community and build your expertise in Rubrik&#39;s expanding security platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience You&#39;ll Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in a sales engineering, solutions architecture or technical pre-sales role, ideally in infrastructure, data protection or security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in infrastructure and security, including backup and recovery, cyber resilience, cloud (Azure and/or AWS) and enterprise data centre environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of running technical discovery, demos and POCs, and handling multiple customer conversations with fast follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence engaging both hands-on technical teams and senior stakeholders, and framing technology around business and mission outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The drive and resilience to build pipeline in a long-cycle, relationship-led market and keep going when deals get complex&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coachable mindset, with the curiosity to keep learning and the hunger to win alongside your AE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in or selling to UK defence (MOD, Royal Navy, RAF, British Army) or defence primes, or a military or defence background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into UK public sector or regulated enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing security clearance (SC or above), or eligibility to obtain one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with defence procurement, frameworks and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the competitive data protection landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;📍London / Remote | 💰£112,200 - £151,800, L70 on the Operations Framework + Incentive Awards tied to your performance +&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Benefits&lt;/a&gt; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐️ Our team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our North Star in Operations is to deliver seamless support that builds trust, deepens loyalty, and powers Monzo’s sustainable, profitable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting at the very heart of Monzo Global Operations, you will work within our Group COO team, partnering closely with the Global Operations Leadership team and key Monzo stakeholders to tackle our biggest strategic priorities in pursuit of our challenging goals. You will bridge the gap between bold ambition and rigorous operational execution - turning complex challenges and priorities into clear, measurable actions to progress across UK Operations, EU Operations and Controls. In this role you will build strong relationships with leadership across Customer Operations, EU Operations, Controls, Finance, Tech disciplines and the wider Monzo team, working collaboratively to help build and deliver on our Group COO strategy and operating model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Setting the GCOO Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape and own the big picture:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll define, align, and maintain a clear strategy for the Group COO team. Making sure it covers everything across UK Ops, EU Ops, and Controls, so everyone knows where we’re heading and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goal Setting &amp;amp; Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align our goals:&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll lead the goal-setting process for the GCOO area. Making sure our top-level objectives fit seamlessly with the goals of each sub-function, keeping all our teams rowing in the same direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Control &amp;amp; Insight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep us on budget with clear insights:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll partner closely with Finance to build and embed a simple, dependable monthly reporting process. Bringing real rigour and clear forecasting to the numbers so we always understand our financial health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Operating Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for a global Monzo:&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll lead the shift as GCOO transitions into a fully functioning global operating model - building everything with a &quot;global by design&quot; mindset from day one. You’ll help architect how we scale by balancing global efficiency with local market operational requirements, always ensuring we think “global first”.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Project Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver key projects:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll take full accountability for a range of high-impact short and medium-term strategic projects, collaborating with teams across all of Monzo to get them over the line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tracking &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep everyone informed:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll track our progress against the GCOO strategy and make sure key updates are clearly communicated - whether that’s for CEO reporting, the PRA 90-Day Plan, or our own GCOO Leadership Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience operating at a senior strategic level (ideally within fintech, or complex operational environments). You have a track record of shaping business strategy through structured problem-solving, data, and deep business insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a proven executor, able to turn strategy into executable projects, ensuring those projects deliver to time and quality.&amp;nbsp; You switch between the strategic and practical with ease, analysing issues strategically but also being able to ‘do the detail’ to ensure successful execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel in highly matrixed environments where ownership is shared. You know how to build alignment, resolve trade-offs, and hold cross-functional teams accountable without needing direct reporting lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You speak the language of Operations, Finance, Technology and Controls. You can comfortably translate complex operational or technical signals into clear executive narratives for both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in unstructured environments where no playbook exists. You enjoy establishing governance, clear communication strategies and moving fluidly between strategic vision and hands-on operational delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring financial discipline and analytical capability, with hands-on experience partnering with Finance to connect operational levers directly to commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience and strong aptitude for navigating complex global versus local operational structures and managing trade-offs across multiple markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have superb communication skills with a proven ability to distill complex ideas and metrics into actionable insights through effective story-telling, high-impact board decks, and clear leadership updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈 The application journey has 3* key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application questions - &lt;/strong&gt;we have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo.&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter Call - 30 mins&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1st stage Technical Interview - 1 hour&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;*potential additional stage to be decided.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The closing date for applications is &lt;strong&gt;9am Monday 19th October&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re successful in applying for this role, &lt;strong&gt;the standard release period is 8 weeks&lt;/strong&gt;. This gives your current team time to plan for your move and ensures a smooth handover, while setting you up for success in your new role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sometimes teams may be able to release people sooner, and if that’s the case, Hiring will work with your current manager to agree to a shorter release period. Whatever the timeline, we’ll make sure you’re kept in the loop and supported throughout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have any queries, please reach out to @Neens (please note I am on annual leave 6th to 19th October)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good luck 🍀&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Hudson River Trading (HRT) is seeking a Research Data Engineer to join our Data team. Data is a cornerstone of HRT’s trading strategies, serving as the raw fuel that powers research, automated trading, and risk management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will be responsible for developing the end to end of onboarding vendor data, cleaning and validating, normalizing, and featurizing the data for alpha research, as well as ensuring high-quality service via rigorous data checks and alerts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HRT does not have information siloes! You will work directly with researchers to build datasets that add value to our trading strategies while developing expertise in one area of data and how alpha is built from careful data analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboard, normalize, and featurize datasets for statistical modeling research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject matter expert for datasets you onboard, building expertise in some area of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the sourcing team to identify and evaluate new data procurement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data to identify and improve alpha&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full end-to-end data pipeline, from raw vendor ingestion to refined feature sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide on-call support for data issues during normal business hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement automated data quality checks and monitoring alerts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python programming skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in data science methodologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in data analysis and statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest in finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in a STEM field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated base salary range for this position is 200,000 to 300,000 USD per year (or local equivalent). The base pay offered may vary depending on multiple individualized factors, including location, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. This role will also be eligible for discretionary performance-based bonuses and a competitive benefits package.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Hudson River Trading (HRT) brings a scientific approach to trading financial products. We have built one of the world&#39;s most sophisticated computing environments for research and development. Our researchers are at the forefront of innovation in the world of algorithmic trading. \n\nAt HRT we come from a variety of disciplines: mathematics and computer science, physics, and engineering, media and tech. We’re a community of self-starters who are motivated by the excitement of being at the cutting edge of automation in every part of our organization - from trading, to business operations, to recruiting and beyond.  Our culture celebrates great ideas whether they come from HRT veterans or new hires.  At HRT we’re friends and colleagues – whether we are sharing a meal, playing the latest board game, or writing elegant code. We embrace a culture of togetherness that extends far beyond the walls of our office.\n\nFeel like you belong at HRT? Our goal is to find the best people and bring them together to do great work in a place where everyone is valued. HRT is proud of our diverse staff; we have offices all over the globe and benefit from our varied and unique perspectives. HRT is an equal opportunity employer; so whoever you are we’d love to get to know you.&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13185,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;10&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;IBM Plex Sans&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:11}&quot; data-sheets-textstyleruns=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:328,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:16711935}}}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:402}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:917,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:16711935}}}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:945}&quot;&gt;Hudson River Trading (HRT) brings a scientific approach to trading financial products. We have built one of the world&#39;s most sophisticated computing environments for research and development. Our researchers are at the forefront of innovation in the world of algorithmic trading. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HRT we welcome a variety of expertise: mathematics and computer science, physics and engineering, media and tech. We’re a community of self-starters who are motivated by the excitement of being at the cutting edge of automation in every part of our organization—from trading, to business operations, to recruiting and beyond. We value openness and transparency, and celebrate great ideas from HRT veterans and new hires alike. At HRT we’re friends and colleagues – whether we are sharing a meal, playing the latest board game, or writing elegant code. We embrace a culture of togetherness that extends far beyond the walls of our office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Feel like you belong at HRT? Our goal is to find the best people and bring them together to do great work in a place where everyone is valued. HRT is proud of our diverse staff; we have offices all over the globe and benefit from our varied and unique perspectives. HRT is an equal opportunity employer; so whoever you are we’d love to get to know you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Please be advised: Use of AI tools by an applicant during interviews or assessments is strictly prohibited, unless otherwise instructed or agreed upon. We employ various methods to evaluate the authenticity of candidate responses. If we determine that AI assistance was used by an applicant during an interview or an assessment, we reserve the right to immediately end the interview or assessment, disqualify the applicant’s candidacy and/or rescind any job offers extended.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
