&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soho, London&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working: 2 days per week in the office (rota includes working evenings and weekends to attend matches, events, shoots, sponsor activations and key sporting moments where required to support content creation and social coverage.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Social Media Executive plays a key role in creating content and helping to shape and deliver LiveScore Group’s social media strategy. The role requires strong editorial judgement, excellent football knowledge and the ability to create engaging social content across a range of formats. Working closely with and supporting the Social Media Lead, the role acts as a senior member of the team, contributing to daily content planning and creation, wider content strategy and the continued growth and performance of LiveScore’s social channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At LiveScore Group, we’re the proud home of three of the most exciting brands in the sports and gaming world: LiveScore, LiveScore Bet and Virgin Bet. A fully owned and operated ecosystem that converges the two worlds of sports media and sports betting. We’re proud of the high ratings for our commitment to excellence and fueling fan’s passion for sport driving us to the top.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t just lead; we innovate. Our cutting-edge products and immersive experiences set the standard, but it’s our people who truly make the difference. Every day, our team embody our values: adaptability, teamwork, a fan-driven approach, and an ever-curious mindset that fuels our ambition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we scale and continue to create a culture that allows all employees to thrive, we know we need the most talented people with diverse backgrounds, perspectives and skills. If you’re good at what you do, come and join us. The more inclusive we are, the more amazing experiences we can create for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We know that job descriptions can sometimes seem daunting and you might not feel you tick every box. But, if you’re passionate about the role and have relevant experience, we want to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop and execute LiveScore Group’s content-led social media strategy, working closely with the Social Media Lead on strategic planning and key projects. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use strong editorial judgement and football knowledge to help shape daily content priorities and maintain forward-looking content calendars across Facebook, X, Instagram, TikTok and YouTube. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key football stories, trends and moments that can be turned into timely, engaging and highly shareable social content. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-quality social content using Photoshop templates, with the ability to adapt existing templates and create new ones when required. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive audience growth, engagement, and product interaction through innovative content tailored to individual social platforms and markets. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse performance across video and editorial content, regularly reporting against KPIs and OKRs and turning insights into actionable recommendations. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with emerging social platforms, formats and technologies, identifying opportunities to improve content performance and audience growth. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with content agencies and internal teams, including Sponsorship, Commercial and Acquisition Marketing, to develop and execute campaigns and creative social content. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior point of contact within the social team, providing editorial guidance and support to other team members. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend matches and events for content capture where required, including conducting interviews, filming and presenting to camera. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, Knowledge and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of social media strategy, content planning and publishing across Facebook, X, Instagram, TikTok and YouTube. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent football knowledge and strong editorial judgement, with an instinct for the stories and moments that will resonate with football fans. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven analytical skills, with the ability to measure content performance, track KPIs/OKRs and turn data into actionable insights. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of platform-specific content formats, algorithms and best practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Photoshop, with the ability to independently create high-quality social content as well as adapt and develop existing templates. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable capturing high-quality social-first content using a smartphone, including basic filming, photography and interview capture. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative thinker with the ability to develop engaging and original social content ideas. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the confidence to work effectively across teams and external partners. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work quickly, prioritise effectively and make strong editorial decisions in a fast-paced, reactive environment. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and collaborative, comfortable providing guidance and support to the wider social team while identifying new content opportunities. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desirable but not essential: Experience in long video content and YouTube, with an understanding of audience growth, content strategy and what drives performance on the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we offer?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Performance Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Agreements where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Healthcare Scheme + Employee Enhanced Assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Family Leave - Maternity, Shared Parental &amp;amp; Adoption Leave: up to 6 months at full pay and 6 months at half pay. Paternity leave: up to 4 weeks at full pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Gym Membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Travel Card Loan &amp;amp; Ride to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance (x3 salary)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory Pension Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virgin Family: Giving you access to exclusive Virgin offers and experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thursday drinks in the office and regular socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soho, London&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working: 3 days a week in the office Tues - Thurs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting within LiveScore Media’s Acquisition team, this role focuses driving user growth and supporting commercial revenue across key markets. You will manage and scale performance marketing campaigns across digital channels, with a primary focus on driving app downloads. Working closely with cross-functional teams, you will turn growth plans into measurable campaigns that engage sports fans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position gives you the opportunity to test new channels and acquisition tactics aswe strengthen our global footprint. Adapting platform algorithm changes and tailoring campaigns to distinct local audiences represent the core challenges of the role. Success is evaluated through achieving acquisition volume and CPA/ROAS targets, while ensuring efficient budget allocation and continuous improvement in campaign performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At LiveScore Group, we’re the proud home of three of the most exciting brands in the sports and gaming world: LiveScore, LiveScore Bet and Virgin Bet. A fully owned and operated ecosystem that converges the two worlds of sports media and sports betting. We’re proud of the high ratings for our commitment to excellence and our passion drives us to the top. We don’t just lead; we innovate. Our cutting-edge products and immersive experiences set the standard, but it’s our people who truly make the difference. Every day, our team embody our values: adaptability, teamwork, a fan-driven approach, and an ever-curious mindset that fuels our ambition. As we scale and continue to create a culture that allows all employees to thrive, we know we need the most talented people with diverse backgrounds, perspectives and skills. If you’re good at what you do, come and join us. The more inclusive we are, the more amazing experiences we can create for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We know that job descriptions can sometimes seem daunting, and you might not feel you tick every box. But, if you’re passionate about the role and have relevant experience, we want to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimise performance marketing campaigns across app marketing, paid social, and display channels to drive user acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with brand and creative teams to produce, review, and deliver marketing assets that align with brand standards and drive conversions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and allocate digital marketing budgets across channels to meet commercial acquisition targets while maintaining spend efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and evaluate A/B and multivariate tests across creative assets, messaging, and landing pages to improve campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse campaign data and conversion funnels to share clear, actionable performance reports with team leads and key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle routine campaign financial administration, including raising purchase orders and processing invoices with internal finance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all digital advertising campaigns strictly comply with applicable industry regulations, territorial licensing guidelines, and age verification standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with external media partners, ad platforms, and creative agencies to coordinate campaign launches smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and evaluate emerging digital marketing channels and audience targeting methods to support ongoing user growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, Knowledge and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running and optimising paid acquisition campaigns across mobile app marketing, paid social, or display channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing digital media spend against agreed CPA and ROAS performance targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical understanding of conversion tracking mechanics, attribution models, and event mapping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of digital marketing measurement and attribution methodologies, including conversion tracking and the ability to interpret campaign performance data. Experience with Mobile Measurement Partners (MMPs) is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and running A/B tests to improve ad performance and conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to take ownership of campaign deliverables and manage project timelines independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and collaboration skills when working with cross-functional teams and external suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, curious and adaptable approach, with a willingness to learn new platforms, embrace AI-powered tools, explore emerging technologies and continuously develop digital marketing expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we offer?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Performance Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Agreements where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Healthcare Scheme + Employee Enhanced Assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Family Leave - Maternity, Shared Parental &amp;amp; Adoption Leave: up to 6 months at full pay and 6 months at half pay. Paternity leave: up to 4 weeks at full pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Gym Membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Travel Card Loan &amp;amp; Ride to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance (x3 salary)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory Pension Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virgin Family: Giving you access to exclusive Virgin offers and experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thursday drinks in the office and regular socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; Bristol, London or Cambridge, UK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Help scale state-of-the art AI models across thousands of accelerators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a Senior Machine Learning Engineer in the Applied AI team, you will contribute to advancing AI technology by developing and optimising new and existing AI models for our specialised hardware. You will work on large scale systems where performance is critical to the success of our projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Having visibility of the entire pipeline from novel accelerator hardware to state-of-the-art AI applications, and the software stack in-between, you will play a critical role in identifying opportunities to innovate and differentiate Graphcore’s technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Furthermore, you’ll work closely with researchers in a rapidly-evolving field, where even the most senior engineers are constantly learning and adapting to exciting new challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We seek engineers with strong technical foundations who are curious and eager to understand and advance AI model implementation, at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We currently have multiple opportunities available in the team at Senior, Staff and Principal level and offer flexibility through a hybrid working model, from any of our UK offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re excited about advancing the next generation of AI models on cutting-edge hardware, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The team and culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Applied AI team’s role is to be proxies for our customers, we need to understand the latest AI models, applications, and software, as well as our own hardware and software stack, to ensure that Graphcore’s technology works seamlessly with the AI ecosystem and at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our work spans from low-level kernel development and optimisation for novel hardware through to implementing and scaling research-level algorithms for the latest AI models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We collaborate with the Research team to develop and publish novel ideas in domains such as efficient compute, model scaling and distributed training and inference of AI models for multiple modalities and applications.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Implement and train state-of-the-art machine learning models and optimise for performance, accuracy and scalability across systems comprising 1000s of accelerators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Benchmark and profile ML models to identify performance bottlenecks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Develop deep understanding across the software stack in order to optimise kernel implementations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Test and evaluate new internal software releases, provide feedback to software engineering teams, make necessary code fixes, and conduct code reviews.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Design and conduct experiments on novel AI methods and evaluate results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Research, Software, and Product teams to define, build, and test Graphcore’s next generation of AI hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Engage with AI community and keep in touch with the latest developments in AI.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
