&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for an exciting part-time job alongside your studies? Want to apply analytical theory to high-impact, real-world business projects?&amp;nbsp;Take on the challenge and apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Business Analyst Working Student&lt;/strong&gt; at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This role is all about driving impact—you’ll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that push boundaries and redefine the grocery shopping experience. You’ll join a dynamic and collaborative team in a fast-paced, innovative environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solving real-life puzzles: &lt;/strong&gt;Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day. Curious about the questions?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and optimize models for real-time improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicating: &lt;/strong&gt;Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning your projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative by challenging the status quo and rethinking how things are done. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled in a &lt;strong&gt;Master’s program&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Aerospace, Mechanical, Industrial, Automation or Production Engineering; Mathematics; Econometrics; AI; or equivalent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for &lt;strong&gt;data analytics and business consulting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to explain &lt;strong&gt;complex analytical concepts&lt;/strong&gt; in a comprehensible manner to various stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; or are excited to learn&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in both written and verbal &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and have an &lt;strong&gt;EU citizenship&lt;/strong&gt; available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available for minimum &lt;strong&gt;16h per week&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong&gt;minimum 4 months&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your performance, we can discuss further opportunities at Picnic!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Where you can make an impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt; – Optimize the backbone of our operations, from fulfillment centers to last-mile delivery and demand forecasting across Europe. Think: automating international delivery forecasts for growth markets like France.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech&lt;/strong&gt; – Build scalable backend systems, cutting-edge AI workflows, and internal tooling that power our entire platform. Think: building AI agent workflows (using Python, Claude, and SQL).&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer&lt;/strong&gt; – Drive customer growth and strategic category development across our markets. Think: optimizing search algorithms for recipe discovery and running deep-dive analyses on customer retention and membership strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why Picnic&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow as we grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;From day one, you’ll take ownership of real business projects that affect millions of customers, gaining hands-on experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn from top minds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Work alongside driven, talented mentors in a high-energy environment. You&#39;ll build, solve problems, and celebrate together, from our legendary Friday drinks to team events and parties.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kickstart your career.&lt;/strong&gt; Earn a competitive student salary with flexible working hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll have plenty of chances to grow, whether it’s through our casual Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions or team specific trainings. We’re especially keen on keeping great talent around: perform well as a working student, and we would love to explore&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;transitioning you into a full-time role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials. &lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Learn while making an impact!&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The first 6 months of the role are structured as a dedicated learning and development program&lt;/strong&gt;, offering a rare chance to step directly into a real production environment, contributing to systems that operate at scale while strengthening both your technical and behavioral skills.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After this initial 6-month program, you’ll continue in your role at Picnic as a Java backend engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, building on what you’ve learned and taking on increasing responsibility. The program is intended to set you up for success in your long-term role at Picnic. Through the Picnic Tech Academy, you’ll explore topics ranging from Java Clean Code to reactive programming and MongoDB, while also developing key capabilities like collaboration and a growth mindset. You’ll learn to balance project priorities, deadlines, and deliverables, building the foundation for a successful engineering career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Picnic has over 20 Java backend development teams, each highly involved with and essential to all parts of the company. From enabling a smooth shopping experience to ensuring we fulfill our customers’ orders efficiently in our warehouses, there’s a wide range of products to work on. Product teams are also supported by the work of our platform teams on key technologies and infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Also, we don’t hide what we do. Instead, we open-source with the community that helped us grow. Here’s proof:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://picnic.tech/&quot; data-rich-text-autolink=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;http://picnic.tech&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Level up your development and behavioral skills through our 6 months Tech Academy and with the guidance of your mentor while applying what you learn directly in your team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;: Become a part of one of our product teams from day one and start contributing to Picnic from the get-go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Get to work on increasingly challenging tasks and projects, growing all the time, and working collaboratively with your colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech: &lt;/strong&gt;Java 25 (Reactor and Spring 6), RabbitMQ and Kafka, Maven and Git, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, Vault (Hungry for more? Check out&lt;a href=&quot;https://stackshare.io/picnic-technologies&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;https://stackshare.io/picnic-technologies&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;for an overview of our tech stack)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have (or will soon have) a Bachelor’s or Master’s Degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Information Technology, Computer Engineering, or a related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recent graduates and early-career professionals with up to 1 year of professional experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn technologies to create systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your English skills are on point (no Dutch required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are available to start this position &lt;strong&gt;full time &lt;/strong&gt;in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;January 2027&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra credit for&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Spring, MongoDB, or PostgreSQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Relevant working experience/projects alongside your studies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼&amp;nbsp;Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍎You are what you eat&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏽Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔋Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, if you want to find our relocation benefits, see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/relocation&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Only about 1% of our applicants end up in the offer stage. To increase your chances, give yourself a competitive edge and come fully prepared!&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we are building the best milkman on earth, we are looking for sharp minds that can help us further shape Picnic as we expand across Europe. We are looking for experienced hires with a background in strategy consulting, private equity, investment banking, e-commerce, logistics or automation roles, that can tackle challenges and growth opportunities at Picnic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with ambition&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring your relentless determination, creativity, and grit. Take the driver’s seat and redefine the grocery shopping experience for millions. You will be expected to think independently, move fast, and deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Steep learning curve&lt;/strong&gt;: Your growth comes from owning real problems, testing your ideas, learning from your mistakes and starting again. You&#39;ll move at a pace that accelerates your growth like nowhere else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve real-life puzzles&lt;/strong&gt;: Spot opportunities, use tools at the forefront of technology, and own the outcome end to end. Not just making slides, but building the solution yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate across borders&lt;/strong&gt;: You’ll collaborate with teams across the Netherlands, Germany, and France, tackling challenges that redefine how Picnic operates at a European scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-performance environment&lt;/strong&gt;: You’ll work alongside some of the best teams in analytics and tech, people who set a high bar and expect you to do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in Econometrics, Engineering, Finance, Math or an equivalent quantitative study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-5 years of work experience in top tier management consulting, PE, investment banking, retail topics and hands-on deal experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Out-of-the-box thinking and initiative: hands-on, nothing-is-impossible mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills in Dutch and English, allowing you to explain complex analytical concepts in a simple and practical way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with SQL and Python or excited to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥗 &lt;strong&gt;Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚲 &lt;strong&gt;Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🗺️ &lt;strong&gt;Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍎 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💻 All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/6TXqRcPPJM4?si=WKbhweTel2Oll1Hq&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What’s it like to work on the fastest-growing online supermarket app in Europe? At Picnic, we’re redefining grocery shopping, and we want you to help shape the way millions of customers experience it. &lt;strong&gt;🥑🥐🍎&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Future Leaders Graduate Program (Strategy Track)&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll join a fast-paced environment where &lt;strong&gt;strategy and execution live in the same seat&lt;/strong&gt;. We don&#39;t just brainstorm big ideas and hand them off - you’ll analyze customer data, design the strategy, and directly run the campaigns and features in-app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have several exciting opportunities for in the following areas:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Homepage:&lt;/strong&gt; Plan and execute in-app campaigns, ensure high product availability, and optimize the digital store by showing the best products &amp;amp; seasonal highlights to inspire customers daily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meals:&lt;/strong&gt; Create appealing recipe app campaigns, targeted at different audiences, from busy families to weekend chefs, ensuring high adoption rates and recipe sales.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;: Plan and launch weekly marketing moments, from seasonal celebrations to product pushes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate with creators and influencers to grow brand reach and loyalty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a rotation program or internship. You’ll own your domain and become a marketing expert from day one, while shaping how millions of people discover, shop, and engage with food.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day to day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, launch, and monitor your own campaigns, visual assets, and app configurations - taking ideas from raw data to production in days, not months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage data-driven insights to analyze customer behavior, optimize app features, fine-tune pricing, and create irresistible promotions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: Stay ahead of market trends, customer needs, and competitor strategies to innovate and continually enhance our store’s offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and refine tools and processes to boost the efficiency, accuracy, and impact of our commercial activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with Category Managers, Designers, Data Engineers, and Tech teams to eliminate bottlenecks and optimize app operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each team is unique, but they all offer the same thing: meaningful ownership, clear goals, and space to grow into your full potential!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are analytical, commercially minded, and uncomfortable with &quot;business as usual.&quot; You like big data sets, but you like seeing your decisions live in the app even more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re finishing (or just finished) your &lt;strong&gt;MSc in Business Administration, Economics, Analytics or a related field &lt;/strong&gt;with up to 1 year of (full time) work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong internship or student track record in fast-moving, high-bar environments - such as &lt;strong&gt;FMCG, fast-growing scale-ups, top-tier consultancies, or high-impact student boards/initiatives.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You aren&#39;t waiting for a playbook. You build tools, automate manual steps, and take full accountability for outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You actively challenge existing processes and ask &lt;em&gt;&quot;Why do we do it this way, and how can we make it 10x better?&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a &lt;strong&gt;natural collaborator and communicator&lt;/strong&gt;, not afraid to own your projects across teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re fluent in &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(bonus for Dutch, German or French!)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have love for food, retail, tech - or all three!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience with tools like Salesforce, Selligent, or marketing automation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the start of a real career - not just a job or a rotation. You’ll build, learn, and grow with a team that thrives on doing things differently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited?&lt;/strong&gt; So are we. Apply today and let’s shape the future of online groceries together!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Not sure which track fits you best?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choose Category Management&lt;/strong&gt; if you are driven by &lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;60&quot;&gt;products, supplier negotiations, unit economics, and food trends.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choose Strategy &lt;/strong&gt;if you are driven by &lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot;&gt;app user behavior, digital storefront optimization, and campaign execution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choose Analytics &lt;/strong&gt;if you are driven by &lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;44&quot;&gt;solving complex business problems, data modeling, and technical implementation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Java teams in the Warehouse Systems domain are the reason why our warehouses can process the volume of groceries they do!&amp;nbsp; From dealing with inbound items, to sending totes across the warehouse on conveyor belts, to sending the groceries off to our delivery drivers - our software developers build tools and automations to power the entire warehouse platform. Through designing, developing, and testing new features, or improving the scalability and security of our platform: you’ll be managing individual project priorities, deadlines, and deliverables, while finding yourself fully immersed in an engaging scaleup culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Take ownership of projects from concept to delivery, aligning technical solutions with business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem solving&lt;/strong&gt;: You see a problem, you tackle it with technology - with your users always in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate on cross-team initiative involving complex systems to ensure smooth flows in our warehouses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech: &lt;/strong&gt;Java 21/25 (Spring 6 with Spring Boot 3.5, Reactor, Immutables, Maven), RabbitMQ, Kafka, PostgreSQL, Git, Docker, AWS, Helm, Terraform, Kubernetes, Vault, Datadog, Python 3.x&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a Master’s Degree (in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Information Technology, Computer Engineering or a related technical field) or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a product mindset and treat technology as a means to an end, owning and solving business problems by choosing the best-fitting technical solutions and tools for each challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 2-5 years of professional experience with Java and have a profound understanding of back-end development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your English skills are on point (no Dutch required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with AI tooling and are comfortable with agentic engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re based in or happy to relocate to the Netherlands*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* We work from our office in Amsterdam. Being present makes a genuine difference to your team and the work. There&#39;s flexibility to work from home when needed, but if remote or hybrid-first is what you&#39;re after, this probably isn&#39;t the right fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please send your CV in English for complete consideration.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Mastery is a journey!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work on real-world problems, seeing the impact of your work every day in our warehouses and in our satisfied customers. Plus, our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾 Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings, to after-work drinks, to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍎 You are what you eat&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏽 Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials. There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔋 Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, if you want to find our relocation benefits, see &lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/relocation&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
