&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop solutions that make shopping smarter, faster, and more intuitive. Your work will power seamless, scalable, and personalized interactions for millions of users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; Thrive in a fast-paced environment where you learn and use a wide variety of tools and platforms to build the best tech for our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Build technology that empowers developers and business analysts alike to develop flexible features. (Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/blogs/faster-features-happier-customers-introducing-the-platform-that-transformed-our-grocery-app&quot;&gt;blog post&lt;/a&gt;!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech: &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work with Java and TypeScript on a daily basis, using frameworks like Spring (Spring with Spring Boot, Reactor, Immutables) and React. Supporting this core stack are GraalVM, Apache Calcite, Maven, Python 3.x, MongoDB, PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, Kafka, Git, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, Helm, Terraform, Vault, and Datadog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
