&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Indirect Tax Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; who isn&#39;t just executing compliance tasks, but acts as a strategic thinker understanding how efficient tax processes fuel international growth. You will take ownership of our indirect tax position across our core markets (&lt;strong&gt;NL, DE, and FR&lt;/strong&gt;) and act as a key financial partner for new business initiatives. You will report to the Tax Lead in Amsterdam, but you are expected to take full ownership of tax processes across our international entities, bridging the gap between external advisors and internal teams, driving automation and enabling the business to grow faster than ever! The focus of this role will be in the field of Indirect Tax, but we are looking for someone who is also interest to expand their expertise into broad tax areas like Tax Reporting, product taxes, Transfer Pricing (TP), and wage taxes. You don&#39;t wait to be told what to do - you spot opportunities for improvement and just do it. If you&#39;re process-oriented and ready to help scale the finance domain of the future, we want you on our team!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead indirect tax matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee and review international tax filings across NL, DE, and FR to guarantee absolute accuracy (overseeing the process rather than acting as a primary preparer).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer e-invoicing &amp;amp; automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive process improvement and automation within our tax workflows, focusing on upcoming European e-invoicing mandates, digital reporting, and smart system integrations to eliminate manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement a tax control framework (TCF):&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and maintain a robust Tax Control Framework to set up scalable tax processes, mitigate risk, and support new business initiatives and international setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead tax audits &amp;amp; authority relations:&lt;/strong&gt; Together with the Tax Lead you will act as the main point of contact for tax authorities across NL, DE, and FR, leading indirect tax audits and managing external advisor relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a strategic business partner:&lt;/strong&gt; Work seamlessly with cross-functional partners (tech, supply chain, commercial, legal etc) as a key tax advisor for new business initiatives, product launches, expansions into new territories, and regulatory updates impacting the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge transition &amp;amp; broad tax scope:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate with external advisors while transitioning key tax knowledge in-house and train the broader finance organisation. Gain hands-on exposure to cross-functional fields including product-specific taxes/surcharges, Transfer Pricing, and wage tax topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master&#39;s degree i&lt;/strong&gt;n Tax Law, Tax Economics, Finance, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4–7 years of relevant tax experience&lt;/strong&gt; in indirect tax (VAT) or tax reporting, ideally combining top-tier tax advisory with &lt;strong&gt;in-house experience&lt;/strong&gt; in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in process improvement, tax automation, and working with &lt;strong&gt;e-invoicing frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience establishing or optimizing a &lt;strong&gt;Tax Control Framework (TCF)&lt;/strong&gt; or a proven track record of &lt;strong&gt;leading tax audits is a big plus&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical expertise in European VAT regulations (especially across &lt;strong&gt;NL, DE, and FR)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, ownership-driven, and process-oriented—you don&#39;t wait to be told what to do; you spot opportunities for improvement and build future-proof workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workday knowledge is a big plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in English&lt;/strong&gt; (verbal and written); proficiency in Dutch, German, or French is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🗺️Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;Access to&amp;nbsp;Benefits at Work, a personal platform offering hundreds of exclusive discounts and vouchers on top brands like adidas, Nike, HEMA, and Dille &amp;amp; Kamille.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you have the 1-in-a-million solution to a 1-million-egg challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
At Picnic, we deliver groceries to thousands of households every week. That includes &lt;strong&gt;selling over 1 million eggs every single week. &lt;/strong&gt;While the vast majority arrive safe and sound, eggs remain fragile cargo, and breakage still happens too often in our supply chain.We want to crack this problem once and for all … and we need your help!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⤵️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The Challenge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;We are looking for a creative and ambitious Industrial Design (Thesis) Intern to design the egg packaging of the future. Your mission? Bring our egg damage rate down to 0%.When it comes to the solution, everything is on the table:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative materials&lt;/strong&gt; (sustainable, recycled, or bio-based)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Radical new geometries and structural designs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal protection&lt;/strong&gt; (custom foam, shock absorption, smart inserts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; (working directly with our packaging partners to turn your design into a scalable product)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
No idea is too crazy, if it protects the egg, we want and will&amp;nbsp; test it!
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
Your thesis won&#39;t just sit on a shelf; it will have a direct, real-world impact:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Zero Food Waste:&lt;/strong&gt; Preventing broken eggs means less wasted food in our supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;😊 &lt;strong&gt;Delighted Customers:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensuring every customer receives flawless eggs, every time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently pursuing a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Industrial Design Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; (or a related field) and looking for a graduation/thesis project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a creative thinker with a hands-on prototyping mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine design aesthetics with practical engineering and supply chain feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a great communicator who enjoys collaborating with internal teams and external suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speaking Dutch is a plus, but not a requirement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
