&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In een notendop:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als technician bij Picnic maak je deel uit van ons interne onderhoudsteam en draag je bij aan het soepel functioneren van onze Material Handling Equipment. We leren je alles over onderhoud en storingen, terwijl jij de vrijheid krijgt om mee te denken en te verbeteren. Je groeit snel, neemt initiatief en bouwt mee aan de techniek van de toekomst. Samen zorgen we dat duizenden bestellingen elke dag soepel worden geleverd.&amp;nbsp;Het Fulfilment Center is 7 dagen per week, 24 uur per dag geopend. Samen met de andere technici werk je in wisselende diensten volgens een 5-ploegenschema, zodat er altijd een deskundige aanwezig is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De kunst van het vak: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Storingen oplossen en voorkomen&lt;/strong&gt;: je gaat storingen te lijf en voorkomt dat ze opnieuw optreden;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problemen voor zijn&lt;/strong&gt;: je signaleert vroegtijdig symptomen van mogelijke storingen en grijpt in voordat ze problemen veroorzaken;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preventief onderhoud:&lt;/strong&gt; je doet preventief onderhoud zodat onze machines altijd draaien;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continue verbetering&lt;/strong&gt;: je implementeert continu verbeteringen om de geautomatiseerde systemen optimaal te laten functioneren;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Over jou&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je hebt een technisch diploma op MBO-niveau 3 of hoger;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je hebt 0-2 jaar ervaring in een technische of onderhoudsfunctie;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent geïnteresseerd in het werken met software tools en dashboards;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je kunt goed communiceren en werkt graag samen in een team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent proactief, leergierig en vindt creatieve oplossingen voor technische uitdagingen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Marktconform salaris, afhankelijk van je kennis en ervaring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leaseauto + reiskostenvergoeding vanaf 10 km enkele reis (€0,21/km)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;25 vakantiedagen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gratis maaltijden &amp;amp; snacks op locatie&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We gaan direct sparen voor je pensioen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trainingsprogramma om je technische kwaliteiten en je logistieke kennis nog beter te maken&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leuke teamuitjes, Picnic’s jaarlijkse festival, kerstfeest en nog veel meer!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Een jonge, innovatieve start-up-cultuur met meer dan 50 nationaliteiten!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As Picnic’s supply chain is growing, we face new logistical puzzles every day. We open new areas, develop our network of suppliers and partners, and find new ways to delight our customers. In this dynamic environment we continuously improve our processes to keep our supply chain running smoothly. Our team of Supply Chain Coordinators owns the inbound supply chain processes. Together you proactively spot issues and find pragmatic solutions to make our customers happy every day!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are the linking pin between the Commercial team and Operations. You work together with our suppliers to make sure our entire assortment is available to our customers in the most efficient way. When the Commercial team has new products to add to the assortment, you’ll work out the logistics. You run your own improvement projects, while you also have a constant eye on the daily operations. When challenges occur, you focus your energy where it matters. With data-driven analysis, you find root causes and you prevent similar issues from happening again.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a Supply Chain Coordinator you know what customers want and understand seasonal patterns and trends in demand. You translate commercial plans into concrete actions and ensure high product availability with our suppliers. Do you play good cop? Or do you demand a quick fix? Knowing how to negotiate helps you get the best for Picnic’s customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordination: &lt;/strong&gt;Coordinate&amp;nbsp;Picnic’s inbound supply chain, where you will focus on a specific part of the assortment;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder management: &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain and monitor Picnic’s logistical relationship with our suppliers;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimization:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Manage and adjust order and delivery schedules for inbound products;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement and run improvement projects;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Starter with a Master’s degree;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;0-2 years experience, plus if you have experience in the supply chain field;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fluency in Dutch and English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Available fulltime;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll be working in Utrecht and Amsterdam, with regular visits to the Fulfilment Centers and suppliers across the country:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Data driven: you want to verify every claim with solid data;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Persistent and enthusiastic; you turn ‘it’s not possible’ into ‘it’s on the way’;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Creative and pragmatic; you find original solutions for things that need to be fixed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;now;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Talent for planning; you see things coming and have already planned for it;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commercially oriented; you know what customers want and when;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including a tailored soft skills program at Lepaya. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll work in an awesome scale-up environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are what you eat&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our teams like working together at the office, the tasty lunch and Barista-made coffee adding to the excitement. Where possible, we like to enable people to work from home now and then.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/0VVWpaZSCZU&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we&#39;re revolutionising the way people buy groceries with our affordable and sustainable grocery service.&amp;nbsp; We do almost everything in-house, developing cutting-edge technologies and processes to ensure we continue to grow rapidly without missing a beat.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In all our customer-facing products, we use React. Our mobile application uses React Native, combined with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/blogs/faster-features-happier-customers-introducing-the-platform-that-transformed-our-grocery-app&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;home-grown server-driven UI framework&lt;/a&gt;. We have ambitious plans to unify our mobile and web applications into a single platform. Quality is our top priority, so we use TypeScript across the board.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for driven front-end engineers to help us bring the grocery shopping revolution to millions of customers. In this role, in addition to working with React daily you&#39;ll be working with our powerful server-driven UI framework that&#39;s at the heart of our business&#39;s success:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Powers our entire shopping app and enables rapid iterations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives sophisticated personalization at scale, delivering tailored content to each user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empowers our business teams to operate the store autonomously - dozens of operators and analysts make every day real-time updates without any further tech involvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you can expect to work with a wide range of technologies within the JavaScript ecosystem, across the full stack! &amp;nbsp;Experience with React Native is not required, we’ll get you up to speed with that on the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with cross-functional teams across the entire business, pick up increasingly challenging tasks and projects, and have ownership over your contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;: Work on our customer-facing Picnic store, implementing new features on a daily basis, and contribute to our React Native architecture and server-driven UI framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate with designers and product owners to create specifications for new features&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech&lt;/strong&gt;: React, React Native, TypeScript and RxJS, Redux, Styled Components, Jest, NextJS, Storybook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of full-time software development, and have worked with React, React Native, Typescript, or similar JavaScript frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in shipping applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness and desire to work with a variety of technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with (unit) testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm to work with a variety of technologies and a problem-solving mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The confidence to transform business requirements into a technical plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re based in or happy to relocate to the Netherlands. We work from our office in Amsterdam full-time. There&#39;s flexibility to work from home when needed, but if remote or hybrid-first is what you&#39;re after, this probably isn&#39;t the right fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾 Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍎 You are what you eat&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏽 Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials. There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔋 Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, if you want to find our relocation benefits, see &lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/relocation&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic we design and build everything in-house. From last-mile delivery, to automation, to powerful workforce apps, the Internal Products Design team shapes the products used across our one of a kind supply chain. Our aim is to design products that improve the work-lives of our Picnic colleagues, whilst moving the business forward and ensuring a flawless customer experience. Alongside our product teams, we’re part of a company-wide UX guild. From enterprise tools and automated warehouses to e-commerce and custom-built EVs, UX at Picnic spans it all. Getting curious? &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/posts/picnictechnologies_internal-products-are-tools-for-customer-activity-7396448329183686657-GPYB?utm_source=share&amp;amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;amp;rcm=ACoAAAwnQloBptuv3N6tGsTMwexOL4ymUogFwTc&quot;&gt;Here&#39;s&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; a glimpse of the tools you&#39;ll be working on! We regularly come together to align, share ideas, and have some fun along the way.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the design &lt;/strong&gt;of products, ensuring clarity, usability, and consistency across our tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate complex systems &lt;/strong&gt;to create user-centered solutions that balance business goals and human needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use qualitative research&lt;/strong&gt; to inform your decisions, regularly testing with real users supported by our UX research team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive projects end-to-end,&lt;/strong&gt; from problem definition to polished UI and thorough documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work closely with developers &lt;/strong&gt;to ensure high-quality implementation and a seamless user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow &lt;/strong&gt;through regular feedback and mentorship from experienced UX designers and researchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to the evolution of our design system&lt;/strong&gt; and maintain a consistent visual language across products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep improving,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;iterating, exploring, and challenging the status quo. Design is never finished.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master’s degree in a relevant design field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 3 years of experience as UX or Product Designer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio with product design cases and solid explanation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in designing for B2B or enterprise apps is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident using Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of sketching UI concepts with great eye for detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English speaking and writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holder of an EU work permit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏠 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
