&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Telesales · SumUp&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior CRM Administrator to join our Telesales Team. This is not a “keep-the-lights-on” role - it’s a seat at the table. You’ll work at the intersection of technology, process design, and people, shaping how our inbound and outbound telesales teams operate day to day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll contribute to our global Salesforce environment and, just as importantly, challenge the status quo, asking why a process works the way it does, finding the friction in how our reps sell, and rolling out tooling and automation that genuinely make a difference to the people using them. You’ll also work alongside the tools and partners that bring AI into our telesales setup, helping to evaluate, integrate, and get the best out of them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;If you love turning inefficient, manual workflows into elegant, well-integrated systems - and you know how to bring stakeholders along for the ride - this is your kind of role.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive relevant and cross-team projects for process improvements across inbound and outbound telesales workflows, identifying friction points and designing scalable, well-integrated solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, integrate, and get the best out of CRM-adjacent tooling - diallers, sequencing tools, conversation intelligence, and AI-powered solutions - working closely with the teams and vendors who build them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support key AI initiatives in the telesales setup - for example, contributing to the transition to a new AI calling provider, the rollout of a sales rep copilot, and conversational-insight tools that draw on calls, email, and chat - by handling the CRM integration, data flow, configuration, and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to continuously improving the day-to-day administration of our Salesforce telesales domain - automations, internal support agents, reporting, and data quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with stakeholders across Sales, Revenue Operations, and Product - and, together with our Product Manager, translate business needs into effective CRM solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and confidently - from writing requirements and documentation to presenting recommendations to sales management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse CRM data and usage patterns to surface insights, track adoption, and measure the impact of changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and support end users, building a culture of CRM adoption and best practice across the telesales organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of the curve - keeping up with Salesforce releases, ecosystem tooling, and industry trends to continuously bring fresh ideas to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Salesforce Administrator, ideally in a sales or revenue operations environment, in a fast-paced setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical understanding of Salesforce Sales Cloud, automations, security/permissions, SOQL, and 3rd-party integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating and working with 3rd-party tools - from scoping and designing secure data flows through to configuration and user adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to AI solutions in previous roles - whether 3rd-party AI tools or other solutions you helped evaluate, integrate, or roll out - and a genuine curiosity for how AI can improve sales workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL and analytics tooling allow you to not just fix problems, you use your analytical, process-improvement mindset to prevent them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management: you can navigate competing priorities and influence without authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, confident communicator - equally comfortable writing a technical spec and presenting to a non-technical audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with telesales tooling, especially contact-centre and voice AI tooling (e.g. Aircall, Five9, Gong, claap.io, Outreach, MixMax, or similar) - with a track record of bringing out the best in the tools you work with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and write Apex and or lightning we components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of Salesforce integration options and REST APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Salesforce, CRM, or AI related certifications (e.g. Advanced Admin, Sales Cloud Consultant, Salesforce Certified Agentforce Specialist).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-semibold-pgl7 cui-body-normal-pxkh cui-body-highlight-bbub css-10dm8y e173j6r82&quot;&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🌍 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: Be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2,000 for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our VSOP program: You will own a stake in SumUp’s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🔄 30 Days Sabbatical: Enjoy the unique opportunity to take a well-deserved break with our 30 days sabbatical benefit after completing 3 years of employment with SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: Earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, relocation assistance, subsidised office lunches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in the everyday hero.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Small business owners are at the heart of all we do, so we create powerful, easy-to-use financial solutions to help them run their businesses. With a founder’s mentality and a &#39;team-first’ attitude, our diverse teams across Europe, South America, Australia and the United States work together to ensure that the small business owners we partner with can be successful doing what they love.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp will not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from a candidate.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The MarTech team builds the marketing and growth systems that help SumUp reach more merchants around the world. We combine backend engineering, data engineering, data science and external marketing platforms to create reliable, scalable solutions that improve conversion, increase operational efficiency and unlock new acquisition channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work spans recommendation engines, promotion management, affiliate and referral platforms, campaign feed publishing, creative automation, localization and conversion tracking integrations that send signals to advertising platforms. We validate early ideas and prototypes into production-grade products that marketing teams can use independently, reducing manual work and helping campaigns reach customers faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a diverse and distributed team that works closely with stakeholders across Acquisition Engineering squads, Online Marketing, Content &amp;amp; Localization, Engagement and Platform Infrastructure. Because our systems sit at the intersection of technology, data and business growth, you will work on meaningful problems with multiple technical dependencies and a visible impact on SumUp’s acquisition strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and operate reliable backend services that support marketing and growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own features and engineering projects from discovery and technical design through delivery and production support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build integrations with internal and external platforms, ensuring reliable data flows and maintainable interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve architectures for distributed services and event-driven systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, quality and operational excellence of existing services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with technical and non-technical stakeholders to clarify requirements, communicate trade-offs and shape priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a high standard of engineering through testing, code reviews, documentation and pragmatic technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the growth of the team by pairing with peers, sharing knowledge and mentoring less experienced engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be great for this role if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional backend engineering experience. Strong experience with Go and the wider Go ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with distributed systems, microservices and event-driven architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-streaming platforms and messaging brokers such as Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with DevOps practices and CI/CD tools, for example GitHub Actions or Argo CD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building new systems while also maintaining and improving legacy services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of software architecture, service boundaries, APIs, data flows, testing and production operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain technical concepts and trade-offs to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven stakeholder-management skills and a collaborative approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of ownership and a commitment to writing clear, maintainable and testable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and enthusiasm for solving meaningful problems for users and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in marketing technology, growth, acquisition or advertising platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with React, TypeScript, or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech or a related industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧑‍🔬 We take learning and experimentation seriously with Hack Days every second Friday, and entire &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FBKiVCLompk&quot;&gt;global Hack Weeks&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: Be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2,000 for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our VSOP program: You will own a stake in SumUp’s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔄 30 Days Sabbatical: Enjoy the unique opportunity to take a well-deserved break with our 30 days sabbatical benefit after completing 3 years of employment with SumUp&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: Earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, relocation assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by Company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 36 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in our diverse team of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore career opportunities with us and join a team driven by collaboration, innovation, and a shared vision of creating a world where everyone can build a thriving business. Discover more about our vibrant and inclusive work culture and how we work on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;Performance Marketing Working Student – Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type:&lt;/strong&gt; Working student, 20 hours/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take a look at where you&#39;ll be based: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot;&gt;watch the Berlin office tour&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition&#39;s Performance Marketing function helps attract the right candidates efficiently across different markets and roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to strengthen our in-house capabilities, you&#39;ll support day-to-day campaign operations, reporting and continuous improvement. You&#39;ll work closely with teams across Talent Acquisition and Employer branding, gaining hands-on experience in how data, digital marketing and operational processes support hiring at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the day-to-day monitoring of paid recruitment marketing campaigns and flag anything that needs attention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep job listings live, accurate and correctly categorised across active boards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support weekly performance reporting across impressions, clicks, applications, cost per application and candidate pipeline contribution, and flag unusual performance or budget pacing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate creative feedback between the TA team, Employer Brand and external agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research markets, audiences and competitors to help sharpen the marketing approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve recurring workflows and identify opportunities to make processes more efficient and support recurring operational tasks across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying Marketing, Digital Marketing, Communications, Media, Business, Data Analytics or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some hands-on exposure to marketing, recruitment, creative content or communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with spreadsheets and interpreting basic campaign metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re detail-oriented, organised and comfortable taking ownership of recurring tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in digital marketing, data and how processes can be improved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp 🎉&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office at Ostbahnhof&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Be part of an inclusive and collaborative environment where different perspectives are valued&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days, pro-rated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Access health and well-being support through our Employee Assistance Programme, an Urban Sports Club subsidy, and fitness activities, including on-site gym access, yoga sessions, and team sports&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚆 Benefit from subsidised public transport with the Deutschlandticket, offering unlimited travel on local and regional transport across Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥗 Enjoy partially subsidised office lunches and weekly breakfast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Receive additional rewards through our employee referral programme when referring talents to join our team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 38 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
