&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Summit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit Therapeutics Inc. is a biopharmaceutical oncology company with a mission focused on improving quality of life, increasing potential duration of life, and resolving serious unmet medical needs. At Summit, we believe in building a team of world class professionals who are passionate about this mission, and it is our people who drive this mission to reality. Summit’s core values include integrity, passion for excellence, purposeful urgency, collaboration, and our commitment to people. Our employees are truly the heart and soul of our culture, and they are invaluable in shaping our journey toward excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit’s team is inspired to touch and help change lives through Summit’s clinical studies in the field of oncology. Summit has multiple global Phase 3 clinical studies, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi: Phase 3 clinical study which was intended to evaluate ivonescimab combined with chemotherapy compared to placebo plus chemotherapy in patients with EGFR-mutated, locally advanced or metastatic non-squamous NSCLC who were previously treated with a 3rd generation EGFR TKI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-3: Phase 3 clinical study which is intended to evaluate ivonescimab combined with chemotherapy compared to pembrolizumab combined with chemotherapy in patients with first-line metastatic NSCLC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-7: Phase 3 clinical study which is intended to evaluate ivonescimab monotherapy compared to pembrolizumab monotherapy in patients with first-line metastatic NSCLC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Colorectal Cancer (CRC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-GI3: Phase 3 clinical study intended to evaluate ivonescimab in combination with chemotherapy compared with bevacizumab plus chemotherapy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ivonescimab is an investigational therapy not presently approved by any regulatory authority other than China’s National Medical Products Administration (NMPA). Summit is headquartered in Miami, Florida, and has additional offices in California, New Jersey, the UK, and Ireland.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Overview of Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Regional Business Director (RBD) will lead the successful launch and commercialization of&amp;nbsp;ivonescimab&amp;nbsp;within&amp;nbsp;an assigned U.S. region. Reporting to the&amp;nbsp;Head of&amp;nbsp;U.S. Sales, the RBD&amp;nbsp;is responsible for&amp;nbsp;executing national sales strategies, leading a high-performing team of&amp;nbsp;oncology&amp;nbsp;account managers,&amp;nbsp;and driving regional performance to achieve commercial&amp;nbsp;objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The RBD will recruit, develop, and coach a field sales team while fostering strong collaboration with Marketing, Market Access, Medical Affairs, and other cross-functional partners. This leader will serve as the voice of the field by&amp;nbsp;providing&amp;nbsp;customer insights, competitive intelligence, and market feedback to&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;commercial execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role will report&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Head of US Sales.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Role and Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Execute national sales strategies and business plans to achieve regional&amp;nbsp;sales objectives&amp;nbsp;and market share goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recruit, develop, coach, and&amp;nbsp;retain&amp;nbsp;a high-performing team of&amp;nbsp;oncology&amp;nbsp;account&amp;nbsp;managers, fostering a culture of accountability, collaboration, and excellence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead regional launch readiness and execution, ensuring sales representatives are prepared to effectively promote&amp;nbsp;ivonescimab&amp;nbsp;and deliver a best-in-class customer experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Monitor regional sales performance through KPIs, performance metrics, and business analytics; provide ongoing coaching and development to maximize team effectiveness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop strategic regional business plans and account strategies to&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;customer engagement and resource deployment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Marketing, Medical Affairs, Market Access, Commercial Operations, and other cross-functional teams to ensure aligned execution of commercial initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;strong relationships with key oncology customers, healthcare systems, and regional stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Gather and communicate customer insights, competitive intelligence, and market dynamics to inform commercial strategy and continuous improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead regional sales meetings, business reviews, and field coaching activities to reinforce strategic priorities and share best practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure all commercial activities are conducted in compliance with company policies, industry regulations, and applicable legal requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage regional travel, expenses, and resources responsibly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;All other duties as assigned&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience, Education and Specialized Knowledge and Skills:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business,&amp;nbsp;life&amp;nbsp;sciences, or a related field; advanced degree preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Minimum&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;10+ years of pharmaceutical or biotechnology sales experience, including 5+ years of oncology sales leadership&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recent experience leading or supporting oncology product launches; NSCLC experience strongly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success leading and developing high-performing oncology sales teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong coaching, leadership, and performance management skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proven ability to analyze sales data and translate insights into actionable business plans.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and relationship-building skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience collaborating effectively with cross-functional commercial and medical teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of the oncology marketplace, customer landscape, and account-based selling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to travel up to 75%, including overnight travel, based on business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the pay for this position&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$259,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$291,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation packages are based on several factors that are unique to each candidate, including but not limited to skill set, depth of experience, certifications, and specific work location. This may be different in other locations due to differences in the cost of labor. The total compensation package for this position may also include bonus, stock, benefits and/or other applicable variable compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit does not accept referrals from employment businesses and/or employment agencies in respect of the vacancies posted on this site. All employment businesses/agencies are required to contact Summit’s Talent Acquisition team at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- obtain prior written authorization before referring any candidates to Summit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Summit Therapeutics Inc.&amp;nbsp;is an Equal Opportunity Employer and takes pride in creating and maintaining diverse environment. We do not discriminate in recruitment, hiring, training or promotion or any other employment practices for reasons of race, color, religion, gender, national origin, age, sexual orientation, marital or veteran status, disability, or any other legally protected status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is the home of sports cards, trading cards, and collectibles for over 100 million fans worldwide. As part of the global Fanatics platform, we&#39;re rebuilding how collectors discover, buy, sell, and experience their hobby — live, in real time, at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our flagship mobile product, &lt;strong&gt;Fanatics Live&lt;/strong&gt;, is where that experience comes to life: live card breaks, real-time auctions, high-traffic chat, marketplace transactions, and deep collection management tools. The stakes are high and the traffic is real — we build for peak-load moments where latency is visible and reliability is nonnegotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the &lt;strong&gt;Instant Rips&lt;/strong&gt; iOS team — the group responsible for the live-break commerce experience on Fanatics Live. We build the surfaces millions of collectors use in real time: bidding in live auctions, joining breaks, navigating a high-velocity chat stream, and transacting in the marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The iOS stack is modern by design. We&#39;re SwiftUI-first, run The Composable Architecture TCA) across the app, use Swift Concurrency throughout, talk to our backend via Apollo GraphQL, and maintain a clean modular SPM codebase generated with Tuist. There&#39;s no legacy UIKit app hiding under the surface — you&#39;ll be working in a codebase you can be proud of.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI tooling is part of how we work. We expect engineers to use it on the job, give it good context, and verify the output — not just accept it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship production iOS features across the live-break experience: auctions, stream viewing, chat, marketplace, and collector tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own features end-to-end — API contracts, TCA reducers, SwiftUI views, testing, and release&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write genuine test coverage: unit tests with mock dependencies, TCA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TestStore assertions, async test patterns — not coverage theater&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review pull requests with judgment: surface real defects, prioritize what matters, coach on what to let go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architectural decisions: modularization strategy, effect management, failure handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers earlier in their career and raise the quality bar across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; building consumer-facing iOS applications at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with AI-assisted development tooling LLM optimization loops,&amp;nbsp;Xcode CLI integration)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Swift Concurrency&lt;/strong&gt; — async/await, structured concurrency, Sendable, Swift&amp;nbsp;Macros&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SwiftUI&lt;/strong&gt; — stateless/stateful view patterns, NavigationStack, performanceaware composition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Composable Architecture TCA&lt;/strong&gt; — Reducer/Store/Action/State, effect management, parent-child delegation, testing with TestStore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apollo GraphQL (iOS)&lt;/strong&gt; — schema-driven development, Swift codegen, subscriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SPM multi-package architecture&lt;/strong&gt; — modular feature separation, local packages, clean dependency graphs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tuist or XcodeGen&lt;/strong&gt; — project generation tooling; no committed &lt;sub&gt;.xcodeproj &lt;/sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt; — Bitrise, Fastlane, or equivalent automated build/test pipelines &lt;strong&gt;Static analysis&lt;/strong&gt; — SwiftLint, Periphery or equivalent code quality gates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured commit/PR discipline&lt;/strong&gt; tied to a project tracker Linear, Jira, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Bonus points&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with livestreaming, real-time auctions, or high-throughput WebSocket/subscription workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to marketplace or e-commerce iOS applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for sports cards, collectibles, or live commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above list of job duties is not exclusive or exhaustive and the post holder will be required to undertake such tasks as may reasonably be expected within the scope and grading of the post.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Subject to applicable laws, Fanatics Collectibles may choose to run a background check.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including ----- For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Android Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to build high-quality mobile experiences across the Fanatics Collectibles ecosystem. Depending on business needs, you may support one or more of our products or platforms, partnering with Product, Design, Data, and Engineering to solve complex customer and technical problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior engineer, you’ll independently own significant features and technical initiatives from design through production. You’ll help shape technical solutions, improve the quality and scalability of our Android applications, and provide technical leadership and guidance to other engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an engineer who combines deep Android expertise with strong product judgment and thrives in a fast-moving, collaborative environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Senior Android Engineer at Fanatics Collectibles is more than an experienced feature developer. You are expected to independently solve increasingly complex technical problems, exercise strong judgment within your area of expertise, and influence engineering outcomes beyond your individual work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll remain deeply hands-on while providing project-level technical leadership, helping other engineers succeed, and improving the practices and systems around you. Your impact should extend beyond individual features to the quality, reliability, and effectiveness of the broader team and Android engineering environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Build Exceptional Android Experiences&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, test, and maintain high-quality Android applications using Kotlin and modern Android development practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex features and technical initiatives from design through implementation, launch, and ongoing operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Design to translate customer needs into intuitive, performant mobile experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build applications that are reliable, scalable, accessible, and responsive across a broad range of Android devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Provide Technical Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sound architectural and technical decisions within the Android domain and contribute to broader mobile engineering decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical risks and opportunities and recommend solutions that balance product velocity, scalability, reliability, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and promote engineering practices that improve code quality, testing, observability, and developer productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance, code reviews, and mentorship to engineers while raising the quality of engineering execution across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Drive Quality &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve application performance, stability, security, and reliability through measurement and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve complex production issues across mobile applications and their supporting services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use monitoring, experimentation, and customer feedback to identify opportunities to improve product and technical performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce technical debt and evolve existing systems while balancing near-term product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Collaborate Across Teams&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with backend, platform, iOS, web, data, and other engineering teams to deliver cohesive customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively with Product, Design, Data, and business stakeholders to clarify requirements and navigate technical tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical planning and help break complex initiatives into clear, executable work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical decisions, risks, and tradeoffs clearly to technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience, with significant experience building and shipping Android applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;Kotlin&lt;/strong&gt; and the modern Android ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Android architecture, application lifecycle, concurrency, networking, persistence, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern Android frameworks and practices such as Jetpack Compose, Coroutines, Flow, dependency injection, and automated testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and delivering complex features with limited oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of software architecture, APIs, distributed systems, and how mobile applications interact with backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to diagnose complex technical problems and drive them through resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and experience collaborating across Product, Design, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience providing technical guidance and mentorship to other engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building high-scale consumer mobile products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with commerce, marketplaces, livestreaming, social platforms, payments, or other transaction-oriented products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile observability, experimentation, analytics, and performance tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD and mobile release automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a shared mobile platform or multi-product engineering environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for sports, collectibles, fandom, or building products that bring communities together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above list of job duties is not exclusive or exhaustive and the post holder will be required to undertake such tasks as may reasonably be expected within the scope and grading of the post.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Subject to applicable laws, Fanatics Collectibles may choose to run a background check.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
