&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Keyfactor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our mission is to securely connect the world: humans, machines, and AI. Keyfactor is the leader in trust infrastructure for AI and machines, helping the world&#39;s largest enterprises and government agencies take control of the cryptographic identities that safeguard every digital interaction. Behind the platform is a global team of people who care deeply about the work and each other. We move fast, think big, and show up for one another every day. If you&#39;re looking for work that matters and a team that brings out your best, we hope you&#39;ll trust your future with Keyfactor!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;itle:&lt;/strong&gt; Regional&lt;/span&gt; Sales Director, DACH&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Germany&amp;nbsp;(Remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Mid Level - Senior&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Function:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Direct Sales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Travel Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; up to 50%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Computer Network &amp;amp; Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Sales Director, you will be one of three senior individual contributors responsible for the DACH region, with ownership of a defined portfolio of enterprise accounts. This is an individual contributor role and does not include people-management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will develop and execute focused account plans, establish executive relationships, generate and convert pipeline, and build strategic opportunities capable of navigating technical evaluation, formal procurement, and complex decision-making cycles. You will engage with CISOs, CIOs, PKI and security architects, procurement leaders, partners, and other key stakeholders to connect technical requirements with operational risk and measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with the other DACH sales representatives and cross-functional partners across Sales Engineering, Sales Development, Marketing, Channel, and Delivery. While you will have substantial support, you will maintain direct accountability for opportunity momentum, qualification, forecast accuracy, commercial strategy, and results across your assigned accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keyfactor provides experienced sellers with meaningful autonomy in how they develop their territory. In return, we expect self-direction, disciplined execution, sound judgment, and consistent performance against a significant sales quota. Our culture is shaped by trust, customer focus, agility, respect, teamwork, and a shared commitment to delivering results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic plans for assigned enterprise accounts, identifying whitespace, priority use cases, routes to executive access, and opportunities for partner involvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate qualified pipeline through direct prospecting, executive engagement, account-based activities, and credible partner-led sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and advance multi-threaded opportunities from initial engagement through discovery, technical validation, commercial negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead value-based conversations with senior business and technical stakeholders, translating complex security challenges into clear and compelling customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish trusted relationships with CISOs, CIOs, security architects, procurement leaders, partners, and other key decision-makers and influencers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internal specialists and external partners to create alignment, maintain momentum, and deliver an effective customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply disciplined qualification practices and maintain accurate opportunity records and reliable forecasts throughout long, multi-stakeholder sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate public and private tenders, procurement processes, and contract negotiations while protecting value and sustaining momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ask difficult qualification questions, address obstacles directly, and take ownership of account strategy and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel throughout the DACH region as needed to support customers, partners, and business development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications, Education, and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-NA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success selling complex enterprise software, infrastructure, or cybersecurity solutions throughout the DACH region, including substantial multi-stakeholder transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to create new business within strategic accounts rather than relying solely on existing or inbound demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prospecting capabilities, internal drive to win, and a sense of urgency that translates into consistent action and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in both German and English, with the ability to communicate effectively with senior business and technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling and presentation skills, including the ability to make complex technical subjects understandable, relevant, and compelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead without formal authority by creating clarity, aligning specialists and partners, and influencing decisions across multiple stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented approach to account planning, opportunity qualification, pipeline management, and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment and proven negotiation skills across both direct and partner-led sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity and the ability to develop credibility within a technically complex market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of PKI, certificate lifecycle management, machine identity, cryptography, or adjacent cybersecurity markets is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MEDDPICC, Solution Selling, SPIN, or a comparable enterprise sales methodology is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work remotely within Germany and travel up to 50%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legal right to work in Germany and ability to travel freely throughout the assigned territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and customer-focused approach, with the humility, composure, and sound judgment needed to succeed in a high-accountability environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary will be commensurate with experience. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture, Career Opportunities and Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build teams that continually strive to get better than the day before. You will be challenged daily and given opportunities to grow personally and professionally. We balance autonomy and structure to create an entrepreneurial environment to spur creativity and new ideas. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are just some of the initiatives that make our culture special:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Second Fridays (a company-wide day off on the second Friday of every month minus November and December due to the Holiday schedule). Please note that this benefit is subject to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive benefit coverage globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave is available to new parents. Structure varies based on regional/government requirements. In regions where government-paid leave doesn’t exist, like in the U.S., the company offers generous paid parental leave, along with comprehensive adoption and fertility support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive time off globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated employee-focused ambassadors via Key Contributors &amp;amp; Culture Committees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DIVERSE Commitment, a call to action for a more inclusive and diverse future in business, society, and technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Keyfactor Alliance Program to support DEIB efforts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing resources, wellness allowance, mindfulness app free membership, Wellness Wednesdays.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Volunteer Day, company non-profit matching, and 3 volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Talent development and Cross Functional meetings to support professional development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular All Hands meetings – followed by group gatherings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Core Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our core values are extremely important to how we run our business and what we look for in every team member:  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; is paramount.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We deliver security software and solutions where trust and openness are of the highest importance for our customers. We are honest and a trusted partner in every aspect of business.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; are core.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strategize, operate, and execute through a customer-centric view. We prioritize the security interests of our customers, and we act as if their data were our own.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; never stops, it only accelerates.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The speed of change is accelerating. We are committed, through investment and focus, to stay ahead of the innovation curve.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We deliver with &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;agility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We thrive in high-paced and continually changing environments. We navigate through newly added variables, adjust accordingly, while driving towards our strategic goals.  &lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;United by &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;respect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Respect for all is what unites us. We promote diversity, inclusivity, equity, and acting with empathy and openness, both in our business and in our communities.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; make “it” happen.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vision and goals are not individually achievable – they require teamwork. We pride ourselves in operating as a cohesive team, creating promoters and partners, and winning as one.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keyfactor is a proud equal opportunity employer including but not limited to veterans and individuals with disabilities.&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REASONABLE ACCOMMODATION: &lt;/strong&gt;Applicants with disabilities may contact a member of Keyfactor’s People team via ----- and/or telephone at 1.216.785.2990 to request and arrange for accommodations at any time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.keyfactor.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Keyfactor Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: Chief Commercial Officer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;UK, France, Netherlands, Belgium, Germany, Austria, Spain, Finland, USA. Some travel to our offices will be required from time-to-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must have the right to work in one the above countries in order to be considered for the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is looking for a Product Marketing Director who can turn complex technology into stories that people understand, remember, and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own how PQShield&#39;s products, technology, and vision are positioned, communicated, and brought to market worldwide. You&#39;ll sit at the intersection of product, engineering, sales, customers, and the broader security market — translating breakthrough cryptography and security technology into compelling narratives for executives, engineers, partners, and buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for a strategic product marketer and exceptional storyteller who can identify the market shift, understand the customer problem, and turn complex technology into differentiated positioning that creates urgency, preference and demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since NIST published its first post-quantum cryptography (PQC) standards, which the PQShield team co-authored, organizations across semiconductors, automotive, defense, and enterprise face significant challenges in preparing for the post-quantum transition. This role will help define the market narrative around that transition, position PQShield&#39;s portfolio within it and give customers a clear reason to act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚒️ What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the story: Develop the narrative, positioning, messaging, and value propositions that explain what is changing in the market, why customers need to act, the problem PQShield solves, and why our approach is differentiated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn technical capability into customer value: Work with cryptographers, engineers and product leaders to understand sophisticated technology, identify what matters to the buyer and translate technical capabilities into clear business and security value without sacrificing technical credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position the portfolio: Own positioning and messaging for our hardware IP and software portfolio, including PQPlatform, PQPerform, PQCryptoLib, and PQMicroLib. Build a clear messaging architecture that connects the portfolio while preserving the differentiated value of each offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the customer: Develop deep insight into customer problems, buying journeys, security requirements, regulatory pressures, barriers to adoption, buying dynamics, and the forces driving post-quantum adoption. Turn those insights into sharper products, messaging, and go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape category and market narrative: Help define how PQShield talks about post-quantum security, cryptographic agility, and the transition to quantum-safe systems — and how we differentiate our approach in a rapidly evolving market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product launches: Create and execute compelling go-to-market strategies for new products, certifications, partnerships, and major releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip the sales team: Build compelling presentations, stories, solution briefs, case studies, battlecards, and other tools that help sales teams communicate value and win complex deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build buyer and segment-specific stories: Develop differentiated narratives for semiconductors, automotive, military and aerospace, industrial IoT, networking, and enterprise, adapting the value story for different buyers, use cases and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own competitive storytelling: Understand the competitive landscape and turn technical and commercial differences into clear, credible differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create exceptional content: Lead the development of white papers, thought leadership, application notes, customer stories, executive content, web experiences, and other material that establishes PQShield as a category leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring customer stories to life: Find and develop the stories that demonstrate why customers are making the transition to post-quantum security and why they choose PQShield.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the company: Partner closely with product, engineering, sales, partnerships, and leadership to ensure the market sees one clear, compelling PQShield story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 Required Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced product marketing leader who is exceptionally strong in positioning, messaging and strategic storytelling. You can take an emerging market, complicated buyer problem or deeply technical product and find the clear narrative inside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of marketing experience, with significant experience in product marketing, technology marketing, B2B marketing, or a closely related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to develop positioning and stories that change how markets understand a product, technology, or company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills. You can take something highly technical and make it understandable, interesting, and compelling without dumbing it down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling instincts and the ability to find the human, business, and strategic narrative inside complex technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing technical B2B products, ideally in cybersecurity, semiconductors, infrastructure, embedded systems, software, or another sophisticated technology market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of security and technology buyers, and the ability to communicate credibly with CISOs, CTOs, engineers, architects, product leaders, and business executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work closely with technical experts and quickly develop enough subject-matter expertise to challenge assumptions, ask good questions, and tell an accurate story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commercial mindset: you understand that great marketing isn&#39;t just about explaining a product — it&#39;s about creating differentiation, urgency, preference, and ultimately revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching products and taking complex offerings to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing compelling sales narratives and enablement for complex, multi-stakeholder sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic judgment, with the ability to determine what the market needs to hear, why it matters, and how PQShield should say it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-moving environment where you will often need to create the narrative before the market has established one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote first company. You will work from home most of the time, but will need to join us in the office for planning sessions and key meetings as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel for customer meetings and marketing events as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and holiday package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company contributions towards 401K/pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;…and other great benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value the security of our daily digital lives, and love solving hard problems - then we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;At Staffbase, security is at the heart of everything we build. Our Product Security team helps keep our products and customer data secure while enabling engineering teams across the company. We believe the best security work happens when people bring their authentic selves and diverse perspectives to the table and we’re proud of the unique mix of talents and backgrounds in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;As an enablement team, we provide tools, guidance, and insights that allow developers to integrate security early in the development process. We see security not as a blocker but as a trusted partner that is the foundation for better products. With us, you’ll get hands-on experience with modern security practices, mentorship from experienced engineers, and the chance to make a visible impact in a global SaaS environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We work together with curiosity, humility, and a growth mindset, supporting each other, taking ownership of our contributions, and celebrating progress along the way. Here, your ideas matter, your work will shape how we build secure products, and you’ll have space to grow into new challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of tasks that improve our security automation and strengthen our product security pipelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Proactively explore the use of AI for vulnerability detection and remediation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Continuously learn and share knowledge about how vulnerabilities apply in our specific product context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Support the team by enhancing our services with software engineering solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with stakeholders across the product department and gain broad exposure to how a growing SaaS company operates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain our outbound e-mail security by regularly reviewing the related metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain our Web Application Firewall ruleset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Kubernetes security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain our central HTML sanitization service written in TypeScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Practical knowledge of security topics (e.g. penetration testing, secure software development, vulnerability management, SAST, DAST)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong programming skills, preferably one of the following: TypeScript, JavaScript, Kotlin, Java, Go, or Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Practical knowledge of Unix and Kubernetes infrastructure, preferably managed via Terraform and Kustomize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills in English (German is a plus)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we’re offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEUTSCH:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Diese Position ist in München, Deutschland angesiedelt. Die TULIP GmbH und München ist der europäische Hauptsitz von TULIP. Wir arbeiten in einem hybriden Arbeitsumfeld und sind an 3+ Tagen pro Woche im Büro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/&quot;&gt;TULIP&lt;/a&gt; ist die Frontline-Operations-Plattform, die Herstellern hilft, ihre Produktion zu digitalisieren, zu vernetzen und kontinuierlich zu verbessern – mit KI im Kern des Produkts. TULIP wurde am MIT (Massachusetts Institute of Technology) gegründet. Das Unternehmen hat seinen Hauptsitz in Boston, mit Büros in München, Tokio, Tel Aviv, Budapest und Singapur sowie Kundenstandorte in mehr als 45 Ländern.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Im Januar 2026 schloss TULIP seine &lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/press/tulip-secures-120m-series-d/&quot;&gt;$120M Series-D-Finanzierungsrunde&lt;/a&gt; mit einer Unternehmensbewertung von 1,3 Mrd. USD ab. Führende globale Hersteller setzen auf TULIP, darunter VEKA, DMG MORI, Roche, AstraZeneca, Richemont, Saint-Gobain Aerospace und Mitsubishi Electric. Wir arbeiten mit NVIDIA, PwC, McKinsey, BCG und mehr als 160 Technologiepartnern weltweit zusammen. TULIP ist Teil der Global-Innovator-Community des Weltwirtschaftsforums, und unser CEO, Dr. Natan Linder, ist Co-Vorsitzender der Advanced Manufacturing Industry Governors Community des Forums.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Chance für TULIP in der DACH-Region&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DACH ist das Herz der globalen Fertigungsindustrie. Deutschland ist die größte Industrienation Europas und die Geburtsstätte von Industrie 4.0. Die Schweiz ist ein globales Zentrum für Pharma-, Life-Science- und Präzisionsfertigung. Österreich ist ein starker Standort für Automobilbau, Maschinenbau, Metallverarbeitung und Halbleiter. Die Region beheimatet zudem zahlreiche „Hidden Champions&quot; – mittelständische Unternehmen, die in globalen Nischenmärkten führend sind. Diese Unternehmen stehen heute vor ähnlichen Herausforderungen: Fachkräftemangel, steigende Qualitäts- und Compliance-Anforderungen sowie die Notwendigkeit, bestehende Werke zu modernisieren, ohne die Produktion zu unterbrechen. TULIP gibt den Frontline-Teams dieser Unternehmen ein KI-natives Produktionssystem an die Hand, um diesen Anforderungen zu begegnen und die Time-to-Value zu beschleunigen. Lokale Kunden vertrauen unserem Produkt in regulierten und hochpräzisen Produktionsumgebungen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir suchen nun einen &lt;strong&gt;Geschäftsführer (m/w/d) der TULIP GmbH &amp;amp; Vertriebsleiter für DACH&lt;/strong&gt;. Sie verantworten das Wachstum der DACH-Region, führen das lokale Team und repräsentieren TULIP gegenüber Kunden, Partnern und Mitarbeitenden. Dabei haben Sie die Unterstützung eines globalen Unternehmens und echten Gestaltungsspielraum, wie wir in der DACH-Region gewinnen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wichtigste Erfahrungen &amp;amp; Fähigkeiten:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ Jahre Erfahrung im Aufbau und Skalieren von B2B-SaaS-Geschäften im DACH-Markt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Umfangreiche Erfahrung in der Teamführung in Scale-up- und/oder Wachstumsphasen-Umgebungen mit globalem Bezug&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starkes Netzwerk und hohe Glaubwürdigkeit bei Einkäufern aus Fertigung und Industrie in Deutschland, Österreich und der Schweiz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachweisliche Erfolgsbilanz beim Erreichen und Übertreffen von Umsatzzielen bei großen, komplexen Enterprise-Deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit erstklassigen GTM-Tools wie Salesforce, Outreach, ZoomInfo, LinkedIn Sales Navigator oder vergleichbaren Tools zur disziplinierten Umsetzung von Forecasting, Reporting und Pipeline-Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Herausragende Fähigkeiten im Vertrieb komplexer, hochwertiger B2B-SaaS-Lösungen in Fertigungsumgebungen sowie im Aufbau eines erfolgreichen Teams hierfür&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verhandlungssichere Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wesentliche Verantwortlichkeiten:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leitung der TULIP GmbH als Geschäftsführer/in – Prägung von Unternehmenskultur, Betriebsabläufen und der Zusammenarbeit des lokalen Teams mit globalen Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verantwortung für die Entwicklung und Umsetzung der Go-to-Market-Wachstumsstrategie für DACH, in Zusammenarbeit mit der Commercial Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erreichen der ARR-Wachstumsziele für das DACH-Geschäft über alle Branchenvertikalen hinweg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifikation, Qualifizierung und Entwicklung neuer Geschäftsmöglichkeiten mit Kunden; Aufbau starker Beziehungen zu regionalen Partnern, Vertriebskanälen und Ökosystem-Akteuren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enge Zusammenarbeit mit Engineering, Legal, Customer Success und weiteren Teams zur Steuerung der Deal-Abwicklung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einstellung, Einarbeitung, Schulung und Mentoring neuer Vertriebsmitarbeitender für die Region im Zuge ihres Wachstums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kontinuierliche Verbesserung der Vertriebsprozesse zur Unterstützung der regionalen Skalierung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wichtigste Ansprechpartner/Kollaborateure:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Globale Commercial-Teams (z. B. Account Executives, Customer Success, Professional Services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Globale Marketing-Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Geschäftsleitung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir wissen, dass selbst großartige Kandidatinnen und Kandidaten manchmal am Hochstapler-Syndrom zweifeln. Auch wenn Sie nicht jede Anforderung erfüllen, lohnt sich eine Bewerbung – Sie geben uns damit die Möglichkeit, Sie in Betracht zu ziehen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir bauen ein starkes, vielfältiges Team auf, das harte Arbeit, Familien und persönliches Wohlbefinden wertschätzt. Zu unseren Benefits gehören:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkter Einfluss auf Produkt und Unternehmenskultur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unternehmensanteile (Equity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attraktives Benefits-Paket, inklusive Zuschüsse für den Arbeitsweg, Weiterbildungsbudget, Team-Events und drei Tage pro Woche Mittagessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitszeiten und unbegrenzter Urlaubsanspruch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein inklusives, hundefreundliches Büro mit vielfältigen und inspirierenden Kolleginnen und Kollegen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtuelle und Vor-Ort-Veranstaltungen sowie Happy Hours auf globaler Unternehmensebene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir sind ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit bietet. Bei TULIP feiern wir Vielfalt. Qualifizierte Bewerberinnen und Bewerber werden unabhängig von Herkunft, Religion, Hautfarbe, Nationalität, Geschlecht, sexueller Orientierung, Alter, Familienstand, Veteranenstatus oder Behinderung berücksichtigt. Helfen Sie uns, eine inklusive Gemeinschaft aufzubauen, die die Frontline-Operationen transformiert&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ENGLISH:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is located in Munich, Germany. TULIP GmbH is a full operating entity and Munich is TULIP’s headquarters in Europe. We are a hybrid work environment and we are in the office 3+ days/per week. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/&quot;&gt;TULIP&lt;/a&gt; is the frontline operations platform that helps manufacturers digitize, connect and continuously improve how they run production, with AI at the core of the product. TULIP was founded out of MIT. It is headquartered in Boston, has offices in Munich, Tokyo, Tel Aviv, Budapest and Singapore, and has customer sites in more than 45 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In January 2026, TULIP &lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/press/tulip-secures-120m-series-d/&quot;&gt;closed its $120M Series D&lt;/a&gt; at a company valuation of $1.3B. Leading global manufacturers run on TULIP, including VEKA, DMG Mori, Roche, AstraZeneca, Richemont, Saint-Gobain Aerospace and Mitsubishi Electric. We partner with NVIDIA, PwC, McKinsey, BCG and more than 160 technology partners worldwide. TULIP is part of the World Economic Forum&#39;s Global Innovator community, and our CEO, Dr. Natan Linder, co-chairs the Forum&#39;s Advanced Manufacturing Industry Governors Community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity in DACH for TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DACH is the heart of global manufacturing. Germany is Europe&#39;s largest industrial economy and the birthplace of Industrie 4.0. Switzerland is a global centre for pharma, life sciences and precision manufacturing. Austria is a strong base in automotive, machinery, metals and semiconductors. The region is also home to many of the world&#39;s &quot;Hidden Champions&quot;, mid-sized companies that lead global niche markets. Today, these companies face similar pressures: fewer skilled workers, rising quality and compliance demands, and the need to modernize existing plants without stopping production. TULIP gives their frontline teams an AI-native production system to meet those pressures and accelerate time-to-value. Local customers trust our product in regulated and high-precision environments. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are now hiring a Managing Director (Geschäftsführer, m/w/d) of TULIP GmbH &amp;amp; Commercial Leader for DACH. You will own the DACH region&#39;s growth, lead the local team, and represent TULIP to customers, partners and employees. You will have the backing of a global company and real room to shape how we win in DACH.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Experience &amp;amp; Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience leading and scaling B2B SaaS businesses in the DACH market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading teams in scale-up and/or growth-stage, global environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network and credibility with manufacturing and industrial buyers in Germany, Austria, and Switzerland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of meeting and exceeding quota targets of large, complex enterprise deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using first-class GTM tools such as Salesforce, Outreach, ZoomInfo, Linkedin Sales Navigator or similar tools to execute disciplined forecasting, reporting, and pipeline management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional skills in selling complex, high-value B2B SaaS solutions into manufacturing environments and building a successful team to do the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or Fluent in German and Fluent in English to full business proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the TULIP Gmbh as its Managing Director, setting the tone for culture, operations, and how the local team works with global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the DACH go-to-market growth strategy, in partnership with Commercial Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve ARR growth objectives for the DACH business across verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, qualify, and develop new opportunities with customers; build strong relationships with regional partners, channels, and ecosystem players&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering, Legal, Customer Success and other groups to drive deal execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard, train, and mentor new DACH sales team members as the region grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve sales processes to support regional scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Collaborators:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Commercial Teams (e.g., AEs, Customer Success, Professional Services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Marketing Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working At Tulip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know even great candidates experience imposter syndrome. Even if you don’t match every requirement, applying gives you the opportunity to be considered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a strong, diverse team that values hard work, families, and personal well-being. Benefits of working with us include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct impact on product and culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits package including commuter benefits, learning and development stipend, team events, catered lunches 3 days a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule and unlimited vacation policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, dog-friendly office with diverse and inspiring colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual and in-office global company events and happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. At Tulip, we celebrate all. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status. Help us build an inclusive community that will transform frontline operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note that we may use AI-based tools to support parts of our hiring process. All data processing is carried out in compliance with local data protection laws, ensuring all personal candidate information is handled securely and ethically.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Electronics Repair &amp;amp; Testing Specialist, you will help ensure the quality, functionality, and readiness of electronic devices such as smartphones, tablets, laptops, and consoles. This role involves hands-on functional testing, quality checks, basic troubleshooting, software updates, and carrying out or supporting repairs when needed. The position reports directly to the EVS Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an on-site position at our warehouse in Hamburg.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Functional Testing: Test electronic devices using established processes to assess their functionality, condition, and readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Troubleshooting &amp;amp; Repairs: Identify potential issues during testing and carry out basic repairs or support repair activities when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Quality Control: Assess the condition, functionality, and performance of verified and repaired devices and confirm they meet quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Software Updates &amp;amp; Resets: Update devices, restore them to factory settings, and ensure compliance with data privacy guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document Testing &amp;amp; Repair Results: Accurately record test outcomes, repair needs and actions, device condition, and any remaining defects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Process Improvements: Support the team in improving testing, evaluation, and repair-related workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and Repair Devices: Identify hardware and software issues in smartphones, tablets, laptops, and consoles, and, if needed, carry out repairs using established procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in repairing, refurbishing, evaluating, or testing electronic devices such as smartphones, tablets, laptops, consoles, or similar equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of electronic components, repair tools, testing procedures, and troubleshooting methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with component replacement, functional testing, device diagnostics, and quality control is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with a strong focus on repair quality, testing accuracy, and device functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, flexible, and able to adapt to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to learn, improve repair and testing skills, and share knowledge with colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Life and Disability Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds interesting – you may well be just who we need.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€36.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€43.100 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Wir suchen eine:n Werkstudent:in für medizinische Dokumentation / Tumordokumentation (m/w/d), der:die uns dabei unterstützt, unsere Mission zu erfüllen: das Leben von Menschen zu verbessern und zu verlängern, indem wir aus den Erfahrungen jedes einzelnen Krebspatienten lernen. Bist Du bereit, den Wandel in der Krebsbehandlung aktiv mitzugestalten?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flatiron Health ist ein Healthtech-Unternehmen, das mit Hilfe von Real World Daten (RWD) eine bessere Versorgung von Menschen mit Krebs auf der ganzen Welt ermöglicht. Flatiron arbeitet mit Krebsbehandlungszentren in den USA, Europa und Asien zusammen, um ein modernes, onkologisches Netzwerk zu schaffen und somit die Erfahrungen von einzelnen Patienten in hochqualitative Datensätze zu übersetzen. Wir arbeiten in multidisziplinären Teams mit Expert:innen aus den Bereichen Onkologie, Datenwissenschaft, Software, Epidemiologie, Produkt und vielen anderen mehr. Flatiron Health ist eine unabhängige Tochtergesellschaft der Roche-Gruppe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die Tätigkeit ist 100% remote und kann flexibel von zu Hause in Deutschland aus erbracht werden – ob Du lieber früh morgens, nachmittags oder abends arbeitest, wir möchten Dich unterstützen, die für Dich passenden Arbeitszeiten zu finden, damit sich die Arbeit gut mit Deinem Studium vereinbaren lässt. Die Arbeitszeit kann abhängig von deiner individuellen Studiensituation flexibel gestaltet werden auf bis zu 20 oder 25 Stunden pro Woche.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du dokumentierst unstrukturierte onkologische Patientendaten aus klinischen Krankenhaus- und Arztpraxissystemen in unser eigens dafür entwickeltes Softwaresystem, einschließlich der komplexen Erfassung, Speicherung und Überprüfung von klinischen Diagnose-, Behandlungs- und Nachsorgedaten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst Dein onkologisches Fachwissen ein und erweiterst dies kontinuierlich, um eine detailgetreue und vollständige Dokumentation in einer Vielzahl von klinischen Projekten zu ermöglichen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du gibst direktes Feedback zu neuen Funktionen, Tools und Workflows und trägst damit zur inhaltlichen Weiterentwicklung und Qualitätssicherung unserer Softwarelösungen bei&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt uns dabei, schriftliche Arbeitsanweisungen zur korrekten und einheitlichen Dokumentation stetig weiter zu entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du evaluierst Ansätze zur Dokumentation neuer Datenelemente&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du bist eine engagierte, kooperative und zielorientierte Persönlichkeit, die Freude an der Entwicklung von Lösungen hat und offen für neue Perspektiven ist. Zudem bringst Du mit:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immatrikulation an einer medizinischen Fakultät in Deutschland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abgeschlossenes vorklinisches Medizinstudium&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägtes Interesse an Krebserkrankungen sowie an der Arbeit mit onkologischen Patientendaten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onkologisch-fachliche Vorerfahrung z.B. im Rahmen von Famulaturen, Praktika und anderen klinischen Tätigkeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wünschenswert Grundkenntnisse zu Histologie, Klassifizierungssystemen (TNM, ect) und Therapie onkologischer Erkrankungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Idealerweise Vorerfahrung im Umgang mit Tumordokumentationssystemen (TDS), Datenbanken und Software zur Krebsregistrierung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basis-IT-Kenntnisse (idealerweise Mac OS) und Offenheit für neue Softwarelösungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Kommunikationsfähigkeit, Zuverlässigkeit, Liebe zum Detail, Integrationsfähigkeit sowie ein hohes Maß an Eigeninitiative und Selbstständigkeit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deutsch auf Muttersprachenniveau und gute Englischkenntnisse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You will take partial ownership of the design and delivery of critical software components powering different types of runtime machine learning inference on the PlayStation consoles. This role demands strong technical leadership, driving innovation and advancing the underlying principles and architectures to shape the future of these systems. This also involves being hands-on with the code implementation of these systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You will be collaborating with internal and external groups across the globe to set company-level technology strategies and processes, as well as defining the scope of the project. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;   &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This is a unique and highly senior position at the core of PlayStation technology. Your colleagues in ATG will include the engineers responsible for the rendering and ray tracing libraries, GPU tools, shader compiler, and contributors to the architecture of multiple generations of PlayStation consoles. The role also involves close collaboration with key hardware and software stakeholders, as well as strategic engagement with external vendors. Together, these partnerships enable us to provide system and game developers with the tools and capabilities to push the boundaries of our platforms.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;At least 10 years of experience in a senior engineering role &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Sustained professional history of significant and successful technical contributions, including responsibility for the success of a larger engineering or game project throughout the entire development lifecycle (design/implementation/release/maintenance). &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, organization and problem-solving skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with game console software development and tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;At least 5 years of experience with GPU programming is essential, along with familiarity with GPUs. Fluency in C/C++ and shader languages, with a solid understanding of GPU programming and low-level computing to deliver technical excellence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with machine learning is considered an asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior People Technology Analyst is responsible for leading the design, configuration, and continuous evolution of Workday Human Capital Management (HCM) capabilities as part of SIE’s global People Technology platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role serves as a senior technical leader and functional expert within People Technology Services (PTS), with senior ownership within the Workday Core HCM domain. This role is responsible for system configuration, business process optimization, security administration, custom reporting, and end-user support. Works closely with HR leadership, Payroll, IT, and cross-functional teams to ensure data integrity, streamline employee lifecycle workflows, and maximize the value of the organization’s Workday platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is accountable for ensuring that core HCM solutions are scalable, precise, and aligned with global business requirements, while also contributing to broader Workday platform design and delivery. The role works closely with Human Resources stakeholders to translate policy, regulatory requirements, and business processes into scalable, system-driven solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating within a globally consistent Agile delivery model, this role balances deep domain expertise with cross-platform contribution. The role partners with Product, Integration, Data, and Architecture stakeholders to deliver cohesive, end-to-end solutions and to establish sustainable configuration patterns across the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is suited for individuals who combine deep expertise in Workday HCM with strong systems thinking, technical leadership, and the ability to influence design decisions across a global platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Ownership &amp;amp; Platform Leadership (Core HCM)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior functional and technical lead for the Workday Core HCM domain, leading complex configuration design, system enhancements, and ongoing platform evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and implementation of complex Core HCM solutions in partnership with Human Resources stakeholders, ensuring alignment with business requirements, global standards, regulatory requirements, and operational needs:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and maintain core Workday HCM components, including supervisory organizations, job families, positions, location hierarchies, and worker profiles. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and optimize Workday Business Processes (BPs) (e.g., Hire, Transfer, Promote, Terminate, Job Change) using condition rules and validation logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage domain and business process security policies, ensuring appropriate role-based access control and data privacy compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and enforce configuration design patterns that ensure scalability, reusability, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key technical authority for Core HCM design decisions, guiding trade-offs between business requirements, system capabilities, and long-term platform sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment of HCM and core configurations with global policies, regulatory requirements, and downstream dependencies (e.g., payroll)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design &amp;amp; Delivery Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with Human Resources stakeholders to clarify requirements, challenge assumptions, and guide toward scalable, platform-aligned solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end delivery of complex Workday HCM related initiatives, including design, build, testing, and deployment readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex business rules, policies, and regulatory requirements into structured, scalable system configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership across workstreams, ensuring consistency and quality of solutions delivered by the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and guide analysts in solution design and configuration, ensuring alignment with platform standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Engineering &amp;amp; Cross-Domain Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to broader Workday platform design and configuration across additional domains (e.g., Absence &amp;amp; Leave, Compensation, Talent, Performance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Integration and Data specialists to ensure end-to-end solution integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in platform-level design discussions, influencing architecture, standards, and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions integrate effectively with upstream and downstream systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, Reporting &amp;amp; Downstream Integrity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and oversee reporting solutions and calculated fields supporting core HCM and related processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Workday HCM core data supports HR reporting, compliance, and downstream processes (e.g., payroll and analytics)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data accuracy, integrity, and consistency across Workday configurations and downstream consumers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Reliability &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure reliability and stability of business processes through proactive issue identification and root cause resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify systemic issues and drive structural improvements to platform design and configuration practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives to simplify, standardize, and continuously improve Core HCM configurations, business processes, and data structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to evolving platform standards, governance models, and configuration frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance, Compliance &amp;amp; Standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to global PTS design standards, governance practices, and engineering principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure core HCM configurations meet data privacy, security, and audit requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to documentation standards, testing practices, and release management processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience with enterprise platforms, including significant hands-on experience with Workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated expertise in designing and implementing core HCM solutions, eligibility rules, calculated fields and business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to own and lead complex configuration domains, including defining design patterns and standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of core HCM related business processes across multiple regions and regulatory contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate complex business rules and policies into scalable, maintainable system configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to troubleshoot and resolve complex configuration issues, including calculation logic and system behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience developing Workday reports and Workday Security configuration &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with mass data uploads using Enterprise Interface Builder (EIB) tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple Workday domains and understanding cross-domain dependencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to guide and mentor other analysts in solution design and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with payroll processes and downstream integrations &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to integrations (e.g., EIB, Core Connectors) or inbound/outbound payroll feeds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to platform architecture, standards, or governance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in global, matrixed enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in Workday Core HCM, with the ability to lead complex solution and configuration design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinker who understands cross-domain dependencies, downstream impacts, and the broader People Technology ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at translating complex or ambiguous business requirements, policies, and regulations into scalable, sustainable system solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operates as a senior technical leader who guides others, influences design decisions, and remains hands-on when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted partner to Human Resources stakeholders, with strong consulting, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates strong ownership, sound judgment, and a consistent focus on data integrity, platform reliability, and high-quality outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a global, evolving environment, with the ability to influence beyond immediate responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Solutions Engineer at Diligent, you will play a critical role in supporting complex and enterprise pre-sales engagements by designing, prototyping, and demonstrating tailored GRC solutions. You will partner closely with Sales, Customer Success, Product, and Professional Services to translate sophisticated customer requirements into compelling technical solutions that accelerate deal velocity and drive technical wins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys hands-on technical work, customer-facing problem solving, and building prototypes and automations that showcase how modern GRC platforms integrate into enterprise ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role operates on a hybrid model, with 50% office-based work required and is open to candidates based in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regrettably we are unable to provide visa sponsorship, so you must be eligible to work in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales Technical Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, and other members of the Solutions team to support mid-market and enterprise GRC opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical pre-sales win for assigned deals, including solution validation, design, and risk mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver tailored demos, technical deep dives, and proof-of-concepts (POCs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Prototyping &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build demo prototypes, automation scripts, and integration examples using languages such as Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop solutions and workflows to demonstrate:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;o Data ingestion and transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;o API-based integrations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;o Process automation and orchestration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage REST APIs to integrate Diligent with third-party enterprise systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert at using AI and applying it to solution delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex GRC use cases into clear, value-driven technical narratives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare demo assets, technical diagrams, and supporting materials for customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently present to technical, business, and executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product Management to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;o Stay current on new capabilities and roadmap&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;o Provide structured feedback from customer engagements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing on webinars, conferences, and thought-leadership initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal enablement by sharing reusable demo assets and technical patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Experience/Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a customer-facing technical role within B2B SaaS or enterprise software, such as Pre-Sales Engineering, Technical Consulting, Solutions Architecture, Software Implementation, or Integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Python, including experience with REST APIs, data handling and transformation, and automation scripts and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with common Python libraries, such as Pandas and Requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to workflow automation platforms, data pipelines and ETL processes, security tooling, and either audit or compliance tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building demo environments or reusable technical tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise or regulated customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging with senior stakeholders and complex buying committees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to balance technical depth with business value articulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive, and comfortable operating in fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Experience/Skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a Governance, Risk, Compliance, Audit environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GRC platforms, regulated industries, or enterprise data workflows is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-SK2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Diligent is the AI leader in governance, risk and compliance (GRC) SaaS solutions, helping more than 1 million users and 700,000 board members to clarify risk and elevate governance. The Diligent One Platform gives practitioners, the C-Suite and the board a consolidated view of their entire GRC practice so they can more effectively manage risk, build greater resilience and make better decisions, faster.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Diligent, we&#39;re building the future with people who think boldly and move fast. &amp;nbsp;Whether you&#39;re designing systems that leverage large language models or part of a team reimaging workflows with AI, you&#39;ll help us unlock entirely new ways of working and thinking. &amp;nbsp;Curiosity is in our DNA, we look for individuals willing to ask the big questions and experiment fearlessly - those who embrace change not as a challenge, but as an opportunity. &amp;nbsp;The future belongs to those who keep learning, and we are building it together. &amp;nbsp;At Diligent, you’re not just building the future - you’re an agent of positive change, joining a global community on a mission to make an impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;diligent.com or follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA170dad44-6a69-e1e1-d720-601cd59ec77c&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/diligent-board-member-services/mycompany/verification/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;c606bc91-5052-4d3a-a1d1-ed00ede365d9&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA153deb8c-7641-f6fc-97cb-65df680002a3&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/DiligentCorporation/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;07f4e461-6294-4482-a624-e58c27cd6199&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;2&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Diligent Offers You&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creativity is ingrained in our culture.&lt;/strong&gt; We are innovative collaborators by nature. We thrive in exploring how things can be differently both in our internal processes and to help our clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care about our people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Diligent offers a flexible work environment, global days of service, comprehensive health benefits, meeting free days, generous time off policy and wellness programs&amp;nbsp;to name a few&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have teams all over the world&lt;/strong&gt;. We may be headquartered in New York City, but we have office hubs in Washington D.C., Vancouver, London, Galway, Budapest, Munich, Bengaluru, Singapore, and Sydney.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity is important to us.&lt;/strong&gt; Growing, maintaining and promoting a diverse team is a top priority for us. We foster and encourage diversity through our Employee Resource Groups and provide access to resources and education to support the education of our team, facilitate dialogue, and foster understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diligent created the modern governance movement. Our world-changing idea is to empower leaders with the technology, insights and connections they need to drive greater impact and accountability – to lead with purpose. Our employees are passionate, smart, and creative people who not only want to help build the software company of the future, but who want to make the world a more sustainable, equitable and better place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in New York, Diligent has offices in Washington D.C.,&amp;nbsp; London, Galway, Budapest, Vancouver, Bengaluru, Munich, Singapore and Sydney.  &amp;nbsp;To foster strong collaboration and connection, this role will follow a hybrid work model. If you are within a commuting distance to one of our Diligent office locations, you will be expected to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;work onsite at least 50% of the time.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe that in-person engagement helps drive innovation, teamwork, and a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Diligent is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based on race, color, religious creed, sex, national origin, ancestry, citizenship status, pregnancy, childbirth, physical disability, mental disability, age, military status, protected veteran status, marital status, registered domestic partner or civil union status, gender (including sex stereotyping and gender identity or expression), medical condition (including, but not limited to, cancer related or HIV/AIDS related), genetic information, or sexual orientation in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&amp;nbsp;We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. See also&amp;nbsp;Diligent&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/company/eeo-policy&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;5e90c823-c220-4ada-92af-0b9df69068d6&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;4&quot;&gt;EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;5&quot;&gt;US EEOC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;6&quot;&gt;’&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;7&quot;&gt;s Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;. We are a drug free workplace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, you may contact us at -----
&lt;div&gt;To support a fair and consistent hiring&amp;nbsp;process, we use AI&amp;nbsp;and digital automated tools to assist our recruitment team in organizing candidate data, surfacing relevant applications, coordinating&amp;nbsp;interview scheduling and summarizing interview notes. All final screening, evaluation, and hiring decisions are made by humans on our team. To learn more about how we collect, protect, and process your information, please review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/legal/candidate-privacy&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;48c7a45d-2b3c-4bc9-99ec-639351abe71c&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Diligent, we recognize the value of a diverse global workforce. Visa sponsorship may be available for select positions based on business needs and specific role requirements. Sponsorship decisions are evaluated on a case-by-case basis, and eligibility should not be assumed for all opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment agencies:&lt;/strong&gt; Diligent does not accept unsolicited agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to our jobs alias, Diligent employees or any other organization location. Diligent is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a skilled and detail-oriented company secretary to joint our UK based team as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior&amp;nbsp;Corporate Services Associate&lt;/strong&gt;. This is an exciting opportunity to work with a diverse portfolio of international clients, leading on the delivery of high quality corporate secretarial and compliance services across multiple jurisdictions. As primary day-to-day contact for our clients, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring compliance and building strong, trusted relationships that span the globe.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as lead client contact for assigned clients and coordinate the delivery of company secretarial services in collaboration with in-country experts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond promptly and professionally to client queries and requests, ensuring exceptional service and client satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor deadlines and ensure ongoing compliance with statutory and regulatory requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and file statutory documents including annual returns, confirmation statements, and regulatory filings with Companies House.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and review board resolutions, minutes, and other corporate documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain data and document storage within Diligent Entities software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support junior members of the team in developing their knowledge and skills base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams and external partners to ensure seamless service delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong organisational, analytical, and problem-solving skills to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3 years of experience in corporate secretarial or corporate services roles, ideally with international exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of UK company law, corporate governance principles, and global compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong document drafting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of corporate structures and statutory obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and commitment to accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, professional verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead client engagements and work independently whilst managing multiple client priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional, client-focused mindset with discretion in handling confidential information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable, curious, and eager to learn in a growing, evolving function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, experience in using Diligent Entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree-level education or equivalent relevant work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Diligent is the AI leader in governance, risk and compliance (GRC) SaaS solutions, helping more than 1 million users and 700,000 board members to clarify risk and elevate governance. The Diligent One Platform gives practitioners, the C-Suite and the board a consolidated view of their entire GRC practice so they can more effectively manage risk, build greater resilience and make better decisions, faster.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Diligent, we&#39;re building the future with people who think boldly and move fast. &amp;nbsp;Whether you&#39;re designing systems that leverage large language models or part of a team reimaging workflows with AI, you&#39;ll help us unlock entirely new ways of working and thinking. &amp;nbsp;Curiosity is in our DNA, we look for individuals willing to ask the big questions and experiment fearlessly - those who embrace change not as a challenge, but as an opportunity. &amp;nbsp;The future belongs to those who keep learning, and we are building it together. &amp;nbsp;At Diligent, you’re not just building the future - you’re an agent of positive change, joining a global community on a mission to make an impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;diligent.com or follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA170dad44-6a69-e1e1-d720-601cd59ec77c&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/diligent-board-member-services/mycompany/verification/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;c606bc91-5052-4d3a-a1d1-ed00ede365d9&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA153deb8c-7641-f6fc-97cb-65df680002a3&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/DiligentCorporation/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;07f4e461-6294-4482-a624-e58c27cd6199&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;2&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Diligent Offers You&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creativity is ingrained in our culture.&lt;/strong&gt; We are innovative collaborators by nature. We thrive in exploring how things can be differently both in our internal processes and to help our clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care about our people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Diligent offers a flexible work environment, global days of service, comprehensive health benefits, meeting free days, generous time off policy and wellness programs&amp;nbsp;to name a few&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have teams all over the world&lt;/strong&gt;. We may be headquartered in New York City, but we have office hubs in Washington D.C., Vancouver, London, Galway, Budapest, Munich, Bengaluru, Singapore, and Sydney.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity is important to us.&lt;/strong&gt; Growing, maintaining and promoting a diverse team is a top priority for us. We foster and encourage diversity through our Employee Resource Groups and provide access to resources and education to support the education of our team, facilitate dialogue, and foster understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diligent created the modern governance movement. Our world-changing idea is to empower leaders with the technology, insights and connections they need to drive greater impact and accountability – to lead with purpose. Our employees are passionate, smart, and creative people who not only want to help build the software company of the future, but who want to make the world a more sustainable, equitable and better place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in New York, Diligent has offices in Washington D.C.,&amp;nbsp; London, Galway, Budapest, Vancouver, Bengaluru, Munich, Singapore and Sydney.  &amp;nbsp;To foster strong collaboration and connection, this role will follow a hybrid work model. If you are within a commuting distance to one of our Diligent office locations, you will be expected to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;work onsite at least 50% of the time.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe that in-person engagement helps drive innovation, teamwork, and a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Diligent is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based on race, color, religious creed, sex, national origin, ancestry, citizenship status, pregnancy, childbirth, physical disability, mental disability, age, military status, protected veteran status, marital status, registered domestic partner or civil union status, gender (including sex stereotyping and gender identity or expression), medical condition (including, but not limited to, cancer related or HIV/AIDS related), genetic information, or sexual orientation in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&amp;nbsp;We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. See also&amp;nbsp;Diligent&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/company/eeo-policy&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;5e90c823-c220-4ada-92af-0b9df69068d6&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;4&quot;&gt;EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;5&quot;&gt;US EEOC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;6&quot;&gt;’&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;7&quot;&gt;s Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;. We are a drug free workplace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, you may contact us at -----
&lt;div&gt;To support a fair and consistent hiring&amp;nbsp;process, we use AI&amp;nbsp;and digital automated tools to assist our recruitment team in organizing candidate data, surfacing relevant applications, coordinating&amp;nbsp;interview scheduling and summarizing interview notes. All final screening, evaluation, and hiring decisions are made by humans on our team. To learn more about how we collect, protect, and process your information, please review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/legal/candidate-privacy&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;48c7a45d-2b3c-4bc9-99ec-639351abe71c&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Diligent, we recognize the value of a diverse global workforce. Visa sponsorship may be available for select positions based on business needs and specific role requirements. Sponsorship decisions are evaluated on a case-by-case basis, and eligibility should not be assumed for all opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment agencies:&lt;/strong&gt; Diligent does not accept unsolicited agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to our jobs alias, Diligent employees or any other organization location. Diligent is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB ID: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FEQ327R160&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London, United Kingdom&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport-Industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dina Hussain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sr. Solutions Architect, you are an expert-level technical leader responsible for the organisation&#39;s most complex customer engagements. You drive consumption strategy, own executive-level relationships, and serve as the definitive technical authority for your accounts. You have declared your archetype—a recognised technical specialisation that makes you a force multiplier across your team and region. You operate at the intersection of deep technical expertise, strategic account planning, and executive influence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical and consumption strategy for the organisation&#39;s most complex customer engagements, directly influencing platform adoption and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own senior-level technical relationships — serving as a trusted advisor on enterprise data and AI strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the most complex architecture engagements: multi-workload platforms, enterprise-wide migrations, real-time systems, and AI/ML at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as an Expert on the Databricks Platform with a declared archetype — actively mentoring others and driving horizontal impact across your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute competitive strategies for your customers, positioning Databricks against incumbent and emerging platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate cross-functional teams (DSAs, SSAs, Partners, Product) to deliver enterprise-grade solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop junior SAs (L3–L5) on technical depth, customer engagement, and use case prioritisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Field Engineering thought leadership through customer-facing content, workshops, and community engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in solutions architecture, principal engineering, technical pre-sales leadership, or a senior customer-facing technical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level coding proficiency — Python, SQL, and ideally Spark/PySpark. You will complete a live coding assessment and a platform build during the interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in enterprise data architecture: distributed systems at scale, streaming/real-time, lakehouse design patterns, data governance frameworks, and cloud-native platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level Databricks Platform knowledge (or equivalent depth in competing platforms with demonstrated rapid learning ability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Declared technical specialisation with recognised depth — e.g., real-time architectures, ML/AI platforms, data governance, large-scale migrations, or industry-specific solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving consumption growth and platform adoption in large accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence — ability to influence Directors, VPs, and C-level stakeholders on long-term data and AI strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading competitive displacements and complex enterprise evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic thinking — connecting technical architecture decisions to business outcomes and revenue impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a quantitative discipline (or equivalent experience); advanced degrees are valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at Databricks, Snowflake, AWS, Google, Microsoft, or a top-tier data/AI company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Published thought leadership (blogs, conference talks, open source contributions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry vertical expertise with executive-level domain credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Process:&lt;/strong&gt; Recruiter Screen → Hiring Manager Screen → Design and Architecture Interview → Live Coding Assessment → Build, Demo, Pitch! Presentation → Reference Check&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are passionate about enabling data teams to solve the world&#39;s toughest problems. Our customers leverage the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform to power their mission critical Data and AI applications to improve how their organisations leverage data and insights to make better decisions, faster. Customers rely on Databricks for the full range of data workloads, including data engineering, ETL, near real-time streaming, machine learning, SQL analytics, and advanced analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Architect (EDW Migrations) executes on Databricks’ strategic product lines to develop, establish and drive product adoption and product market fit to grow customer adoption across EMEA. By working with leadership, product and direct account teams, you will jointly engage customers, foster the necessary relationships and position &lt;em&gt;in-depth&lt;/em&gt; approaches to migrating their EDW to the Databricks Intelligence Platform. You will develop the appropriate approach, the guardrails, and the steps needed for customers to successfully deliver on their business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Architect (EDW Migrations) is paired with Product Specialists for Data and Governance. Together, you will devise and implement a strategy across key accounts, develop presentations, demos and other assets, and with account teams deliver them such that the field and customers make informed decisions on adoption strategy and its implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Regional Migration Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with EMEA GTM leadership and account teams to design and drive the technical GTM and adoption strategy for large-scale EDW migrations to the Databricks Intelligence Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Programmatic and Scalable Migration Processes: &lt;/strong&gt;Architect and continuously refine programmatic assets and detailed technical guides that enable field teams and partners to execute migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Integrate Assessment Tooling: &lt;/strong&gt;Help&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;maintain, enhance, and direct the development of automated assessment tools from customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Tier-3 Technical Championship: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the ultimate technical escalation point for highly complex, strategic, or stalled migrations in must-win accounts across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable and Scale the Regional teams: &lt;/strong&gt;Scale the presales migration practice by mentoring and coaching the EMEA community of Solutions Architects (SAs) and Specialist SAs (SSAs) to ensure scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge Field Insights and Product R&amp;amp;D: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as a primary technical feedback loop to Product Management and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish Industry Thought Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Author whitepapers, publish technical blogs, and deliver high-impact presentations at public forums (such as the Data + AI Summit) to position the Databricks Intelligence Platform as the premier platform for enterprise database modernization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Handle the most complex technical challenges&lt;/strong&gt; in this product line by acting as the tier-3 escalation point for the field, ensuring customer success in mission-critical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ Years of Customer-Facing Experience in a customer-facing pre-sales, architect, or consulting role influencing technical executives (CIOs, CISOs, DBAs, and Platform Leads) and driving high-level database modernization strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legacy Data Warehouse &amp;amp; Modernization Architecture understanding of legacy EDW systems (any of Teradata, Netezza, Snowflake, Synapse, Redshift, and Exadata) and architectures required to successfully transition workloads to the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of migration migrations scope &amp;amp; progression taking customers from EDW to the full capabilities of the Data Intelligence Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated competence in the Lakehouse architecture including hands-on experience with Apache Spark, Python and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills; both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public Cloud Architecting: Hands-on experience designing and implementing big data architectures within major public cloud environments (AWS, Azure, or GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Enablement &amp;amp; Community Mentorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with Professional Services and Global Systems Integrators to standardize migration delivery methodologies and ensure smooth handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a New Business Solutions Architect, you’ll be a trusted advisor to GitLab prospects in the EMEA region, helping them understand how GitLab’s DevSecOps platform addresses both technical requirements and business objectives across the entire software development lifecycle. You’ll guide organizations through their digital transformation journeys, from planning through monitoring, using your technical expertise, understanding of cloud and modern software development practices, and strong customer empathy. Reporting to a regional Solutions Architect manager and partnering closely with New Business Account Executives and cross-functional teams, you’ll own technical evaluations (including proof of value initiatives and workshops), shape solution architectures, and serve as the voice of the customer back to Product Management. In your first year, you’ll focus on driving successful platform adoption, influencing revenue growth through solution selling, and building long-term, trust-based relationships that showcase GitLab’s differentiated position in an AI-driven DevSecOps landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery, demos, and validation (including proofs of value) to show how GitLab’s AI-powered DevSecOps platform meets customers’ technical and business needs across the full lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical evaluation process as the Directly Responsible Individual, including solution design, POC/POV ownership, workshop design, and the technical components of tenders, audits, and value stream assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with New Business Account Executives and regional sales teams in EMEA to shape and execute account strategies that support new customer acquisition and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deepen relationships with technical practitioners and business leaders, guiding them through GitLab-driven digital transformation and enabling them to become GitLab advocates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise customers on modern software development, continuous integration, continuous deployment, security, and cloud practices, challenging existing approaches to improve return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the voice of the customer with Product Management, Engineering, Sales, and Marketing by sharing feedback, use cases, and competitive insights that inform roadmap and positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and extend your technical expertise in GitLab, DevSecOps, AI, and related cloud technologies, creating reusable examples, best practice guidance, and technical collateral for customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your own growth and development through ongoing learning, mentorship, and knowledge sharing to continuously improve the impact of the Solutions Architect team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging with customers in technical pre-sales, consulting, or similar roles, guiding them through solution design and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with the end-to-end software development lifecycle, including modern DevSecOps practices and continuous integration and continuous deployment workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with GitLab or comparable source control, CI/CD, and collaboration platforms, and the ability to map platform capabilities to customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of cloud computing concepts and related technologies, with the ability to discuss deployment, security, and operations options with technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead technical evaluations such as proofs of concept or proofs of value, contribute to tenders or audits, and design and run workshops or value stream assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear technical communication and presentation skills, with the ability to adapt messages for practitioners through to senior business and technical decision makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill in building trusted relationships, listening with empathy, and acting as a customer advocate to internal teams such as Product, Engineering, Sales, and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation to continuously develop professionally, including learning new technologies, deepening GitLab platform expertise, and applying transferable experience from related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We, the Solutions Architect team, are part of GitLab’s Sales organization and serve as the technical counterpart to Account Executives, with this role focused on opportunities and reporting into a regional Solutions Architect Manager. Our mission is to help customers realize the full value of GitLab’s AI-powered DevSecOps platform by advising on architecture, running technical evaluations such as proofs of value, and guiding customers through their digital transformation. We work closely with Sales, Product Management, Engineering, and Marketing, collaborating asynchronously across regions to share best practices, create reusable technical collateral, and act as the voice of the customer. We are focused on helping customers modernize end-to-end software delivery, adopt GitLab at scale, and navigate a rapidly evolving AI and DevSecOps landscape.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The SMB New Business Account Executive role is a critical role in building GitLab’s customer-base and continued long-term growth. The SMB New Business Account Executive will focus exclusively on acquiring new customers and generating new logos by executing on an inbound/outbound sales playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will own a territory and book of prospect accounts (including free GitLab users, trials, engaged leads and cold prospects). You will navigate it by leveraging data, developing a deep understanding of the product, the market, customer challenges and business needs. You will strategically build relationships with your accounts and lead a consultative sales cycle by painting the vision of DevSecOps with GitLab and helping them achieve business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role for someone who is competitive, self-starter and hungry, who is excited by forming new motions, thrives in a hunter environment and is energized by building relationships and business cases from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive selling into free users and base prospects within the SMB segment by articulating the value of GitLab. Engaging with inbound prospect and proactively reaching out to prospects showing potential and key signals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, co-create and consistently iterate on the outbound / new logo playbook and strategy to win new customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce and execute against new creative prospecting and campaign ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of and act as the CEO for the book of business in your territory:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document the buying criteria &amp;amp; process, next steps &amp;amp; owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute comprehensive prospecting strategies to build and maintain a healthy pipeline of new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work and collaborate with our Partner ecosystem to drive new business and value for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize business and industry knowledge to research accounts, identify key players, generate interest, create/identify compelling events, and develop accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle from initial contact to close by involving technical audience, multiple stakeholders and decision-makers, and articulating GitLab’s value proposition to across various industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master MEDPICC and Command of the Message on all opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams including Sales Development, Solution Architecture and Digital Marketing to develop winning strategies in targeting accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to root cause analyses on wins/losses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate lessons learned to the team, including the marketing team, the technical team and product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback: Effectively communicate learnings, feedback and challenges to relevant teams (including Product Development, Sales, and Marketing) to drive continuous improvement, and be the voice of the prospect by contributing product ideas to our public issue tracker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to documenting improvements in our sales handbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market knowledge: Maintain a foundational understanding of technologies related to GitLab’s market focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training &amp;amp; Certifications: Acquire industry standard certifications to build up credibility as a technical expert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieving monthly and quarterly new logo acquisition targets, for both new logo count and booked ARR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You share our values, and work in accordance with those values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter with a proven track record of resilience, motivation and results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of outbound sales activity, securing calls, meeting and winning business, with a creative ability to break into new accounts and build business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator, strong interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent discovery skills, ability to uncover and address customer pain points, negotiation, presentation and closing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated progressive experience in sales, technical consulting, customer success, marketing, or customer service in the field of information technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of B2B software, Open Source software, and the developer product space is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern sales tech stack including Salesforce, Clari, Outreach, ZoomInfo/Cognism, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Gong, and 6sense&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of application lifecycle management including the technology commonly used in application lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be ready to learn how to use GitLab and Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focuses on continuously improving your professional skills with a focus on personal mastery and team learning through activities such as training, reading and seeking mentorship from others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in another language ie. French, German, Spanish, Dutch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel if needed and comply with the company’s travel policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CM1&lt;/p&gt;
