&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable presenting to groups, both on the phone and in person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be available to travel within the assigned region as directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a self-starter with the ability to learn new technologies quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
