&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;you:&amp;nbsp;Our&amp;nbsp;new Senior Display &amp;amp; Native Expert&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;looking&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;experienced&amp;nbsp;professional&amp;nbsp;with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Higher&amp;nbsp;Professional&amp;nbsp;Education&amp;nbsp;(HBO) or University (WO) level of&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;thinking,&amp;nbsp;preferably&amp;nbsp;in a relevant field&amp;nbsp;such&amp;nbsp;as Marketing, Communication, or Business Administration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
