&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent analytical and strategic skills: you love diving into data,&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;trends, and converting insights into concrete actions and client advice that take campaigns to the next level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A&amp;nbsp;proactive&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;result-driven&amp;nbsp;attitude,&amp;nbsp;always&amp;nbsp;looking&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;opportunities,&amp;nbsp;innovations,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;optimizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A&amp;nbsp;true&amp;nbsp;team player&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;enjoys&amp;nbsp;sharing&amp;nbsp;knowledge&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;guiding&amp;nbsp;colleagues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make an impact with data, technology, and creativity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Are you an experienced Display &amp;amp; Native Specialist who looks beyond campaign performance and is passionate about driving client results, innovation, and team development? Apply now and grow with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
