&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bij WPP Media zijn we het wereldwijde mediacollectief van WPP, volledig gebouwd voor het AI-tijdperk. We bundelen het beste platform, de meest getalenteerde mensen en de sterkste partners om innovatieve oplossingen te creëren. Ons doel? Merken elke dag ongeëvenaarde groei bieden. Dit fundament vinden we in onze gedeelde kernwaarden:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We verleggen grenzen, dagen het gewone denken uit en doorbreken de status-quo in ons streven naar innovatie en groei.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Open:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We bouwen vertrouwen en begrip door naadloos samen te werken – met onze teams, klanten en partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Optimistisch:&lt;/strong&gt; Een &#39;growth mindset&#39; zit in ons DNA. We omarmen verandering als dé manier om het beste uit onszelf te halen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ben jij klaar om de digitale marketingwereld te veroveren, gestuurd door data en geavanceerde AI-technologie? Bij WPP Media zoeken we voor ons dynamische team in Eindhoven een gedreven &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior Display &amp;amp; Native Specialist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; die mee wil bouwen aan én de leiding wil nemen over de meest innovatieve digitale campagnes voor topmerken zoals Volkswagen, Rabobank, Kruidvat en Eneco. Dit is jouw kans om jouw expertise in te zetten en te excelleren in een van de meest geavanceerde marketingdomeinen, met een focus op programmatic inkoop, strategie en de nieuwste ontwikkelingen op het gebied van Display &amp;amp; Native Advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Als expert in programmatic&amp;nbsp;inkoop&amp;nbsp;voorzie&amp;nbsp;je&amp;nbsp;onze&amp;nbsp;klanten&amp;nbsp;van&amp;nbsp;een&amp;nbsp;ongekende&amp;nbsp;impact,&amp;nbsp;creativiteit&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;data-inzicht.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Concreet betekent dit:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Meer impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Je&amp;nbsp;ontwikkelt&amp;nbsp;geavanceerde&amp;nbsp;targetingstrategieën&amp;nbsp;om&amp;nbsp;doelgroepen&amp;nbsp;op het hele internet&amp;nbsp;optimaal&amp;nbsp;te&amp;nbsp;bereiken.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Meer&amp;nbsp;creativiteit:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Je&amp;nbsp;adviseert&amp;nbsp;over&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;werkt&amp;nbsp;met&amp;nbsp;interactieve&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;dynamische&amp;nbsp;advertenties&amp;nbsp;die perfect&amp;nbsp;aansluiten&amp;nbsp;op de content&amp;nbsp;waarin&amp;nbsp;ze&amp;nbsp;verschijnen,&amp;nbsp;voor&amp;nbsp;maximale&amp;nbsp;engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Meer data &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;optimalisatie:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Je&amp;nbsp;hebt&amp;nbsp;toegang&amp;nbsp;tot&amp;nbsp;diepgaande&amp;nbsp;analyses,&amp;nbsp;stuurt&amp;nbsp;op&amp;nbsp;ingewikkelde&amp;nbsp;datastructuren&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;kunt&amp;nbsp;slimmer&amp;nbsp;targeten&amp;nbsp;op basis van&amp;nbsp;gedrag,&amp;nbsp;intentie&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;context, wat&amp;nbsp;leidt&amp;nbsp;tot&amp;nbsp;maximale&amp;nbsp;resultaten.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Wat ga je&amp;nbsp;doen&amp;nbsp;als&amp;nbsp;Senior Display &amp;amp; Native Specialist?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Als&amp;nbsp;onze&amp;nbsp;Senior Display &amp;amp; Native Specialist&amp;nbsp;duik&amp;nbsp;je&amp;nbsp;diep&amp;nbsp;in de&amp;nbsp;wereld&amp;nbsp;van online&amp;nbsp;adverteren. Je bent de&amp;nbsp;spil&amp;nbsp;in het&amp;nbsp;succes&amp;nbsp;van&amp;nbsp;digitale&amp;nbsp;campagnes&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;jouw&amp;nbsp;taken&amp;nbsp;omvatten:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Het&amp;nbsp;strategisch&amp;nbsp;plannen,&amp;nbsp;bouwen,&amp;nbsp;monitoren,&amp;nbsp;analyseren&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;optimaliseren&amp;nbsp;van&amp;nbsp;complexe&amp;nbsp;programmatic Display &amp;amp; Native&amp;nbsp;campagnes&amp;nbsp;op diverse platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Het vertalen van complexe data naar heldere inzichten, strategische klantadviezen en concrete optimalisatiestappen, met als doel de campagneprestaties continu te verbeteren.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Actief&amp;nbsp;bijdragen&amp;nbsp;aan&amp;nbsp;de&amp;nbsp;groei&amp;nbsp;van&amp;nbsp;ons&amp;nbsp;vakgebied&amp;nbsp;door het&amp;nbsp;voortouw&amp;nbsp;te&amp;nbsp;nemen&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;nieuwe&amp;nbsp;ideeën,&amp;nbsp;innovatieve&amp;nbsp;experimenten&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;het&amp;nbsp;toepassen&amp;nbsp;van de&amp;nbsp;nieuwste&amp;nbsp;technologieën.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Het&amp;nbsp;inhoudelijk&amp;nbsp;begeleiden&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;coachen&amp;nbsp;van junior&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;medior&amp;nbsp;collega’s&amp;nbsp;binnen&amp;nbsp;het team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
