&lt;li&gt;Through a combination of inbound and outbound leads, develop and manage leads funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage business and track opportunities through CRM and other supporting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on and improve all aspects of the sales cycle, including product, support, and sales engineering&lt;/li&gt;
