&lt;li&gt;Experience in a programming language (e.g. Python, Matlab or C++)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-class quantitative and analytical skills, with excellent attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in financial markets (no prior knowledge or experience is required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
