&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with one or more of Python, TypeScript, Go, or Rust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience building developer platforms, internal tooling, or platform-as-a-product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the Model Context Protocol (MCP), agent orchestration, RAG, or context engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
