&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Senior FPGA Developer is expected to have the following qualifications and experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
